return <<<'SQL'
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Prikolice svih namena na jednom mestu: auto-prikolice za prevoz tereta, čamaca i motocikala, kamp prikolice i kamperi za putovanja. Oglase postavljaju vlasnici i firme iz cele Srbije, a vrstu prikolice birate u filteru. Ako tražite vozilo koje će je vući, pogledajte [kombije i radna vozila](/oglasi/vozila/kamioni-i-kombiji) ili [polovne automobile](/oglasi/vozila/automobili).

Pre kupovine proverite nosivost i najveću dozvoljenu masu, stanje osovine, guma i kočnica, ispravnost svetala i da li je prikolica registrovana. Kod kamp prikolica obratite pažnju na vlagu u zidovima i podu, instalacije i predšator. U oglasu navedite godište, dimenzije tovarnog prostora i nosivost, a gume za prikolicu potražite u kategoriji [gume i felne](/oglasi/vozila/gume-i-felne).', text_en = 'Trailers for every purpose in one place: car trailers for cargo, boats and motorcycles, caravans and campervans for travelling. Ads come from owners and companies across Serbia, and you choose the type of trailer in the filter. If you need a vehicle to tow it, see [vans and work vehicles](/oglasi/vozila/kamioni-i-kombiji) or [used cars](/oglasi/vozila/automobili).

Before buying, check the payload and the maximum permitted weight, the condition of the axle, tyres and brakes, the lights and whether the trailer is registered. With caravans, look for damp in the walls and floor and check the installations and the awning. In your ad, state the year, the size of the load bed and the payload; tyres for a trailer are in [tyres and wheels](/oglasi/vozila/gume-i-felne).' WHERE slug = 'trailers' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Polovni kamioni, kombiji, autobusi i druga radna vozila za prevoz robe i putnika: od malih dostavnih kombija do kipera i tegljača. Filter po vrsti vozila, gorivu, menjaču i godištu brzo sužava ponudu, a posebno možete izdvojiti vozila koja se prodaju na rate ili lizing. Priključna vozila su u kategoriji [prikolice](/oglasi/vozila/prikolice).

Kod teretnih vozila kilometraža govori manje od načina održavanja: tražite servisnu dokumentaciju, proverite kvačilo, šasiju i tovarni prostor i uporedite nosivost i broj sedišta sa onim što piše u saobraćajnoj dozvoli. Delove za popravku naći ćete među oglasima za [auto delove](/oglasi/vozila/auto-delovi), a ako vam vozilo treba samo za jednu turu, tu su [selidbe i prevoz](/oglasi/usluge/selidbe-i-prevoz).', text_en = 'Used trucks, vans, buses and other work vehicles for carrying goods and passengers: from small delivery vans to tippers and tractor units. Filters by vehicle type, fuel, gearbox and year narrow the offer quickly, and you can single out vehicles sold on instalments or leasing. Towed vehicles are in [trailers](/oglasi/vozila/prikolice).

With commercial vehicles the mileage says less than the way they were maintained: ask for service records, check the clutch, the chassis and the load area, and compare the payload and number of seats with the registration certificate. Spare parts are among the ads for [car parts](/oglasi/vozila/auto-delovi), and if you need a vehicle for a single trip, there is [removals and transport](/oglasi/usluge/selidbe-i-prevoz).' WHERE slug = 'trucks-vans' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Auto oprema za svaki automobil: patosnice i presvlake, krovni nosači i koferi, nosači za bicikle, lanci za sneg, auto radio, kamere i navigacija, punjači i držači za telefon, kao i auto kozmetika za pranje i poliranje. Dosta opreme je novo ili jedva korišćeno, jer se prodaje posle zamene automobila.

Pre kupovine proverite da li oprema odgovara vašem modelu: krovni nosači i patosnice prave se po meri vozila, a kod auto radija važni su dimenzije i priključci. U oglasu napišite za koji model je oprema i u kakvom je stanju. Rezervne delove tražite u kategoriji [auto delovi](/oglasi/vozila/auto-delovi), točkove u [gume i felne](/oglasi/vozila/gume-i-felne), a sedišta za decu među [auto-sedištima](/oglasi/deca/auto-sedista).', text_en = 'Car accessories for every car: floor mats and seat covers, roof racks and roof boxes, bike carriers, snow chains, car stereos, dash cams and sat navs, phone chargers and holders, plus car care products for washing and polishing. Much of it is new or barely used, sold after a change of car.

Before buying, make sure the accessory fits your model: roof racks and floor mats are made to measure, and with car stereos the size and connectors matter. In your ad, say which model the accessory is for and what condition it is in. Look for spare parts in [car parts](/oglasi/vozila/auto-delovi), wheels in [tyres and wheels](/oglasi/vozila/gume-i-felne), and child seats among [car seats](/oglasi/deca/auto-sedista).' WHERE slug = 'car-accessories' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Polovni čamci i plovila za reku, jezero i more: plastični, drveni i aluminijumski čamci, gumeni čamci, gliseri i jahte, kao i vanbrodski motori. Vrstu plovila birate u filteru, a u oglasima su navedeni dužina i godište. Prikolicu za prevoz čamca potražite među [prikolicama](/oglasi/vozila/prikolice).

Pri pregledu najpre pogledajte trup: pukotine i osmozu kod plastike, trulež kod drveta i šavove kod gumenih čamaca. Motor obavezno probajte u vodi i pitajte za broj radnih sati i poslednji servis. Raspitajte se i da li je čamac upisan i ima li plovidbenu dozvolu, jer se ona prenosi na novog vlasnika. Pribor za ribolov je u kategoriji [ribolov](/oglasi/sport/ribolov), a daske, kajaci i prsluci u [sportovima na vodi](/oglasi/sport/vodeni-sportovi).', text_en = 'Used boats for rivers, lakes and the sea: fibreglass, wooden and aluminium boats, inflatables, speedboats and yachts, as well as outboard motors. You choose the type of boat in the filter, and the ads state the length and the year. A trailer to carry the boat can be found among [trailers](/oglasi/vozila/prikolice).

When inspecting, start with the hull: cracks and osmosis on fibreglass, rot on wood and the seams on inflatables. Always test the engine in the water and ask about running hours and the last service. Also ask whether the boat is registered and has a navigation licence, as it passes to the new owner. Fishing tackle is in [fishing](/oglasi/sport/ribolov), and boards, kayaks and life jackets in [water sports](/oglasi/sport/vodeni-sportovi).' WHERE slug = 'boats' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Moto oprema za vozače i suvozače: kacige, jakne, pantalone, rukavice i čizme sa protektorima, kao i delovi i dodaci za motocikle i skutere. Veličinu i vrstu opreme birate u filteru, pa brzo stižete do onoga što vam odgovara.

Kaciga je najvažniji deo opreme: proverite datum proizvodnje i homologaciju, a polovnu kupujte samo ako joj znate istoriju, jer kaciga koja je padala više ne štiti kako treba. Kod jakni i pantalona pogledajte da li su protektori na mestu, a veličinu obavezno probajte. Prodavci neka navedu marku, veličinu i koliko je sezona oprema nošena. Same motore naći ćete u kategoriji [motocikli i skuteri](/oglasi/vozila/motocikli), a gume za njih u [gume i felne](/oglasi/vozila/gume-i-felne).', text_en = 'Motorcycle gear for riders and passengers: helmets, jackets, trousers, gloves and boots with protectors, plus parts and accessories for motorcycles and scooters. You choose the size and the type of gear in the filter, so you quickly get to what suits you.

The helmet is the most important piece: check the production date and the approval label, and buy a used one only if you know its history, because a helmet that has been dropped no longer protects properly. With jackets and trousers, see that the protectors are in place, and always try the size on. Sellers should state the brand, the size and how many seasons the gear was worn. The bikes themselves are in [motorcycles and scooters](/oglasi/vozila/motocikli), and their tyres in [tyres and wheels](/oglasi/vozila/gume-i-felne).' WHERE slug = 'motorcycle-gear' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Vikendice za odmor i beg iz grada: brvnare i kuće na planini, vikendice pored reke i jezera i vikend naselja u okolini većih gradova. Najtraženije su [vikendice na prodaju](/oglasi/nekretnine/vikendice/prodaja), a mnoge se izdaju na duže ili na dan. Kupci najčešće traže lokacije kao što su [Fruška gora](/oglasi/nekretnine/vikendice/prodaja/fruska-gora), [Tara](/oglasi/nekretnine/vikendice/prodaja/tara) i [Zlatibor](/oglasi/nekretnine/vikendice/prodaja/zlatibor).

Pre kupovine proverite da li je vikendica legalizovana i upisana u katastar, kakav je prilaz zimi i ima li struju, vodu i septičku jamu ili kanalizaciju. Obiđite je i po kiši: tada se najbolje vide prilazni put i stanje krova. U oglasu navedite površinu kuće i placa, grejanje i udaljenost od asfalta. Ako tražite dom za stalno stanovanje, pogledajte [kuće](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce).', text_en = 'Weekend cottages for holidays and escaping the city: log cabins and houses in the mountains, cottages by rivers and lakes, and weekend settlements around the bigger cities. Most in demand are [cottages for sale](/oglasi/nekretnine/vikendice/prodaja), and many are let long-term or by the day. Buyers most often look at places such as [Fruška Gora](/oglasi/nekretnine/vikendice/prodaja/fruska-gora), [Tara](/oglasi/nekretnine/vikendice/prodaja/tara) and [Zlatibor](/oglasi/nekretnine/vikendice/prodaja/zlatibor).

Before buying, check that the cottage is legalised and entered in the land registry, what the access is like in winter, and whether it has electricity, water and a septic tank or sewerage. Visit it in the rain too: that is when the access road and the state of the roof show best. In your ad, give the area of the house and the plot, the heating and the distance from a paved road. If you need a home to live in all year, see [houses](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce).' WHERE slug = 'cottages' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Placevi i zemljište širom Srbije: građevinski placevi za kuću ili vikendicu, poljoprivredno zemljište, voćnjaci, šume i livade. Većina oglasa je [prodaja placeva](/oglasi/nekretnine/placevi/prodaja), a zemljište se nudi i u zakup. Ako planirate gradnju, krenite od oglasa za [građevinske placeve](/oglasi/nekretnine/placevi/gradjevinski-placevi).

Pre kupovine u katastru proverite vlasnika, površinu i namenu parcele, a u opštini zatražite informaciju o lokaciji: šta i koliko sme da se gradi. Važni su i prilaz sa javnog puta i blizina struje, vode i kanalizacije, jer priključci umeju znatno da uvećaju troškove. U oglasu navedite površinu u arima, broj parcele i katastarsku opštinu. Gotove objekte tražite među [kućama](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce) i [vikendicama](/oglasi/nekretnine/vikendice).', text_en = 'Plots and land across Serbia: building plots for a house or a cottage, farmland, orchards, forests and meadows. Most ads are [land for sale](/oglasi/nekretnine/placevi/prodaja), and land is also offered for lease. If you plan to build, start with the ads for [building plots](/oglasi/nekretnine/placevi/gradjevinski-placevi).

Before buying, check the owner, the area and the designated use of the parcel in the land registry, and ask the municipality for the location information: what may be built and how much. Access from a public road and the distance to electricity, water and sewerage matter too, because connections can add a lot to the cost. In your ad, give the area, the parcel number and the cadastral municipality. Finished buildings are among [houses](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce) and [cottages](/oglasi/nekretnine/vikendice).' WHERE slug = 'land' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Poslovni prostor za svaku delatnost: lokali u prometnim ulicama, kancelarije, magacini, hale i ugostiteljski objekti, za kupovinu ili zakup. Vrstu prostora i tip ponude birate u filteru, a zatim sužavate izbor po gradu i ceni.

Pre potpisivanja ugovora proverite namenu prostora i da li je za vašu delatnost potrebna posebna dozvola, na primer za ugostiteljstvo ili proizvodnju. Raspitajte se o mesečnim troškovima, snazi struje, parkingu i pristupu za dostavna vozila, a kod zakupa o trajanju ugovora i otkaznom roku. Vlasnici neka navedu kvadraturu, sprat, grejanje i šta od opreme ostaje. Inventar za lokal naći ćete u kategoriji [ugostiteljska oprema](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/ugostiteljska-oprema), a izvođače za uređenje među [majstorima](/oglasi/usluge/majstori).', text_en = 'Commercial space for every kind of business: shops on busy streets, offices, warehouses, industrial halls and hospitality venues, to buy or to lease. You choose the type of space and the type of offer in the filter, then narrow the choice by city and price.

Before signing a contract, check the designated use of the space and whether your business needs a special permit, for example for catering or manufacturing. Ask about monthly costs, the available power supply, parking and access for delivery vehicles, and for a lease about the term and the notice period. Owners should state the floor area, the floor, the heating and which equipment stays. Fittings for a venue are in [catering equipment](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/ugostiteljska-oprema), and contractors for the fit-out among [tradesmen](/oglasi/usluge/majstori).' WHERE slug = 'commercial' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Sobe za izdavanje i oglasi za cimere: nameštene sobe za studente i zaposlene, kreveti u deljenim stanovima i sobe na dan. Sobu je najlakše naći u univerzitetskim gradovima, pa pogledajte [sobe u Beogradu](/oglasi/nekretnine/sobe/izdavanje/beograd) i [sobe u Novom Sadu](/oglasi/nekretnine/sobe/izdavanje/novi-sad).

Pre useljenja dogovorite šta ulazi u cenu: računi, internet, korišćenje kuhinje i kupatila i kućna pravila. Pitajte ko još živi u stanu i da li gazda traži depozit, i zatražite makar jednostavan pisani ugovor. Ako izdajete sobu, napišite da li je nameštena, koliko je udaljena od fakulteta ili prevoza i kome je namenjena. Kad vam zatreba više prostora, tu je [izdavanje stanova](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje).', text_en = 'Rooms to rent and flatmate ads: furnished rooms for students and working people, beds in shared flats and rooms by the day. A room is easiest to find in university cities, so see [rooms in Belgrade](/oglasi/nekretnine/sobe/izdavanje/beograd) and [rooms in Novi Sad](/oglasi/nekretnine/sobe/izdavanje/novi-sad).

Before moving in, agree on what the price includes: bills, internet, use of the kitchen and bathroom, and the house rules. Ask who else lives in the flat and whether the landlord wants a deposit, and ask for at least a simple written agreement. If you are letting a room, say whether it is furnished, how far it is from the university or public transport, and who it is meant for. When you need more space, there are [apartments to rent](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje).' WHERE slug = 'rooms' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Garaže i parking mesta za kupovinu i zakup: zidane i montažne garaže, garažna mesta u zgradama i parking mesta u dvorištima. U centru većih gradova parking je teško naći, pa se dobra garaža brzo izda. Pogledajte, na primer, [garaže u Novom Sadu](/oglasi/nekretnine/garaze/novi-sad).

Pre dogovora izmerite dimenzije i visinu ulaza, naročito ako vozite veći auto ili kombi, i proverite ima li garaža struju i kakav je prilaz. Kod kupovine tražite dokaz da je garaža uknjižena kao poseban deo zgrade, jer garažna mesta često nisu. U oglasu navedite površinu, tačnu lokaciju i da li je mesto u zatvorenoj garaži ili na otvorenom. Stanove u istom kraju tražite u kategoriji [stanovi](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi).', text_en = 'Garages and parking spaces to buy and to rent: brick and prefabricated garages, garage spaces in apartment blocks and parking spaces in courtyards. In the centre of bigger cities parking is hard to find, so a good garage is let quickly. See, for example, [garages in Novi Sad](/oglasi/nekretnine/garaze/novi-sad).

Before agreeing, measure the size and the height of the entrance, especially if you drive a larger car or a van, and check whether the garage has electricity and what the access is like. When buying, ask for proof that the garage is registered as a separate part of the building, because garage spaces often are not. In your ad, give the area, the exact location and whether the space is in a closed garage or outdoors. Flats in the same area are in [apartments](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi).' WHERE slug = 'garages' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Posao od kuće i onlajn poslovi: korisnička podrška, unos podataka, prevođenje, pisanje tekstova, programiranje, dizajn i vođenje društvenih mreža. Neki oglasi nude stalni radni odnos, a drugi honorarnu saradnju po projektu, što vidite u filteru po vrsti angažovanja. Deo poslodavaca traži povremeni dolazak u kancelariju, pa pogledajte i [posao od kuće u Beogradu](/oglasi/posao/rad-od-kuce/beograd).

Budite oprezni sa oglasima koji obećavaju veliku zaradu bez iskustva: ozbiljan poslodavac ne traži uplatu za obuku, materijal ili „aktivaciju naloga“. Pre početka dogovorite način i rokove isplate i tražite ugovor. Poslodavci neka navedu radno vreme, potrebnu opremu i znanje jezika. Ako svoje usluge nudite kao frilenser, oglas postavite u [IT, dizajn i poslovne usluge](/oglasi/usluge/it-i-poslovne-usluge), a stalne pozicije su i u kategoriji [IT i administracija](/oglasi/posao/it-i-administracija).', text_en = 'Remote and online jobs: customer support, data entry, translation, copywriting, programming, design and social media management. Some ads offer permanent employment and others freelance work per project, which you can see in the employment type filter. Some employers ask you to come to the office now and then, so see [remote jobs in Belgrade](/oglasi/posao/rad-od-kuce/beograd) too.

Be careful with ads that promise high earnings with no experience: a serious employer does not ask you to pay for training, materials or "account activation". Before you start, agree on how and when you are paid and ask for a contract. Employers should state the working hours, the equipment needed and the languages required. If you offer your services as a freelancer, post your ad in [IT, design and business services](/oglasi/usluge/it-i-poslovne-usluge); permanent positions are also in [IT and administration](/oglasi/posao/it-i-administracija).' WHERE slug = 'remote-jobs' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Poslovi za vozače i dostavljače: vozači B, C i E kategorije, dostava hrane i paketa, kuriri, taksisti, vozači autobusa i viljuškaristi, kao i poslovi u logistici. Vozači se traže u celoj zemlji, a najviše u velikim gradovima: pogledajte [posao vozača u Beogradu](/oglasi/posao/vozaci-i-dostava/beograd).

U oglasu proverite koja se kategorija dozvole traži i da li su potrebni kod 95, tahografska kartica ili sopstveno vozilo. Kod dostave pitajte ko plaća gorivo i održavanje i kako se računa zarada: po satu, po dostavi ili fiksno. Poslodavci neka navedu relacije, radno vreme i da li je reč o međunarodnom transportu. Vožnju van zemlje nude i oglasi u kategoriji [posao u inostranstvu](/oglasi/posao/posao-u-inostranstvu), a poslovi u skladištu su među oglasima za [proizvodnju i magacin](/oglasi/posao/proizvodnja-i-magacin).', text_en = 'Jobs for drivers and couriers: category B, C and E drivers, food and parcel delivery, couriers, taxi drivers, bus drivers and forklift operators, plus jobs in logistics. Drivers are wanted all over the country, most of all in the big cities: see [driver jobs in Belgrade](/oglasi/posao/vozaci-i-dostava/beograd).

In the ad, check which licence category is required and whether you need the code 95 qualification, a tachograph card or your own vehicle. For delivery work, ask who pays for fuel and maintenance and how the pay is calculated: per hour, per delivery or fixed. Employers should state the routes, the working hours and whether it is international transport. Driving outside the country is also offered in [jobs abroad](/oglasi/posao/posao-u-inostranstvu), and warehouse work is among the ads for [production and warehouse jobs](/oglasi/posao/proizvodnja-i-magacin).' WHERE slug = 'drivers-delivery' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Posao u inostranstvu: sezonski poslovi u poljoprivredi i turizmu, građevina, nega starijih, vožnja i rad u fabrikama u Nemačkoj, Austriji, Sloveniji, Hrvatskoj i drugim zemljama. Dobar oglas navodi zemlju, trajanje ugovora i uslove smeštaja.

Pre polaska proverite da li agencija ima dozvolu za posredovanje u zapošljavanju i tražite ugovor na jeziku koji razumete, sa satnicom, radnim vremenom i podacima o smeštaju i osiguranju. Nikada ne plaćajte unapred za posao, vizu ili prevoz nepoznatom posredniku. Raspitajte se i da li vam treba radna dozvola i ko snosi troškove puta. Slične poslove u Srbiji naći ćete u kategorijama [građevina i zanati](/oglasi/posao/gradjevina-i-zanati), [zdravstvo i nega](/oglasi/posao/zdravstvo-i-nega) i [ugostiteljstvo](/oglasi/posao/ugostiteljstvo).', text_en = 'Jobs abroad: seasonal work in farming and tourism, construction, elderly care, driving and factory work in Germany, Austria, Slovenia, Croatia and other countries. A good ad states the country, the length of the contract and the accommodation.

Before you leave, check that the agency is licensed to mediate in employment and ask for a contract in a language you understand, with the hourly rate, the working hours and the details of accommodation and insurance. Never pay an unknown agent upfront for a job, a visa or transport. Also ask whether you need a work permit and who covers the travel costs. Similar jobs in Serbia are in [construction and trades](/oglasi/posao/gradjevina-i-zanati), [healthcare and care](/oglasi/posao/zdravstvo-i-nega) and [hospitality](/oglasi/posao/ugostiteljstvo).' WHERE slug = 'jobs-abroad' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Studentski i honorarni poslovi: promocije, rad u kafićima i prodavnicama, podela flajera, anketiranje, čuvanje dece, sezonski poslovi i rad preko omladinske zadruge. Takvih poslova najviše ima u univerzitetskim centrima: [Beogradu](/oglasi/posao/studentski-poslovi/beograd), [Novom Sadu](/oglasi/posao/studentski-poslovi/novi-sad) i [Nišu](/oglasi/posao/studentski-poslovi/nis).

Pre nego što prihvatite posao, dogovorite satnicu i broj sati nedeljno, pitajte da li se plaća preko zadruge ili po ugovoru i kada stiže isplata. Poslodavci neka napišu da li je raspored fleksibilan tokom ispitnih rokova i da li je potrebno iskustvo. Ko dobro zna strani jezik ili neki predmet, može da zaradi i držeći časove: oglas se postavlja u kategoriji [privatni časovi](/oglasi/usluge/casovi-i-kursevi). Poslove sa punim radnim vremenom tražite među svim [oglasima za posao](/oglasi/posao).', text_en = 'Student and part-time jobs: promotions, work in cafés and shops, handing out flyers, surveys, babysitting, seasonal jobs and work through a youth cooperative. Such jobs are most common in the university cities: [Belgrade](/oglasi/posao/studentski-poslovi/beograd), [Novi Sad](/oglasi/posao/studentski-poslovi/novi-sad) and [Niš](/oglasi/posao/studentski-poslovi/nis).

Before you accept a job, agree on the hourly rate and the number of hours per week, and ask whether you are paid through a cooperative or under a contract and when the money arrives. Employers should say whether the schedule is flexible during exam periods and whether experience is needed. If you know a foreign language or a subject well, you can also earn by tutoring: post your ad in [private lessons](/oglasi/usluge/casovi-i-kursevi). Full-time jobs are among all the [job ads](/oglasi/posao).' WHERE slug = 'student-jobs' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Poslovi u ugostiteljstvu i turizmu: konobari, kuvari, šankeri, pica-majstori, pomoćni radnici u kuhinji, sobarice, recepcioneri i turistički vodiči. Tokom sezone posla ima na planinama i u banjama, a preko cele godine u većim gradovima, na primer među oglasima za [ugostiteljstvo u Beogradu](/oglasi/posao/ugostiteljstvo/beograd).

Pre početka dogovorite smene, rad vikendom i praznicima, da li je probni rad plaćen i kako se deli bakšiš. Kod sezonskih poslova pitajte za smeštaj i ishranu. Poslodavci neka navedu vrstu objekta, potrebno iskustvo i platu ili raspon plate, jer takvi oglasi dobijaju više prijava. Sezonski rad u hotelima van zemlje je u kategoriji [posao u inostranstvu](/oglasi/posao/posao-u-inostranstvu), a oprema za lokale prodaje se u [ugostiteljskoj opremi](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/ugostiteljska-oprema).', text_en = 'Jobs in hospitality and tourism: waiters, cooks, bartenders, pizza chefs, kitchen assistants, housekeepers, receptionists and tour guides. In season there is work in the mountains and spa towns, and all year round in the bigger cities, for example among the ads for [hospitality jobs in Belgrade](/oglasi/posao/ugostiteljstvo/beograd).

Before you start, agree on shifts, weekend and holiday work, whether the trial period is paid and how tips are shared. For seasonal jobs, ask about accommodation and meals. Employers should state the type of venue, the experience required and the pay or pay range, because such ads get more applications. Seasonal hotel work outside the country is in [jobs abroad](/oglasi/posao/posao-u-inostranstvu), and equipment for venues is sold in [catering equipment](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/ugostiteljska-oprema).' WHERE slug = 'hospitality' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Posao u građevini i zanatima: zidari, tesari, armirači, moleri, keramičari, vodoinstalateri, električari, bravari, zavarivači, rukovaoci mašinama i pomoćni radnici. Traže se i majstori sa iskustvom i početnici spremni da uče zanat, a mnogo gradilišta je u prestonici: pogledajte [posao u građevini u Beogradu](/oglasi/posao/gradjevina-i-zanati/beograd).

Dogovorite dnevnicu ili mesečnu platu, dinamiku isplate i da li poslodavac obezbeđuje prevoz, smeštaj, alat i zaštitnu opremu. Insistirajte na prijavi i ugovoru: rad na gradilištu nosi rizik, a samo prijavljen radnik je osiguran. Poslodavci neka navedu vrstu radova, lokaciju i trajanje posla. Ako radite samostalno, svoje usluge oglasite u kategoriji [majstori i građevinske usluge](/oglasi/usluge/majstori), a zaštitnu opremu potražite među [radnom odećom](/oglasi/moda/radna-odeca).', text_en = 'Jobs in construction and the trades: bricklayers, carpenters, steel fixers, painters, tilers, plumbers, electricians, locksmiths, welders, machine operators and labourers. Both experienced tradesmen and beginners ready to learn a trade are wanted, and many building sites are in the capital: see [construction jobs in Belgrade](/oglasi/posao/gradjevina-i-zanati/beograd).

Agree on the daily or monthly pay, when it is paid, and whether the employer provides transport, accommodation, tools and protective equipment. Insist on being registered and having a contract: work on a building site carries risk, and only a registered worker is insured. Employers should state the type of work, the location and how long the job lasts. If you work on your own, advertise your services in [tradesmen and building services](/oglasi/usluge/majstori), and look for protective gear among [workwear](/oglasi/moda/radna-odeca).' WHERE slug = 'construction-jobs' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Poslovi u proizvodnji, magacinu i obezbeđenju: radnici na proizvodnoj liniji, pakeri, magacioneri, viljuškaristi, operateri na mašinama, kontrolori kvaliteta i radnici fizičko-tehničkog obezbeđenja. Mnoge fabrike primaju i radnike bez iskustva i same organizuju obuku. Ponudu u prestonici vidite među oglasima za [proizvodnju i magacin u Beogradu](/oglasi/posao/proizvodnja-i-magacin/beograd).

Pitajte za smene, noćni rad i rad vikendom, visinu plate i dodataka i da li su obezbeđeni prevoz i topli obrok. Za posao u obezbeđenju potrebna je licenca, a za viljuškar odgovarajući sertifikat. Poslodavci neka napišu mesto rada i šta tačno radnik radi u smeni. Vozačke poslove u logistici tražite u kategoriji [vozači i dostava](/oglasi/posao/vozaci-i-dostava), a ostale ponude među svim [oglasima za posao](/oglasi/posao).', text_en = 'Jobs in production, warehousing and security: production line workers, packers, warehouse staff, forklift operators, machine operators, quality controllers and security guards. Many factories take workers without experience and train them themselves. The offer in the capital is among the ads for [production and warehouse jobs in Belgrade](/oglasi/posao/proizvodnja-i-magacin/beograd).

Ask about shifts, night and weekend work, the pay and allowances, and whether transport and a hot meal are provided. Security work requires a licence, and a forklift the right certificate. Employers should state the place of work and what exactly the worker does during a shift. Driving jobs in logistics are in [drivers and delivery](/oglasi/posao/vozaci-i-dostava), and other offers among all the [job ads](/oglasi/posao).' WHERE slug = 'production-jobs' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Poslovi u zdravstvu, nezi i čišćenju: medicinske sestre i tehničari, negovateljice, gerontodomaćice, bebisiterke, dadilje, spremačice i higijeničari. Traže se i osobe za pomoć u kući i negu starijih, sa stanovanjem ili bez njega. Pogledajte i oglase za [zdravstvo i negu u Beogradu](/oglasi/posao/zdravstvo-i-nega/beograd).

Kod nege u kući unapred dogovorite obaveze: da li posao uključuje kuvanje, davanje terapije, noćno dežurstvo i koliko ima slobodnih dana. Za rad u zdravstvenim ustanovama traže se diploma i licenca, pa ih navedite u prijavi. Porodice koje traže pomoć neka opišu stanje osobe, radno vreme i platu. Negovatelje traže i poslodavci iz Nemačke i Austrije, u kategoriji [posao u inostranstvu](/oglasi/posao/posao-u-inostranstvu). Ako sami nudite čuvanje dece ili negu, oglas postavite u [lepota, nega i čuvanje](/oglasi/usluge/lepota-i-nega).', text_en = 'Jobs in healthcare, care and cleaning: nurses and medical technicians, carers, home helps for the elderly, babysitters, nannies, cleaners and hygiene staff. People are also wanted for help at home and elderly care, live-in or not. See the ads for [healthcare and care jobs in Belgrade](/oglasi/posao/zdravstvo-i-nega/beograd) as well.

For care at home, agree on the duties in advance: whether the job includes cooking, giving medication, night duty, and how many days off there are. Healthcare institutions require a diploma and a licence, so mention them in your application. Families looking for help should describe the person''s condition, the working hours and the pay. Carers are also sought by employers from Germany and Austria, in [jobs abroad](/oglasi/posao/posao-u-inostranstvu). If you offer childcare or care yourself, post your ad in [beauty, care and childcare](/oglasi/usluge/lepota-i-nega).' WHERE slug = 'care-jobs' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Posao u trgovini i prodaji: prodavci i kasiri u marketima i buticima, trgovački putnici, komercijalisti, agenti prodaje, merčendajzeri i poslovođe. Oglase objavljuju i veliki trgovinski lanci i male radnje, a radnih mesta je najviše u velikim gradovima: pogledajte [posao prodavca u Beogradu](/oglasi/posao/trgovina-i-prodaja/beograd).

U oglasu proverite da li je plata fiksna ili zavisi od provizije i prometa, kako su raspoređene smene i da li se radi nedeljom. Kod terenske prodaje pitajte ko obezbeđuje vozilo i telefon. Poslodavci neka napišu šta se prodaje, gde je radno mesto i da li je potrebno iskustvo. Prodaja telefonom i onlajn često je [posao od kuće](/oglasi/posao/rad-od-kuce), a kraće angažmane na promocijama naći ćete među [studentskim poslovima](/oglasi/posao/studentski-poslovi).', text_en = 'Jobs in retail and sales: shop assistants and cashiers in supermarkets and boutiques, travelling salespeople, sales representatives, sales agents, merchandisers and store managers. Ads are posted by big retail chains and small shops alike, and most positions are in the big cities: see [sales jobs in Belgrade](/oglasi/posao/trgovina-i-prodaja/beograd).

In the ad, check whether the pay is fixed or depends on commission and turnover, how the shifts are arranged and whether Sundays are worked. For field sales, ask who provides the vehicle and the phone. Employers should say what is sold, where the workplace is and whether experience is needed. Telephone and online sales are often a [remote job](/oglasi/posao/rad-od-kuce), and shorter engagements at promotions are among [student jobs](/oglasi/posao/studentski-poslovi).' WHERE slug = 'sales-jobs' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Poslovi u IT-u, administraciji i finansijama: programeri, testeri, sistem administratori, korisnička podrška, administrativni radnici, knjigovođe, računovođe, pravnici i saradnici u ljudskim resursima. Takvih radnih mesta najviše je u prestonici, među oglasima za [IT i administraciju u Beogradu](/oglasi/posao/it-i-administracija/beograd).

Dobar oglas navodi tehnologije ili programe koje treba znati, nivo iskustva, da li se radi iz kancelarije, hibridno ili potpuno na daljinu, i raspon plate. Kandidati neka uz prijavu pošalju biografiju, a za IT pozicije i primere radova ili link ka kodu. Pitajte i za probni period i mogućnost usavršavanja. Pozicije bez dolaska u kancelariju izdvojene su u kategoriji [posao od kuće](/oglasi/posao/rad-od-kuce), a frilenseri svoje usluge nude u [IT, dizajn i poslovne usluge](/oglasi/usluge/it-i-poslovne-usluge).', text_en = 'Jobs in IT, administration and finance: developers, testers, system administrators, customer support, administrative staff, bookkeepers, accountants, lawyers and HR associates. Most such positions are in the capital, among the ads for [IT and office jobs in Belgrade](/oglasi/posao/it-i-administracija/beograd).

A good ad states the technologies or software you need to know, the level of experience, whether the work is in the office, hybrid or fully remote, and the pay range. Candidates should send a CV with the application, and for IT positions samples of their work or a link to their code. Ask about the trial period and opportunities for training too. Positions with no office attendance are set apart in [remote jobs](/oglasi/posao/rad-od-kuce), and freelancers offer their services in [IT, design and business services](/oglasi/usluge/it-i-poslovne-usluge).' WHERE slug = 'office-jobs' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Posao za frizere, kozmetičare, manikire, pedikire, šminkere i masere: saloni traže i iskusne majstore sa svojom klijentelom i početnike posle kursa. Česti su i oglasi za izdavanje radnog mesta u salonu, takozvane stolice.

Pre dogovora raščistite kako se zarađuje: fiksna plata, procenat od usluge ili zakup mesta, ko nabavlja materijal i da li salon prijavljuje radnike. Pitajte za radno vreme, rad subotom i mogućnost dodatnih obuka. Vlasnici salona neka navedu lokaciju, vrstu usluga i potrebno iskustvo. Ako radite samostalno i tražite klijente, oglas postavite u kategoriji [lepota, nega i čuvanje](/oglasi/usluge/lepota-i-nega). Sve za opremanje salona, od frizerskih stolica do aparata, naći ćete u [opremi za salone](/oglasi/lepota-i-zdravlje/oprema-za-salone).', text_en = 'Jobs for hairdressers, beauticians, manicurists, pedicurists, make-up artists and massage therapists: salons look both for experienced professionals with their own clients and for beginners fresh from a course. Ads for renting a workstation in a salon, a so-called chair, are common too.

Before agreeing, make clear how you earn: a fixed salary, a percentage of each service or renting the station, who buys the supplies and whether the salon registers its workers. Ask about working hours, Saturdays and chances for further training. Salon owners should state the location, the type of services and the experience required. If you work on your own and are looking for clients, post your ad in [beauty, care and childcare](/oglasi/usluge/lepota-i-nega). Everything for fitting out a salon, from styling chairs to machines, is in [salon equipment](/oglasi/lepota-i-zdravlje/oprema-za-salone).' WHERE slug = 'beauty-jobs' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Ostali poslovi su mesto za oglase koji ne pripadaju nijednoj drugoj kategoriji: fizički poslovi, pomoć u poljoprivredi i berbe, rad u domaćinstvu, poslovi u kulturi i sportu, čuvanje imanja i razni povremeni angažmani.

Što je oglas određeniji, to brže stiže do pravih ljudi: napišite šta se tačno radi, gde, koliko posao traje i kolika je plata ili dnevnica. Kandidatima savetujemo da pre dolaska provere poslodavca i da uslove dogovore pismeno, makar porukom. Ako posao ipak ima svoju kategoriju, izaberite nju, jer ga tamo traže zainteresovani: na primer [vozači i dostava](/oglasi/posao/vozaci-i-dostava), [ugostiteljstvo](/oglasi/posao/ugostiteljstvo) ili [građevina i zanati](/oglasi/posao/gradjevina-i-zanati). Sve ponude zajedno su na stranici [oglasi za posao](/oglasi/posao).', text_en = 'Other jobs is the place for ads that fit no other category: manual work, help on farms and with harvests, household work, jobs in culture and sport, looking after a property and various occasional engagements.

The more specific the ad, the sooner it reaches the right people: say exactly what the work is, where, how long the job lasts and what the pay or daily rate is. We advise candidates to check the employer before they go and to agree on the terms in writing, at least by message. If the job does have its own category, choose that one, because that is where interested people look for it: for example [drivers and delivery](/oglasi/posao/vozaci-i-dostava), [hospitality](/oglasi/posao/ugostiteljstvo) or [construction and trades](/oglasi/posao/gradjevina-i-zanati). All offers together are on the [job ads](/oglasi/posao) page.' WHERE slug = 'other-jobs' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Rent a car agencije i privatni iznajmljivači iz cele Srbije: mali gradski automobili, limuzine, karavani, džipovi i kombiji, za dan, vikend ili duži period. Uporedite ponude u svom gradu, na primer [rent a car u Novom Sadu](/oglasi/usluge/rent-a-car/novi-sad) ili [rent a car u Nišu](/oglasi/usluge/rent-a-car/nis).

Pre preuzimanja vozila pitajte šta ulazi u cenu: ograničenje kilometraže, kasko osiguranje i visina učešća u šteti, depozit i dozvola za izlazak iz zemlje. Automobil fotografišite spolja i iznutra i proverite nivo goriva, da kasnije ne bude nesporazuma. Iznajmljivači neka navedu model, godište, cenu po danu i uslove za vozača. Ako vam auto treba trajno, pogledajte [polovne automobile](/oglasi/vozila/automobili), a za prevoz nameštaja tu su [selidbe i prevoz](/oglasi/usluge/selidbe-i-prevoz).', text_en = 'Car rental agencies and private owners from all over Serbia: small city cars, saloons, estates, SUVs and vans, for a day, a weekend or longer. Compare the offers in your city, for example [car rental in Novi Sad](/oglasi/usluge/rent-a-car/novi-sad) or [car rental in Niš](/oglasi/usluge/rent-a-car/nis).

Before you collect the car, ask what the price includes: the mileage limit, comprehensive insurance and the excess, the deposit and permission to leave the country. Photograph the car outside and inside and check the fuel level, so there are no misunderstandings later. Rental providers should state the model, the year, the price per day and the conditions for the driver. If you need a car for good, see [used cars](/oglasi/vozila/automobili), and for moving furniture there is [removals and transport](/oglasi/usluge/selidbe-i-prevoz).' WHERE slug = 'car-rental' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Sve za proslave na jednom mestu: [ketering i torte](/oglasi/usluge/proslave/ketering-i-torte), dekoracija i sale za svadbe, rođendane i krštenja, bendovi, di-džejevi i trubači, fotografi i snimatelji. Vrstu usluge birate u filteru, a zatim tražite ponude u svom gradu.

Termine u sezoni svadbi rezervišite na vreme i tražite pisanu potvrdu sa datumom, cenom i onim što je uključeno. Kod keteringa dogovorite meni po osobi i probu hrane, kod muzike trajanje nastupa i ozvučenje, a kod fotografa broj obrađenih fotografija i rok isporuke. Izvođači neka u oglas stave primere svog rada: fotografije ili kratak video. Venčanice i odela potražite u kategoriji [venčanice i svečana odeća](/oglasi/moda/vencanice), a razglas i rasvetu u [ozvučenju](/oglasi/muzika/ozvucenje).', text_en = 'Everything for celebrations in one place: [catering and cakes](/oglasi/usluge/proslave/ketering-i-torte), decoration and venues for weddings, birthdays and christenings, bands, DJs and brass bands, photographers and videographers. You choose the type of service in the filter, then look for offers in your city.

Book dates in the wedding season early and ask for written confirmation with the date, the price and what is included. With catering, agree on the menu per person and a tasting; with music, on the length of the performance and the sound system; with a photographer, on the number of edited photos and the delivery date. Providers should add samples of their work to the ad: photos or a short video. Wedding dresses and suits are in [wedding and formal wear](/oglasi/moda/vencanice), and PA systems and lighting in [pro audio](/oglasi/muzika/ozvucenje).' WHERE slug = 'events' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Usluge lepote i nege na jednom mestu: frizeri, šminkanje, manikir i pedikir, masaže i kozmetički tretmani, a u istoj kategoriji su i čuvanje dece i nega starijih osoba. Mnogi dolaze na kućnu adresu, što piše u oglasu uz područje na kom rade.

Pre zakazivanja pogledajte fotografije radova i pitajte za cenovnik, trajanje tretmana i preparate koji se koriste. Kod tretmana lica i tela raspitajte se o obuci i iskustvu, a kod čuvanja dece i nege starijih tražite preporuke i upoznajte osobu pre dogovora. Ko nudi usluge, neka navede iskustvo, grad i da li radi u salonu ili dolazi kući. Preparate za negu naći ćete u [kozmetici](/oglasi/lepota-i-zdravlje/kozmetika), a salone koji zapošljavaju među [poslovima za frizere i kozmetičare](/oglasi/posao/frizeri-i-kozmeticari).', text_en = 'Beauty and care services in one place: hairdressers, make-up, manicure and pedicure, massage and cosmetic treatments; the same category also holds childcare and elderly care. Many providers come to your home, which the ad states along with the area they cover.

Before booking, look at photos of previous work and ask about the price list, the length of the treatment and the products used. For face and body treatments, ask about training and experience; for childcare and elderly care, ask for references and meet the person before you agree. Providers should state their experience, their city and whether they work in a salon or come to the client. Care products are in [cosmetics](/oglasi/lepota-i-zdravlje/kozmetika), and salons that are hiring are among [jobs for hairdressers and beauticians](/oglasi/posao/frizeri-i-kozmeticari).' WHERE slug = 'beauty-services' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Majstori za sve radove u kući i stanu: vodoinstalateri, električari, moleri, keramičari, stolari, bravari, krovopokrivači i ekipe za kompletne adaptacije. Vrstu majstora birate u filteru, a u oglasima piše na kom području rade i koliko iskustva imaju.

Pre početka radova tražite ponudu sa cenom po kvadratu ili po poslu, rokom i spiskom materijala, i dogovorite ko materijal nabavlja. Pogledajte fotografije ranijih radova i, ako može, pozovite nekog od prethodnih klijenata. Plaćanje vežite za završene faze, a ne za veliki avans. Majstori neka u oglasu navedu šta rade, gde i da li izlaze na hitne intervencije. Materijal potražite u kategoriji [građevinski materijal](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/gradjevinski-materijal), a kupatilsku opremu u [kupatilima i sanitarijama](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/kupatilo).', text_en = 'Tradesmen for every job in a house or flat: plumbers, electricians, painters, tilers, carpenters, locksmiths, roofers and crews for complete renovations. You choose the trade in the filter, and the ads say which area they cover and how much experience they have.

Before work starts, ask for a quote with the price per square metre or per job, the deadline and a list of materials, and agree on who buys the materials. Look at photos of earlier work and, if possible, call one of the previous clients. Tie payments to finished stages rather than a large advance. Tradesmen should state what they do, where, and whether they take emergency call-outs. Materials are in [building materials](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/gradjevinski-materijal), and bathroom fittings in [bathrooms and sanitary ware](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/kupatilo).' WHERE slug = 'tradesmen' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Privatni časovi i kursevi za đake, studente i odrasle: strani jezici, matematika, fizika i hemija, priprema za malu maturu i prijemne ispite, časovi muzike, računari i programiranje. Nastava se drži uživo ili onlajn, pa predavač ne mora biti iz vašeg grada.

Pre prvog časa dogovorite cenu, trajanje i mesto održavanja i pitajte da li je probni čas besplatan. Dobar predavač će najpre proceniti nivo znanja i predložiti plan rada. Ko drži časove, neka navede obrazovanje, iskustvo, uzrast sa kojim radi i da li priprema za takmičenja i ispite. Knjige i zbirke zadataka naći ćete u kategoriji [udžbenici i lektira](/oglasi/knjige/udzbenici), a instrument za vežbanje među [gitarama](/oglasi/muzika/gitare) ili [klavirima i klavijaturama](/oglasi/muzika/klaviri).', text_en = 'Private lessons and courses for pupils, students and adults: foreign languages, maths, physics and chemistry, preparation for final and entrance exams, music lessons, computing and programming. Lessons are held in person or online, so the tutor does not have to be from your city.

Before the first lesson, agree on the price, the length and the place, and ask whether a trial lesson is free. A good tutor will first assess the level of knowledge and suggest a plan. Tutors should state their education, experience, the age group they work with and whether they prepare students for competitions and exams. Books and problem collections are in [textbooks and set reading](/oglasi/knjige/udzbenici), and an instrument to practise on among [guitars](/oglasi/muzika/gitare) or [pianos and keyboards](/oglasi/muzika/klaviri).' WHERE slug = 'lessons' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Šlep služba i pomoć na putu u celoj Srbiji: prevoz havarisanih i neispravnih vozila, odvoz sa auto-puta, dovoz automobila iz inostranstva, startovanje, zamena točka i dostava goriva. Mnoge službe rade non-stop, a u oglasu piše koje područje pokrivaju.

Kad zovete, recite tačno gde ste, koji je automobil i da li točkovi mogu da se okreću, pa pitajte za cenu pre nego što šlep krene: obračun je obično po kilometru, uz startnu cenu. Proverite da li se noćni izlazak i rad praznikom naplaćuju više. Vlasnici šlep vozila neka navedu nosivost, relacije i da li voze u inostranstvo. Kad auto stigne na odredište, majstora potražite među [auto servisima](/oglasi/usluge/auto-servisi), a delove u [auto delovima](/oglasi/vozila/auto-delovi).', text_en = 'Towing and roadside assistance all over Serbia: transport of crashed and broken-down vehicles, recovery from the motorway, bringing cars from abroad, jump-starts, wheel changes and fuel delivery. Many services work around the clock, and the ad says which area they cover.

When you call, say exactly where you are, which car it is and whether the wheels can turn, then ask for the price before the truck sets off: the charge is usually per kilometre plus a call-out fee. Check whether night call-outs and public holidays cost more. Tow truck owners should state the payload, the routes and whether they drive abroad. Once the car arrives, look for a mechanic among [car services](/oglasi/usluge/auto-servisi) and for parts in [car parts](/oglasi/vozila/auto-delovi).' WHERE slug = 'towing' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Servis i popravka uređaja: bela tehnika i mali kućni aparati, montaža i servis klima uređaja, popravka telefona, računara, televizora i druge elektronike. Mnogi serviseri dolaze na kućnu adresu, što je kod veš mašina i frižidera najčešće i jedino rešenje.

Pre popravke pitajte koliko košta dijagnostika i da li se odbija od cene ako prihvatite popravku. Tražite procenu troškova unapred i garanciju na ugrađene delove i rad. Kod starijih uređaja uporedite cenu popravke sa cenom polovnog: nekad je isplativije kupiti drugi, na primer među oglasima za [mašine za veš](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/ves-masine) ili [mobilne telefone](/oglasi/elektronika/mobilni-telefoni). Serviseri neka navedu šta popravljaju, područje rada i da li imaju hitne izlaske. Montažu traže i kupci uređaja iz kategorije [klima uređaji](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/klima-uredjaji).', text_en = 'Repair and servicing of devices: large and small household appliances, installation and servicing of air conditioners, repair of phones, computers, TVs and other electronics. Many technicians come to your home, which for washing machines and fridges is usually the only option.

Before a repair, ask how much the diagnosis costs and whether it is deducted from the price if you go ahead. Ask for an estimate in advance and a warranty on the parts fitted and the work. With older devices, compare the cost of the repair with the price of a used one: sometimes it pays to buy another, for example among the ads for [washing machines](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/ves-masine) or [mobile phones](/oglasi/elektronika/mobilni-telefoni). Technicians should state what they repair, the area they cover and whether they take urgent call-outs. Installation is also needed by buyers of units from [air conditioners](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/klima-uredjaji).' WHERE slug = 'repairs' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Poslovne usluge za firme i preduzetnike: izrada sajtova i onlajn prodavnica, grafički dizajn, knjigovodstvo, prevodi sa overom sudskog tumača i bez nje, marketing i vođenje društvenih mreža. Vrstu usluge birate u filteru, a saradnja je uglavnom moguća na daljinu.

Pre dogovora pogledajte portfolio i tražite ponudu u kojoj piše šta dobijate, u kom roku i koliko je izmena uključeno. Kod sajta pitajte ko je vlasnik domena i koda i koliko košta održavanje, a kod knjigovodstva šta ulazi u mesečnu cenu. Ko nudi usluge, neka u oglas stavi primere radova i oblasti u kojima je radio. Firme koje traže stalno zaposlene oglašavaju se u kategoriji [IT i administracija](/oglasi/posao/it-i-administracija), a honorarni angažmani bez dolaska u kancelariju su u [poslu od kuće](/oglasi/posao/rad-od-kuce).', text_en = 'Business services for companies and sole traders: websites and online shops, graphic design, bookkeeping, translations with or without certification by a court interpreter, marketing and social media management. You choose the type of service in the filter, and the work can mostly be done remotely.

Before agreeing, look at the portfolio and ask for a quote that says what you get, by when and how many revisions are included. For a website, ask who owns the domain and the code and what maintenance costs; for bookkeeping, what the monthly price covers. Providers should add samples of their work and the fields they have worked in. Companies looking for permanent staff advertise in [IT and administration](/oglasi/posao/it-i-administracija), and freelance work with no office attendance is in [remote jobs](/oglasi/posao/rad-od-kuce).' WHERE slug = 'business-services' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Selidbe i prevoz u gradu, između gradova i u inostranstvo: selidbe stanova i poslovnog prostora sa radnicima, prevoz nameštaja i robe kombijem ili kamionom, kao i prevoz putnika. Vrstu usluge birate u filteru, a područje rada stoji u svakom oglasu.

Prevoznika pitajte da li cena obuhvata radnike, nošenje uz stepenice, rasklapanje nameštaja i ambalažu, i da li se računa po satu ili po turi. Recite unapred sprat, ima li lifta i koje su najveće stvari, pa ćete dobiti tačniju ponudu. Kod prevoza u inostranstvo raspitajte se o carinskim papirima. Prevoznici neka navedu veličinu vozila i relacije na kojima voze. Ako se selite sami, kombi možete naći u kategoriji [rent a car](/oglasi/usluge/rent-a-car), a novi stan među oglasima za [izdavanje stanova](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje).', text_en = 'Removals and transport within a city, between cities and abroad: flat and office removals with movers, transport of furniture and goods by van or truck, and passenger transport. You choose the type of service in the filter, and every ad states the area covered.

Ask the carrier whether the price includes movers, carrying up stairs, dismantling furniture and packing materials, and whether it is charged per hour or per trip. Say in advance which floor it is, whether there is a lift and what the biggest items are, and you will get a more accurate quote. For transport abroad, ask about customs papers. Carriers should state the size of the vehicle and the routes they drive. If you are moving on your own, you can find a van in [car rental](/oglasi/usluge/rent-a-car), and a new home among the ads for [apartments to rent](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/izdavanje).' WHERE slug = 'moving' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Čišćenje i održavanje: redovno i generalno spremanje stanova i kuća, čišćenje posle renoviranja, pranje tepiha i nameštaja, održavanje poslovnog prostora i zgrada, košenje i uređenje dvorišta. Vrstu usluge birate u filteru, a zatim tražite izvođače u svom gradu.

Cenu dogovorite unapred, po satu ili po kvadratu, i pitajte da li su sredstva i oprema uračunati. Kod dubinskog pranja nameštaja raspitajte se koliko traje sušenje. Za redovno održavanje dobro je da dolazi ista osoba, pa to tražite od agencije. Izvođači neka navedu šta rade, područje i da li izdaju račun firmama. Ako dvorište uređujete sami, alat potražite u kategoriji [kosilice i trimeri](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/kosilice-i-trimeri), a aparate za kuću među [usisivačima i paročistačima](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/usisivaci).', text_en = 'Cleaning and maintenance: regular and deep cleaning of flats and houses, cleaning after renovation, carpet and upholstery washing, maintenance of offices and buildings, mowing and garden care. You choose the type of service in the filter, then look for providers in your city.

Agree on the price in advance, per hour or per square metre, and ask whether cleaning products and equipment are included. For deep cleaning of upholstery, ask how long drying takes. For regular cleaning it is good to have the same person each time, so ask the agency for that. Providers should state what they do, the area they cover and whether they issue invoices to companies. If you look after the garden yourself, tools are in [lawn mowers and trimmers](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/kosilice-i-trimeri), and household machines among [vacuum cleaners and steam cleaners](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/usisivaci).' WHERE slug = 'cleaning' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Ostale usluge okupljaju sve što nema svoju kategoriju: šivenje i prepravke odeće, obućarske i ključarske usluge, graviranje, štampa i kopiranje, iznajmljivanje opreme i alata, pravne i druge savetodavne usluge.

U oglasu jasno napišite šta radite, gde i po kojoj ceni, i dodajte fotografije svog rada: takve oglase ljudi otvaraju mnogo češće. Klijentima savetujemo da cenu i rok dogovore pre početka posla i da za veće poslove traže račun ili pisanu potvrdu. Ako usluga ipak ima svoju kategoriju, izaberite nju, jer je tamo klijenti traže: na primer [majstori](/oglasi/usluge/majstori), [servis i popravka uređaja](/oglasi/usluge/servis-uredjaja) ili [čišćenje i održavanje](/oglasi/usluge/ciscenje). Pregled svih kategorija je na stranici [usluge](/oglasi/usluge).', text_en = 'Other services gathers everything without a category of its own: sewing and clothing alterations, shoe repair and key cutting, engraving, printing and copying, equipment and tool hire, legal and other advisory services.

In your ad, say clearly what you do, where and at what price, and add photos of your work: people open such ads far more often. We advise clients to agree on the price and the deadline before work starts and to ask for an invoice or written confirmation for bigger jobs. If the service does have a category of its own, choose that one, because that is where clients look for it: for example [tradesmen](/oglasi/usluge/majstori), [repair and servicing](/oglasi/usluge/servis-uredjaja) or [cleaning and maintenance](/oglasi/usluge/ciscenje). An overview of all categories is on the [services](/oglasi/usluge) page.' WHERE slug = 'other-services' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Monitori, štampači, tastature, miševi i mrežna oprema: gejming i kancelarijski monitori, laserski i inkdžet štampači, skeneri, mehaničke tastature, ruteri i svičevi. Vrstu uređaja birate u filteru, a mnogo opreme prodaje se posle nadogradnje računara, u odličnom stanju.

Kod monitora proverite rezoluciju, osvežavanje i priključke i tražite fotografiju uključenog ekrana, da biste videli mrtve piksele i senke. Kod štampača pitajte za broj odštampanih strana i cenu tonera ili kertridža, jer potrošni materijal ume da košta više od samog uređaja. Prodavci neka navedu model, starost i da li postoji račun. Računar uz opremu potražite među [desktop računarima](/oglasi/elektronika/racunari) ili [laptopovima](/oglasi/elektronika/laptopovi), a delove u [komponentama](/oglasi/elektronika/komponente).', text_en = 'Monitors, printers, keyboards, mice and networking gear: gaming and office monitors, laser and inkjet printers, scanners, mechanical keyboards, routers and switches. You choose the type of device in the filter, and a lot of gear is sold after a computer upgrade, in excellent condition.

With monitors, check the resolution, the refresh rate and the ports, and ask for a photo of the screen switched on, to spot dead pixels and shadows. With printers, ask about the page count and the price of toner or cartridges, because consumables can cost more than the device itself. Sellers should state the model, the age and whether there is a receipt. A computer to go with the gear is among [desktop computers](/oglasi/elektronika/racunari) or [laptops](/oglasi/elektronika/laptopovi), and parts are in [components](/oglasi/elektronika/komponente).' WHERE slug = 'peripherals' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Komponente za računare, nove i polovne: grafičke kartice, procesori, RAM memorija, SSD i hard diskovi, matične ploče, kućišta, napajanja i hlađenje. Filter po vrsti komponente olakšava slaganje konfiguracije deo po deo.

Pre kupovine proverite kompatibilnost: podnožje procesora i matične ploče, vrstu memorije i snagu napajanja. Grafičku karticu tražite da vidite u radu, pod opterećenjem, i pitajte da li je korišćena za rudarenje. Kod diskova zatražite izveštaj o stanju i broju radnih sati. Prodavci neka navedu tačan model, starost i da li garancija još važi. Ako ne sklapate sami, gotove konfiguracije su u kategoriji [desktop računari](/oglasi/elektronika/racunari), monitori i tastature u [periferiji](/oglasi/elektronika/periferija), a sklapanje nude [servisi](/oglasi/usluge/servis-uredjaja).', text_en = 'Computer components, new and used: graphics cards, processors, RAM, SSDs and hard drives, motherboards, cases, power supplies and cooling. The filter by component type makes it easier to put a build together part by part.

Before buying, check compatibility: the processor socket and the motherboard, the type of memory and the wattage of the power supply. Ask to see a graphics card working, under load, and ask whether it was used for mining. For drives, ask for a health report with the power-on hours. Sellers should state the exact model, the age and whether the warranty is still valid. If you do not build it yourself, ready-made systems are in [desktop computers](/oglasi/elektronika/racunari), monitors and keyboards in [peripherals](/oglasi/elektronika/periferija), and assembly is offered by [repair services](/oglasi/usluge/servis-uredjaja).' WHERE slug = 'components' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Oprema za mobilne telefone: maske i futrole, zaštitna stakla i folije, punjači, kablovi i eksterne baterije, držači, kao i delovi poput ekrana i baterija. Vrstu opreme birate u filteru, a model telefona upišite u pretragu.

Maska i staklo moraju odgovarati tačnom modelu, pa ga proverite pre kupovine, jer se i varijante istog telefona razlikuju po dimenzijama i kamerama. Kod punjača gledajte snagu i podršku za brzo punjenje, a jeftine neoriginalne punjače izbegavajte zbog pregrevanja. Prodavci neka napišu za koji je model oprema i da li je nova. Same uređaje naći ćete u kategoriji [mobilni telefoni](/oglasi/elektronika/mobilni-telefoni), bežične slušalice na stranici [slušalice](/oglasi/elektronika/audio/slusalice), a zamenu ekrana rade [servisi](/oglasi/usluge/servis-uredjaja).', text_en = 'Mobile phone accessories: cases and covers, screen protectors and films, chargers, cables and power banks, holders, plus parts such as screens and batteries. You choose the type of accessory in the filter and type the phone model into the search.

A case and a screen protector must match the exact model, so check it before buying, because even variants of the same phone differ in size and cameras. With chargers, look at the wattage and fast-charging support, and avoid cheap non-original chargers because they overheat. Sellers should say which model the accessory is for and whether it is new. The phones themselves are in [mobile phones](/oglasi/elektronika/mobilni-telefoni), wireless earbuds on the [headphones](/oglasi/elektronika/audio/slusalice) page, and screen replacement is done by [repair services](/oglasi/usluge/servis-uredjaja).' WHERE slug = 'phone-accessories' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Desktop računari za kuću, kancelariju i igranje: gejming konfiguracije, kancelarijski i brend računari, modeli ugrađeni u monitor i mini računari. U oglasima su navedeni RAM memorija i disk, pa ponude lako poredite.

Tražite tačan spisak komponenti: procesor, grafičku karticu, memoriju, disk i napajanje, a ne samo opis „jak računar“. Proverite da li je sistem legalno aktiviran i zamolite prodavca da pokaže računar u radu, najbolje u igri ili programu koji ćete koristiti. Kod polovnih brend računara pitajte da li su iz firme i koliko su stari. Prodavci neka napišu šta ide uz računar: monitor, tastatura, miš. Opremu potražite u kategoriji [monitori i periferija](/oglasi/elektronika/periferija), pojedinačne delove u [komponentama](/oglasi/elektronika/komponente), a prenosive modele među [laptopovima](/oglasi/elektronika/laptopovi).', text_en = 'Desktop computers for home, office and gaming: gaming builds, office and branded PCs, models built into the monitor and mini PCs. The ads state the RAM and the drive, so offers are easy to compare.

Ask for the exact list of components: processor, graphics card, memory, drive and power supply, not just the description "powerful PC". Check that the system is legally activated and ask the seller to show the computer running, ideally in the game or program you will use. With used branded PCs, ask whether they come from a company and how old they are. Sellers should say what comes with the computer: monitor, keyboard, mouse. Gear is in [monitors and peripherals](/oglasi/elektronika/periferija), individual parts in [components](/oglasi/elektronika/komponente), and portable models among [laptops](/oglasi/elektronika/laptopovi).' WHERE slug = 'desktops' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Polovni i novi laptopovi svih klasa: poslovni Lenovo, Dell i HP modeli, gejming laptopovi sa jačom grafikom, lagani ultrabukovi i [MacBook laptopovi](/oglasi/elektronika/laptopovi/apple). Filter po marki, memoriji i disku brzo izdvaja modele koji vam odgovaraju.

Pri pregledu proverite ekran na svetloj i tamnoj pozadini, tastaturu, zglobove, priključke i zdravlje baterije: pitajte koliko sati drži i koliko ciklusa ima. Uverite se da laptop nije zaključan lozinkom u BIOS-u ni vezan za tuđi nalog. Laptopovi iz firmi često su dobro očuvani, ali pitajte za godinu proizvodnje. Prodavci neka navedu procesor, RAM, disk, stanje baterije i da li ide originalni punjač. Ako vam prenosivost nije važna, više snage za isti novac daju [desktop računari](/oglasi/elektronika/racunari), a za čitanje i filmove dovoljan je [tablet](/oglasi/elektronika/tableti).', text_en = 'Used and new laptops of every class: business Lenovo, Dell and HP models, gaming laptops with stronger graphics, light ultrabooks and [MacBooks](/oglasi/elektronika/laptopovi/apple). The filter by brand, memory and drive quickly picks out the models that suit you.

When inspecting, check the screen on a light and a dark background, the keyboard, the hinges, the ports and the battery health: ask how many hours it lasts and how many cycles it has. Make sure the laptop is not locked with a BIOS password or tied to someone else''s account. Ex-company laptops are often well kept, but ask for the year of manufacture. Sellers should state the processor, RAM, drive, battery condition and whether the original charger is included. If portability does not matter, [desktop computers](/oglasi/elektronika/racunari) give more power for the same money, and for reading and films a [tablet](/oglasi/elektronika/tableti) is enough.' WHERE slug = 'laptops' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Foto i video oprema za početnike i profesionalce: DSLR fotoaparati i fotoaparati bez ogledala, objektivi, video kamere, dronovi, akcione kamere, stativi i blicevi. Vrstu opreme birate u filteru, a polovna oprema poznatih marki dobro drži cenu i dugo traje.

Kod fotoaparata pitajte za broj okidanja, proverite senzor na mrlje i ogrebotine i isprobajte sve tastere. Objektiv pogledajte prema svetlu: ne sme imati gljivice, maglu ni ogrebotine, a fokus treba da radi tiho i precizno. Kod dronova proverite stanje baterija i propelera i pitajte da li je letelica padala. Prodavci neka navedu šta ide u kompletu: punjač, baterije, torba. Fotografe za događaje naći ćete među oglasima za [proslave i fotografe](/oglasi/usluge/proslave), a računar za obradu snimaka među [laptopovima](/oglasi/elektronika/laptopovi).', text_en = 'Photo and video gear for beginners and professionals: DSLR and mirrorless cameras, lenses, camcorders, drones, action cameras, tripods and flashes. You choose the type of gear in the filter, and used equipment from well-known brands holds its value and lasts a long time.

With cameras, ask for the shutter count, check the sensor for spots and scratches and try all the buttons. Hold a lens up to the light: it must have no fungus, haze or scratches, and the focus should work quietly and precisely. With drones, check the condition of the batteries and propellers and ask whether the aircraft has crashed. Sellers should state what is in the kit: charger, batteries, bag. Photographers for events are among the ads for [celebrations and photographers](/oglasi/usluge/proslave), and a computer for editing among [laptops](/oglasi/elektronika/laptopovi).' WHERE slug = 'cameras' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Pametni satovi i fitnes narukvice: Apple Watch, Samsung Galaxy Watch, Huawei, Xiaomi, Garmin i drugi modeli za sport, zdravlje i obaveštenja sa telefona. Većina se prodaje posle prelaska na noviji model, često sa kutijom i dodatnim narukvicama.

Pre kupovine proverite da li sat radi sa vašim telefonom: Apple Watch traži iPhone, a neki modeli imaju manje mogućnosti na drugom sistemu. Uverite se da je sat odjavljen sa naloga prethodnog vlasnika, jer zaključan sat ne može da se poveže. Pitajte koliko baterija traje i pogledajte staklo i senzore na poleđini. Prodavci neka navedu model, veličinu kućišta i da li sat ima eSIM. Klasične modele potražite u kategoriji [satovi](/oglasi/moda/satovi), a telefon za uparivanje među [mobilnim telefonima](/oglasi/elektronika/mobilni-telefoni).', text_en = 'Smartwatches and fitness bands: Apple Watch, Samsung Galaxy Watch, Huawei, Xiaomi, Garmin and other models for sport, health and phone notifications. Most are sold after a move to a newer model, often with the box and extra straps.

Before buying, check that the watch works with your phone: an Apple Watch needs an iPhone, and some models have fewer features on the other system. Make sure the watch is signed out of the previous owner''s account, because a locked watch cannot be paired. Ask how long the battery lasts and look at the glass and the sensors on the back. Sellers should state the model, the case size and whether the watch has eSIM. Classic models are in [watches](/oglasi/moda/satovi), and a phone to pair it with among [mobile phones](/oglasi/elektronika/mobilni-telefoni).' WHERE slug = 'smartwatches' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Tableti i e-čitači, novi i polovni: iPad, Samsung Galaxy Tab, Lenovo, Xiaomi i Huawei tableti, grafičke table za crtanje i čitači elektronskih knjiga kao što je Kindle. U oglasima je navedena memorija, a u pretragu možete upisati tačan model.

Proverite ekran na mrlje i ogrebotine, stanje baterije i da li tablet podržava SIM karticu ili samo bežični internet. Najvažnije je da uređaj bude odjavljen sa naloga prethodnog vlasnika: zaključan iPad ili tablet vezan za tuđi nalog ne može da se koristi. Kod starijih modela pitajte da li još dobijaju ažuriranja, jer bez njih neke aplikacije prestaju da rade. Prodavci neka navedu model, memoriju i šta ide uz uređaj: punjač, maska, olovka. Za ozbiljniji rad pogledajte [laptopove](/oglasi/elektronika/laptopovi), a maske i punjače tražite u [opremi za telefone](/oglasi/elektronika/oprema-za-telefone).', text_en = 'Tablets and e-readers, new and used: iPad, Samsung Galaxy Tab, Lenovo, Xiaomi and Huawei tablets, drawing tablets and e-book readers such as Kindle. The ads state the storage, and you can type the exact model into the search.

Check the screen for marks and scratches, the battery condition and whether the tablet takes a SIM card or is wireless only. Most important, the device must be signed out of the previous owner''s account: a locked iPad or a tablet tied to someone else''s account cannot be used. With older models, ask whether they still receive updates, because without them some apps stop working. Sellers should state the model, the storage and what comes with the device: charger, case, pen. For more serious work see [laptops](/oglasi/elektronika/laptopovi), and look for cases and chargers in [phone accessories](/oglasi/elektronika/oprema-za-telefone).' WHERE slug = 'tablets' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Aparati za kafu za kuću, kancelariju i lokal: espreso aparati sa ručicom, automatski aparati sa mlinom, aparati na kapsule, filter aparati i mlinovi za kafu. Polovan aparat bolje marke često je isplativiji od novog jeftinog, jer duže traje i može da se servisira.

Zamolite prodavca da skuva kafu pred vama: tako se vide pritisak, temperatura i da li aparat curi. Pitajte kada je poslednji put očišćen kamenac i da li su menjani dihtunzi i mlin. Kod aparata na kapsule proverite koje kapsule koristi i koliko koštaju. Prodavci neka navedu model, starost i šta ide uz aparat. Profesionalne aparate za kafiće tražite u kategoriji [ugostiteljska oprema](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/ugostiteljska-oprema), blendere i tostere među [malim kućnim aparatima](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/mali-kucni-aparati), a majstora u [servisu uređaja](/oglasi/usluge/servis-uredjaja).', text_en = 'Coffee machines for home, office and café: espresso machines with a portafilter, automatic bean-to-cup machines, capsule machines, filter coffee makers and coffee grinders. A used machine from a better brand often pays off more than a cheap new one, because it lasts longer and can be serviced.

Ask the seller to make a coffee in front of you: that shows the pressure, the temperature and whether the machine leaks. Ask when it was last descaled and whether the seals and the grinder have been replaced. With capsule machines, check which capsules it takes and what they cost. Sellers should state the model, the age and what comes with the machine. Professional machines for cafés are in [catering equipment](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/ugostiteljska-oprema), blenders and toasters among [small appliances](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/mali-kucni-aparati), and a technician in [repair services](/oglasi/usluge/servis-uredjaja).' WHERE slug = 'coffee-machines' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Šporeti, ugradne rerne i ploče, mikrotalasne pećnice i aspiratori: električni, plinski i kombinovani šporeti, indukcione i staklokeramičke ploče. Vrstu uređaja birate u filteru, a u oglasu piše energetski razred.

Pre kupovine izmerite mesto u kuhinji: šporeti su obično široki 50 ili 60 centimetara, a ugradni uređaji traže tačan otvor u elementu. Proverite da li sve ringle i grejači rade, da li vrata rerne dobro zaptivaju i ima li ploča napuklina. Priključenje plinskih uređaja prepustite ovlašćenom majstoru. Prodavci neka navedu dimenzije, starost i razlog prodaje. Ostatak kuhinje opremite u kategorijama [mašine za sudove](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/masine-za-sudove) i [frižideri i zamrzivači](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/frizideri), a elemente potražite među [kuhinjama](/oglasi/namestaj/kuhinje).', text_en = 'Cookers, built-in ovens and hobs, microwave ovens and cooker hoods: electric, gas and dual-fuel cookers, induction and ceramic hobs. You choose the type of appliance in the filter, and the ad states the energy class.

Before buying, measure the space in your kitchen: cookers are usually 50 or 60 centimetres wide, and built-in appliances need an exact opening in the unit. Check that all the rings and heating elements work, that the oven door seals well and that the hob has no cracks. Leave the connection of gas appliances to an authorised fitter. Sellers should state the dimensions, the age and the reason for selling. Equip the rest of the kitchen in [dishwashers](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/masine-za-sudove) and [fridges and freezers](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/frizideri), and look for units among [kitchens](/oglasi/namestaj/kuhinje).' WHERE slug = 'cookers' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Klima uređaji za stan, kuću i lokal: split sistemi, [inverter klime](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/klima-uredjaji/inverter-klime) za hlađenje i grejanje, pokretne klime i multi-split sistemi. U oglasima su navedeni kapacitet i energetski razred, što olakšava poređenje.

Kapacitet birajte prema veličini prostorije: za sobu do dvadesetak kvadrata obično je dovoljna „devetka“, a veće prostorije traže „dvanaesticu“ ili jaču klimu. Ako ćete se njome i grejati, tražite inverter sa dobrim učinkom na niskim temperaturama. Kod polovne klime pitajte da li je stručno demontirana i ima li u sistemu gasa, i uračunajte cenu montaže. Prodavci neka navedu marku, kapacitet, starost i da li idu spoljna jedinica i nosači. Montažu i servis nude [serviseri klima uređaja](/oglasi/usluge/servis-uredjaja), a za dogrevanje pogledajte [grejalice i radijatore](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/grejalice).', text_en = 'Air conditioners for flats, houses and business premises: split systems, [inverter air conditioners](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/klima-uredjaji/inverter-klime) for cooling and heating, portable units and multi-split systems. The ads state the capacity and the energy class, which makes comparing easier.

Choose the capacity by the size of the room: for a room of up to about twenty square metres a 9,000 BTU unit is usually enough, while bigger rooms need 12,000 BTU or more. If you will heat with it too, look for an inverter that performs well at low temperatures. With a used unit, ask whether it was removed by a professional and whether the system still holds gas, and add the cost of installation. Sellers should state the brand, the capacity, the age and whether the outdoor unit and brackets are included. Installation and servicing are offered by [air conditioning technicians](/oglasi/usluge/servis-uredjaja), and for extra heat see [heaters and radiators](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/grejalice).' WHERE slug = 'air-conditioners' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Grejalice i radijatori za dogrevanje i glavno grejanje: [norveški i uljani radijatori](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/grejalice/uljani-i-norveski-radijatori), [grejalice i kaloriferi](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/grejalice/grejalice-i-kaloriferi), kvarcne i infracrvene grejalice, konvektori i [TA peći](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/grejalice/ta-peci). Vrstu uređaja birate u filteru, a ponuda je najveća pred grejnu sezonu.

Snagu birajte prema prostoriji i izolaciji, a kod stalnog grejanja računajte potrošnju struje, ne samo cenu uređaja. TA peć se isplati uz dvotarifno brojilo, jer se puni noću po jeftinijoj tarifi, ali je teška, pa unapred dogovorite prevoz i nošenje. Kod polovnih uređaja proverite kabl, termostat i da li grejalica ima zaštitu od prevrtanja i pregrevanja. Prodavci neka navedu snagu u vatima i starost. Trajnije rešenje su [kotlovi, peći i radijatori za centralno grejanje](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/grejanje).', text_en = 'Heaters and radiators for extra and main heating: [panel and oil radiators](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/grejalice/uljani-i-norveski-radijatori), [fan heaters](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/grejalice/grejalice-i-kaloriferi), quartz and infrared heaters, convectors and [storage heaters](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/grejalice/ta-peci). You choose the type of appliance in the filter, and the offer is biggest just before the heating season.

Choose the wattage by the room and its insulation, and for constant heating count the electricity used, not just the price of the appliance. A storage heater pays off with a two-tariff meter, because it charges at night on the cheaper rate, but it is heavy, so arrange transport and carrying in advance. With used appliances, check the cable, the thermostat and whether the heater has tip-over and overheating protection. Sellers should state the wattage and the age. A more permanent solution is [boilers, stoves and radiators for central heating](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/grejanje).' WHERE slug = 'heaters' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Bojleri za kupatilo i kuhinju: stojeći i ležeći bojleri od 50, 80 i 100 litara, mali kuhinjski bojleri od 5 i 10 litara, protočni i kombinovani bojleri koji se vezuju na centralno grejanje. Zapremina je navedena u oglasu, pa lako nalazite odgovarajući.

Zapreminu birajte prema broju ukućana: jednoj ili dvema osobama dovoljan je bojler od 50 litara, a porodici treba 80 ili više. Kod polovnog bojlera pitajte kada je čišćen kamenac, da li su menjani grejač i anoda i da li je kazan prohromski ili emajliran. Tragovi rđe i curenja na dnu znak su da je kazan pri kraju. Prodavci neka navedu zapreminu, starost i da li je bojler vertikalan ili horizontalan. Ugradnju prepustite [vodoinstalateru](/oglasi/usluge/majstori), a ostalu opremu potražite u kategoriji [kupatila i sanitarije](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/kupatilo).', text_en = 'Water heaters for the bathroom and kitchen: vertical and horizontal heaters of 50, 80 and 100 litres, small kitchen heaters of 5 and 10 litres, instantaneous heaters and combined ones that connect to central heating. The capacity is stated in the ad, so the right one is easy to find.

Choose the capacity by the number of people: for one or two a 50-litre heater is enough, and a family needs 80 or more. With a used heater, ask when it was descaled, whether the heating element and the anode have been replaced and whether the tank is stainless steel or enamelled. Traces of rust and leaks at the bottom are a sign that the tank is near its end. Sellers should state the capacity, the age and whether the heater is vertical or horizontal. Leave the fitting to a [plumber](/oglasi/usluge/majstori), and look for other fittings in [bathrooms and sanitary ware](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/kupatilo).' WHERE slug = 'water-heaters' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Mašine za sudove svih veličina: samostojeće i ugradne, standardne širine 60 centimetara i uske od 45, kao i male stone mašine. U oglasima su navedeni broj kompleta posuđa i energetski razred.

Ugradnu mašinu birajte prema otvoru u kuhinji i proverite da li ide sa frontom ili ga treba naručiti. Kod polovne mašine pogledajte korpe i točkiće, gumu na vratima i filter, i pitajte da li pumpa izbacuje svu vodu i da li mašina greje. Najbolje je videti je u radu, makar na kratkom programu. Prodavci neka navedu širinu, broj kompleta i starost mašine. Uz mašinu se često menja i ostatak kuhinje, pa pogledajte [šporete i rerne](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/sporeti) i [polovne kuhinje](/oglasi/namestaj/kuhinje), a majstora za priključenje naći ćete među [serviserima](/oglasi/usluge/servis-uredjaja).', text_en = 'Dishwashers of every size: freestanding and built-in, the standard 60 centimetres wide and slim 45-centimetre models, plus small countertop machines. The ads state the number of place settings and the energy class.

Choose a built-in machine by the opening in your kitchen and check whether it comes with a front panel or one has to be ordered. With a used machine, look at the baskets and wheels, the door seal and the filter, and ask whether the pump drains all the water and whether the machine heats. It is best to see it running, at least on a short programme. Sellers should state the width, the number of place settings and the age of the machine. The rest of the kitchen is often replaced along with the machine, so see [cookers and ovens](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/sporeti) and [used kitchens](/oglasi/namestaj/kuhinje); a fitter to connect it is among [repair technicians](/oglasi/usluge/servis-uredjaja).' WHERE slug = 'dishwashers' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Frižideri i zamrzivači za domaćinstvo i lokal: kombinovani frižideri, dvokrilni modeli, ugradni i mali frižideri, vertikalni zamrzivači sa fiokama i horizontalni zamrzivači. Vrstu uređaja birate u filteru, a zapremina i energetski razred stoje u oglasu.

Pre kupovine izmerite prostor, vrata i hodnik kroz koji uređaj treba da prođe. Kod polovnog frižidera proverite gume na vratima i da li kompresor radi tiho i povremeno se isključuje, a ne radi bez prestanka. Tražite da uređaj bude uključen bar nekoliko sati pre vašeg dolaska, da vidite da li hladi. Posle prevoza ostavite ga da odstoji pre uključivanja, naročito ako je vožen položen. Prodavci neka navedu visinu, zapreminu i starost. Rashladne vitrine za lokale su u kategoriji [ugostiteljska oprema](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/ugostiteljska-oprema), a ostali veliki aparati među [mašinama za veš](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/ves-masine).', text_en = 'Fridges and freezers for homes and businesses: fridge-freezers, side-by-side models, built-in and small fridges, upright freezers with drawers and chest freezers. You choose the type of appliance in the filter, and the capacity and energy class are in the ad.

Before buying, measure the space, the doors and the hallway the appliance has to pass through. With a used fridge, check the door seals and that the compressor runs quietly and switches off from time to time rather than running non-stop. Ask for the appliance to be switched on at least a few hours before you come, to see whether it cools. After transport, let it stand before switching it on, especially if it was carried lying down. Sellers should state the height, the capacity and the age. Refrigerated display cases for shops are in [catering equipment](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/ugostiteljska-oprema), and other large appliances among [washing machines](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/ves-masine).' WHERE slug = 'fridges' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Mašine za veš i sušilice: mašine sa prednjim i gornjim punjenjem, uske mašine za mala kupatila, mašine sa sušenjem i sušilice sa toplotnom pumpom ili kondenzacijom. U oglasima su navedeni kapacitet u kilogramima i energetski razred.

Kapacitet birajte prema domaćinstvu: paru je dovoljno 6 ili 7 kilograma, a većoj porodici 8 i više. Kod polovne mašine pokrenite kratak program i poslušajte centrifugu: lupanje i jako brujanje ukazuju na ležajeve, čija zamena ume da bude skupa. Pogledajte gumu na vratima, fioku za prašak i ima li ispod mašine tragova vode. Prodavci neka navedu dimenzije, naročito dubinu, starost i da li je mašina servisirana. Za nošenje na sprat dogovorite [selidbe i prevoz](/oglasi/usluge/selidbe-i-prevoz), a kvarove otklanjaju [serviseri bele tehnike](/oglasi/usluge/servis-uredjaja).', text_en = 'Washing machines and tumble dryers: front-loading and top-loading machines, slim machines for small bathrooms, washer-dryers and dryers with a heat pump or condenser. The ads state the capacity in kilograms and the energy class.

Choose the capacity by the household: 6 or 7 kilograms is enough for a couple, and a bigger family needs 8 or more. With a used machine, run a short programme and listen to the spin: knocking and loud humming point to the bearings, which can be expensive to replace. Look at the door seal, the detergent drawer and whether there are traces of water under the machine. Sellers should state the dimensions, especially the depth, the age and whether the machine has been serviced. To have it carried upstairs, arrange [removals and transport](/oglasi/usluge/selidbe-i-prevoz); faults are fixed by [appliance repair technicians](/oglasi/usluge/servis-uredjaja).' WHERE slug = 'washing-machines' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Sedeće garniture, kauči i fotelje za dnevnu sobu: [ugaone garniture](/oglasi/namestaj/garniture/ugaone-garniture) na razvlačenje, [kauči, dvosedi i trosedi](/oglasi/namestaj/garniture/kauci-i-trosedi), fotelje, taburei i sofe. U oglasima su navedeni materijal, boja i dimenzije, pa odmah vidite da li komad staje u vašu sobu.

Pre kupovine izmerite prostor, ali i vrata, hodnik i lift, jer se ugaona garnitura ne može uvek rasklopiti. Sedite i isprobajte: sunđer ne sme da propada, a mehanizam za razvlačenje treba da radi lako. Pogledajte štof ili kožu po ivicama i rukonaslonima, gde se habanje prvo vidi, i pitajte da li je u kući bilo ljubimaca i pušača. Prodavci neka napišu dimenzije i da li garnitura ima ležaj i sanduk za posteljinu. Uz nju potražite [stolove i stolice](/oglasi/namestaj/stolovi-i-stolice), a prevoz dogovorite preko [selidbi](/oglasi/usluge/selidbe-i-prevoz).', text_en = 'Sofas, couches and armchairs for the living room: pull-out [corner sofas](/oglasi/namestaj/garniture/ugaone-garniture), [sofas and sofa beds](/oglasi/namestaj/garniture/kauci-i-trosedi), armchairs, footstools and settees. The ads state the material, colour and dimensions, so you see at once whether a piece fits your room.

Before buying, measure the room but also the doors, the hallway and the lift, because a corner sofa cannot always be taken apart. Sit down and try it: the foam must not sag, and the pull-out mechanism should work easily. Look at the fabric or leather along the edges and armrests, where wear shows first, and ask whether there were pets or smokers in the home. Sellers should give the dimensions and say whether the sofa has a bed and a storage box. To go with it, look for [tables and chairs](/oglasi/namestaj/stolovi-i-stolice), and arrange transport through [removals](/oglasi/usluge/selidbe-i-prevoz).' WHERE slug = 'sofas' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Baštenski nameštaj za dvorište, terasu i balkon: baštenske garniture od ratana, drveta, metala i plastike, ljuljaške, ležaljke, suncobrani i tende. Vrstu nameštaja i materijal birate u filteru, a najveći izbor je u proleće, pred sezonu.

Materijal birajte prema mestu gde će nameštaj stajati: drvo traži redovnu zaštitu, metal treba da bude pocinkovan ili plastificiran, a veštački ratan lako se održava i podnosi kišu. Kod polovnih garnitura proverite spojeve, tragove rđe i stanje jastuka, a kod ljuljaški nosivost i platno. Prodavci neka navedu dimenzije stola, broj mesta i da li se nameštaj sklapa. Za dečji kutak pogledajte [ljuljaške i tobogane](/oglasi/deca/igracke/ljuljaske-i-tobogani), za letnje večeri [roštilje](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/mali-kucni-aparati/rostilji), a za travnjak [kosilice i trimere](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/kosilice-i-trimeri).', text_en = 'Garden furniture for the yard, terrace and balcony: sets in rattan, wood, metal and plastic, swing seats, sun loungers, parasols and awnings. You choose the type of furniture and the material in the filter, and the widest choice is in spring, before the season.

Choose the material by where the furniture will stand: wood needs regular protection, metal should be galvanised or powder-coated, and synthetic rattan is easy to maintain and copes with rain. With used sets, check the joints, traces of rust and the state of the cushions, and with swing seats the load capacity and the canopy. Sellers should state the size of the table, the number of seats and whether the furniture folds. For a children''s corner see [garden swings and slides](/oglasi/deca/igracke/ljuljaske-i-tobogani), for summer evenings [grills and barbecues](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/mali-kucni-aparati/rostilji), and for the lawn [mowers and trimmers](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/kosilice-i-trimeri).' WHERE slug = 'garden-furniture' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Ormari, plakari i komode za spavaću sobu, hodnik i dnevni boravak: dvokrilni i trokrilni ormari, ormari sa kliznim vratima, komode sa fiokama, police, regali i vitrine. Dimenzije, materijal i boja navedeni su u oglasu.

Izmerite širinu i visinu zida, ali i plafon: visok ormar mora da se uspravi u sobi, pa mu treba malo slobodnog prostora. Pitajte da li se ormar rasklapa i ko ga rasklapa, jer nameštaj od iverice ne podnosi mnogo montaža. Proverite šarke, vođice fioka i klizna vrata i pogledajte poleđinu i dno, gde se vide tragovi vlage. Prodavci neka napišu tačne dimenzije i raspored unutrašnjosti: police, šipke, fioke. Ostatak spavaće sobe opremite u kategoriji [kreveti i dušeci](/oglasi/namestaj/kreveti-i-duseci), a dečju sobu u [dečjem nameštaju](/oglasi/deca/decji-namestaj).', text_en = 'Wardrobes, closets and chests of drawers for the bedroom, hallway and living room: two- and three-door wardrobes, sliding-door wardrobes, chests of drawers, shelves, shelving units and display cabinets. The dimensions, material and colour are stated in the ad.

Measure the width and height of the wall, but the ceiling too: a tall wardrobe has to be stood upright in the room, so it needs a little clearance. Ask whether the wardrobe comes apart and who dismantles it, because chipboard furniture does not survive many assemblies. Check the hinges, drawer runners and sliding doors, and look at the back and the base, where traces of damp show. Sellers should give exact dimensions and the layout inside: shelves, rails, drawers. Furnish the rest of the bedroom in [beds and mattresses](/oglasi/namestaj/kreveti-i-duseci), and the children''s room in [children''s furniture](/oglasi/deca/decji-namestaj).' WHERE slug = 'wardrobes' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Posuđe i kuhinjski pribor: šerpe, lonci i tiganji, ekspres lonci, escajg, tanjiri i servisi za ručavanje, čaše, noževi, plehovi i posude za čuvanje hrane. Često se prodaju nekorišćeni kompleti dobijeni na poklon, još u originalnom pakovanju.

Kod šerpi i tiganja proverite da dno nije deformisano i da li posuđe odgovara vašoj ploči: za indukciju je potrebno dno koje privlači magnet. Tiganje sa izgrebanom nelepljivom oblogom ne vredi kupovati. Kod servisa izbrojte delove i pogledajte ivice na okrznuća. Prodavci neka navedu broj delova, marku i da li je komplet korišćen. Aparate za pripremu hrane naći ćete među [malim kućnim aparatima](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/mali-kucni-aparati), trpezarijski sto u [stolovima i stolicama](/oglasi/namestaj/stolovi-i-stolice), a stolnjake i kuhinjske krpe u [tekstilu za dom](/oglasi/namestaj/tepisi-i-tekstil).', text_en = 'Cookware and kitchen utensils: pots, saucepans and frying pans, pressure cookers, cutlery, plates and dinner sets, glasses, knives, baking trays and food storage containers. Unused sets received as gifts are often sold, still in their original packaging.

With pots and pans, check that the base is not warped and that the cookware suits your hob: induction needs a base that attracts a magnet. Pans with a scratched non-stick coating are not worth buying. With dinner sets, count the pieces and look at the rims for chips. Sellers should state the number of pieces, the brand and whether the set has been used. Food preparation appliances are among [small appliances](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/mali-kucni-aparati), a dining table in [tables and chairs](/oglasi/namestaj/stolovi-i-stolice), and tablecloths and tea towels in [home textiles](/oglasi/namestaj/tepisi-i-tekstil).' WHERE slug = 'kitchenware' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Polovne i nove kuhinje i kuhinjski elementi: kompletne kuhinje sa radnom pločom, viseći i donji elementi, sudopere, ostrva i šankovi. Mnogi prodaju očuvanu kuhinju zbog renoviranja, često zajedno sa ugradnim aparatima.

Tražite skicu ili mere svih elemenata i uporedite ih sa svojim zidom: važni su položaj vode, odvoda, struje i prozora. Pogledajte radnu ploču oko sudopere i šporeta, gde najpre nabubri od vode, i proverite šarke i vođice. Dogovorite ko demontira kuhinju i da li u cenu ulaze aparati, sudopera i slavina. Prodavci neka navedu dužinu kuhinje, materijal frontova i starost. Aparate koji nedostaju potražite među [šporetima i rernama](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/sporeti) i [mašinama za sudove](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/masine-za-sudove), a montažu poverite [stolaru](/oglasi/usluge/majstori).', text_en = 'Used and new kitchens and kitchen units: complete kitchens with a worktop, wall and base units, sinks, islands and breakfast bars. Many people sell a well-kept kitchen because of a renovation, often together with the built-in appliances.

Ask for a sketch or the measurements of all the units and compare them with your wall: the position of the water, the drain, the sockets and the window matters. Look at the worktop around the sink and the cooker, where it swells from water first, and check the hinges and runners. Agree on who dismantles the kitchen and whether the price includes the appliances, the sink and the tap. Sellers should state the length of the kitchen, the material of the fronts and the age. Look for missing appliances among [cookers and ovens](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/sporeti) and [dishwashers](/oglasi/kucni-aparati/masine-za-sudove), and leave the fitting to a [carpenter](/oglasi/usluge/majstori).' WHERE slug = 'kitchens' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Dekoracija za stan i kuću: ogledala, slike i ramovi, vaze, zidni satovi, sveće i svećnjaci, saksije, veštačko cveće i praznični ukrasi. Sitnice koje menjaju izgled prostora ovde se nalaze po nižim cenama nego u salonima.

Kod ogledala proverite ivice i poleđinu: tamne mrlje znače da je sloj srebra oštećen. Veliko ogledalo ili sliku pod staklom prevozite uspravno i dobro zaštićene. Tražite dimenzije i fotografiju predmeta u prostoru, da procenite veličinu i boje. Prodavci neka navedu mere, materijal i da li se predmet kači ili stoji. Toplinu domu daju i [tepisi, zavese i posteljina](/oglasi/namestaj/tepisi-i-tekstil) i [lusteri i lampe](/oglasi/namestaj/rasveta), a stare i unikatne predmete naći ćete među [antikvitetima](/oglasi/antikviteti/stari-predmeti).', text_en = 'Decoration for flats and houses: mirrors, pictures and frames, vases, wall clocks, candles and candlesticks, flowerpots, artificial flowers and festive ornaments. The small things that change the look of a room can be found here for less than in showrooms.

With mirrors, check the edges and the back: dark spots mean the silver layer is damaged. Transport a large mirror or a picture under glass upright and well protected. Ask for the dimensions and a photo of the item in a room, to judge the size and colours. Sellers should state the measurements, the material and whether the item hangs or stands. [Rugs, curtains and bedding](/oglasi/namestaj/tepisi-i-tekstil) and [chandeliers and lamps](/oglasi/namestaj/rasveta) also make a home warmer, and old and one-off pieces are among [antiques](/oglasi/antikviteti/stari-predmeti).' WHERE slug = 'decor' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Montažne kuće, kontejneri i brvnare: stambene montažne kuće po sistemu ključ u ruke, vikend kućice, stambeni i kancelarijski kontejneri, baštenske kućice i brvnare. Oglase postavljaju proizvođači, ali i vlasnici koji prodaju gotove objekte za premeštanje.

Uporedite šta tačno ulazi u cenu: temelj, izolacija, stolarija, instalacije i prevoz često se naplaćuju posebno. Pitajte za debljinu zidova i izolacije, jer od toga zavise računi za grejanje, i tražite da vidite već završen objekat. I za montažnu kuću potrebna je građevinska dozvola, a za kontejner se raspitajte u opštini. Kod polovnih kontejnera proverite pod, krov i tragove rđe. Zemljište tražite među [placevima](/oglasi/nekretnine/placevi), gotove objekte među [vikendicama](/oglasi/nekretnine/vikendice), a materijal za utopljavanje u kategoriji [izolacija i fasade](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/izolacija-i-fasada).', text_en = 'Prefabricated houses, containers and log cabins: turnkey prefab homes, weekend cabins, residential and office containers, garden sheds and log cabins. Ads come from manufacturers, but also from owners selling finished buildings to be moved.

Compare what exactly the price includes: the foundation, insulation, joinery, installations and transport are often charged separately. Ask about the thickness of the walls and insulation, because the heating bills depend on it, and ask to see a finished building. A prefab house needs a building permit too, and for a container ask at the municipality. With used containers, check the floor, the roof and traces of rust. Look for land among [plots](/oglasi/nekretnine/placevi), finished buildings among [cottages](/oglasi/nekretnine/vikendice), and insulating materials in [insulation and facades](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/izolacija-i-fasada).' WHERE slug = 'prefab' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Laminat, parket i druge podne obloge: laminat različitih debljina i klasa, hrastov i bukov parket, brodski pod, vinil i itisoni, kao i lajsne i podloge. Često se prodaju viškovi posle renoviranja, po ceni nižoj nego u prodavnici.

Izračunajte površinu i dodajte oko deset odsto za otpad pri sečenju. Kod viškova proverite da li su svi paketi iz iste serije, jer se nijanse razlikuju. Laminat birajte prema klasi habanja: za hodnik i dnevnu sobu treba otpornija klasa nego za spavaću. Polovan parket vredi kupiti ako je dovoljno debeo za još jedno hoblovanje. Prodavci neka navedu količinu u kvadratima, debljinu i klasu. Za kupatilo i kuhinju pogledajte [pločice](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/keramika), a postavljanje i hoblovanje nude [majstori](/oglasi/usluge/majstori).', text_en = 'Laminate, parquet and other floor coverings: laminate of various thicknesses and classes, oak and beech parquet, floorboards, vinyl and carpet, plus skirting boards and underlay. Leftovers from renovations are often sold for less than in a shop.

Work out the area and add about ten per cent for cutting waste. With leftovers, check that all the packs come from the same batch, because shades differ. Choose laminate by its wear class: a hallway and a living room need a tougher class than a bedroom. Used parquet is worth buying if it is thick enough for one more sanding. Sellers should state the quantity in square metres, the thickness and the class. For the bathroom and kitchen see [tiles](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/keramika), and laying and sanding are offered by [tradesmen](/oglasi/usluge/majstori).' WHERE slug = 'flooring' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Keramičke pločice za kupatilo, kuhinju, terasu i dvorište: zidne i podne pločice, granitna keramika, mozaik, lepak i fug mase. U oglasima su i viškovi posle radova i veće količine sa lagera, po povoljnim cenama.

Proverite da li su sve kutije istog kalibra i tona, što piše na pakovanju, jer se serije razlikuju. Za terasu i dvorište tražite pločice otporne na mraz i klizanje. Kupite desetak odsto više nego što iznosi površina, zbog sečenja i rezerve za kasnije popravke. Prodavci neka navedu dimenzije pločice, količinu u kvadratima i klasu. Opremu za kupatilo naći ćete u kategoriji [kupatila i sanitarije](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/kupatilo), a posebno na stranici [tuš kabine i kade](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/kupatilo/tus-kabine). Postavljanje poverite [keramičaru](/oglasi/usluge/majstori).', text_en = 'Ceramic tiles for the bathroom, kitchen, terrace and yard: wall and floor tiles, porcelain stoneware, mosaic, adhesive and grout. The ads include leftovers from finished jobs as well as larger quantities from stock, at good prices.

Check that all the boxes have the same calibre and shade, which is printed on the packaging, because batches differ. For a terrace or a yard, look for frost-resistant and non-slip tiles. Buy about ten per cent more than the area, for cutting and as a reserve for later repairs. Sellers should state the size of the tile, the quantity in square metres and the class. Bathroom fittings are in [bathrooms and sanitary ware](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/kupatilo), and in particular on the [shower cabins and bathtubs](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/kupatilo/tus-kabine) page. Leave the laying to a [tiler](/oglasi/usluge/majstori).' WHERE slug = 'tiles' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Ogrev za kuću i kotlarnicu: bukova, hrastova i cerova drva, cepana ili u metarskim komadima, pelet u džakovima, ugalj i briket. Prodavci dostavljaju na kućnu adresu, a u oglasu pišu cena po metru ili toni i područje dostave.

Drva se prodaju na prostorni metar: pitajte kako su složena i izmerite ih pri istovaru. Suva drva su lakša, ispucala na krajevima i zvone pri udaru, dok sirova daju manje toplote i prljaju dimnjak. Kod peleta tražite sertifikat i proverite da u džaku nema mnogo prašine. Ogrev je najpametnije kupiti u proleće ili leto, kada je jeftiniji i ima vremena da se prosuši. Peć ili kotao potražite u kategoriji [grejanje](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/grejanje), posebno među [kotlovima na pelet i drva](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/grejanje/kotlovi), a alat za rezanje u [motornim testerama](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/motorne-testere).', text_en = 'Fuel for the house and the boiler room: beech, oak and Turkey oak firewood, split or in metre lengths, pellets in bags, coal and briquettes. Sellers deliver to your address, and the ad states the price per stacked metre or tonne and the delivery area.

Firewood is sold by the stacked cubic metre: ask how it is stacked and measure it on unloading. Dry wood is lighter, cracked at the ends and rings when struck, while green wood gives less heat and soots up the chimney. With pellets, ask for the certificate and check that there is not much dust in the bag. It is wisest to buy fuel in spring or summer, when it is cheaper and has time to dry. Look for a stove or boiler in [heating](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/grejanje), especially among [pellet and wood boilers](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/grejanje/kotlovi), and for a tool to cut it in [chainsaws](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/motorne-testere).' WHERE slug = 'firewood' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Građevinski materijal za gradnju i renoviranje: crep i krovni pokrivači, cigla i blokovi, cement, malteri i lepkovi, građa, armatura, pesak i šljunak. Uz ponudu stovarišta tu su i viškovi sa gradilišta, po nižim cenama.

Pre kupovine izračunajte količine sa majstorom i pitajte da li cena uključuje prevoz i istovar, jer dostava teškog materijala znatno utiče na ukupan trošak. Kod cementa i lepkova proverite datum proizvodnje i da džakovi nisu vlažili. Polovan crep i ciglu pregledajte na pukotine, a građa treba da bude suva i prava. Prodavci neka navedu količinu, mesto preuzimanja i da li dostavljaju. Stolarija je među [prozorima](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/stolarija) i [vratima](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/vrata), a izvođače tražite među [majstorima](/oglasi/usluge/majstori).', text_en = 'Building materials for construction and renovation: roof tiles and roofing, bricks and blocks, cement, mortars and adhesives, timber, rebar, sand and gravel. Besides builders'' merchants, there are leftovers from building sites at lower prices.

Before buying, work out the quantities with your builder and ask whether the price includes transport and unloading, because delivery of heavy materials adds a lot to the total cost. With cement and adhesives, check the production date and that the bags have not been damp. Inspect used roof tiles and bricks for cracks; timber should be dry and straight. Sellers should state the quantity, the place of collection and whether they deliver. Joinery is among [windows](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/stolarija) and [doors](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/vrata), and contractors among [tradesmen](/oglasi/usluge/majstori).' WHERE slug = 'materials' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Solarni paneli i elektromaterijal: paneli i kompleti za kuće i vikendice, invertori, regulatori punjenja i akumulatori, kao i kablovi, razvodne table, osigurači i utičnice. Mali solarni sistemi posebno su traženi za vikendice i objekte bez priključka na mrežu.

Pre kupovine saberite potrošnju uređaja koje želite da napajate: od toga zavise snaga panela, invertor i kapacitet akumulatora. Kod polovnih panela pogledajte staklo, ram i priključnu kutiju i tražite merenje snage, a kod akumulatora pitajte za starost i broj ciklusa. Priključenje na kućnu instalaciju i mrežu prepustite ovlašćenom električaru. Prodavci neka navedu snagu u vatima, napon i starost opreme. Rezervno napajanje daju i [agregati](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/agregati-i-pumpe/agregati), a montažu nude [električari](/oglasi/usluge/majstori).', text_en = 'Solar panels and electrical supplies: panels and kits for houses and cottages, inverters, charge controllers and batteries, plus cables, distribution boards, fuses and sockets. Small solar systems are especially popular for cottages and buildings with no grid connection.

Before buying, add up the consumption of the devices you want to power: the panel wattage, the inverter and the battery capacity depend on it. With used panels, look at the glass, the frame and the junction box and ask for a power measurement; with batteries, ask about the age and the number of cycles. Leave the connection to the house wiring and the grid to a certified electrician. Sellers should state the wattage, the voltage and the age of the equipment. Backup power also comes from [generators](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/agregati-i-pumpe/agregati), and installation is offered by [electricians](/oglasi/usluge/majstori).' WHERE slug = 'solar' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Video nadzor i alarmi za kuću, stan i lokal: kompleti kamera sa snimačem, bežične i IP kamere, alarmne centrale sa senzorima, interfoni, video interfoni i pametne brave. Vrstu opreme birate u filteru.

Pre kupovine odlučite šta želite da pokrijete i da li vam trebaju noćno snimanje, pristup preko telefona i čuvanje snimaka na disku. Proverite rezoluciju kamera, da li komplet ima napajanje i kablove i da li je snimač otključan, bez lozinke prethodnog vlasnika. Imajte u vidu da kamera ne sme da snima tuđe dvorište ni javnu površinu više nego što je nužno. Prodavci neka navedu broj kamera, rezoluciju i šta ide u kompletu. Ugradnju nude [električari i majstori](/oglasi/usluge/majstori), a sigurnosna vrata su u kategoriji [vrata](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/vrata).', text_en = 'Video surveillance and alarms for houses, flats and business premises: camera kits with a recorder, wireless and IP cameras, alarm panels with sensors, intercoms, video intercoms and smart locks. You choose the type of equipment in the filter.

Before buying, decide what you want to cover and whether you need night vision, access from your phone and recordings stored on a drive. Check the resolution of the cameras, whether the kit includes the power supply and cables, and whether the recorder is unlocked, without the previous owner''s password. Bear in mind that a camera must not record a neighbour''s yard or public space more than necessary. Sellers should state the number of cameras, the resolution and what is in the kit. Installation is offered by [electricians and tradesmen](/oglasi/usluge/majstori), and security doors are in [doors](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/vrata).' WHERE slug = 'security' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Motorne testere za ogrev, voćnjak i šumu: benzinske testere različitih snaga, električne i akumulatorske testere, kao i mačevi, lanci i rezervni delovi. Najtraženije su marke Stihl i Husqvarna, a nude se i povoljniji modeli za povremenu upotrebu.

Snagu i dužinu mača birajte prema poslu: za orezivanje i sitnija drva dovoljna je manja testera, a za obaranje stabala treba jača. Polovnu testeru upalite hladnu i poslušajte kako radi u praznom hodu i pod gasom, proverite kočnicu lanca, kompresiju i da li negde curi ulje. Čuvajte se kopija poznatih marki po sumnjivo niskoj ceni. Prodavci neka navedu model, godinu kupovine i šta je menjano. Ostali baštenski alat je u kategoriji [kosilice i trimeri](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/kosilice-i-trimeri), a gotova [drva za ogrev](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/ogrev) možete naručiti sa dostavom.', text_en = 'Chainsaws for firewood, the orchard and the forest: petrol saws of various power, electric and cordless saws, plus guide bars, chains and spare parts. Stihl and Husqvarna are the most sought-after brands, and there are cheaper models for occasional use too.

Choose the power and the bar length by the job: a smaller saw is enough for pruning and small logs, while felling trees takes a stronger one. Start a used saw cold and listen to it idling and under throttle, check the chain brake, the compression and whether oil leaks anywhere. Beware of copies of well-known brands at a suspiciously low price. Sellers should state the model, the year of purchase and what has been replaced. Other garden tools are in [mowers and trimmers](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/kosilice-i-trimeri), and ready-cut [firewood](/oglasi/gradjevinarstvo/ogrev) can be ordered with delivery.' WHERE slug = 'chainsaws' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Agregati, pumpe i kompresori za kuću, gradilište i imanje: [agregati za struju](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/agregati-i-pumpe/agregati) na benzin i dizel, [pumpe za vodu](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/agregati-i-pumpe/pumpe-za-vodu) za bunare, navodnjavanje i prljavu vodu, hidrofori i kompresori za vazduh. Vrstu uređaja birate u filteru.

Agregat birajte prema ukupnoj snazi uređaja koje ćete priključiti, uz rezervu za pokretanje motora. Kod pumpe su važni dubina sa koje vuče, visina dizanja i protok, pa prodavcu recite za šta vam treba. Polovan agregat tražite da vidite pod opterećenjem, a kompresor da napuni rezervoar do kraja i drži pritisak. Prodavci neka navedu snagu, gorivo i broj radnih sati. Sisteme kap po kap i creva naći ćete u [opremi za navodnjavanje](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/poljoprivredna-oprema), a ručni alat među [električnim alatima](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/alati).', text_en = 'Generators, pumps and compressors for the house, the building site and the farm: petrol and diesel [power generators](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/agregati-i-pumpe/agregati), [water pumps](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/agregati-i-pumpe/pumpe-za-vodu) for wells, irrigation and dirty water, booster sets and air compressors. You choose the type of machine in the filter.

Choose a generator by the total wattage of the devices you will connect, with a reserve for starting motors. With a pump, the depth it draws from, the head and the flow rate matter, so tell the seller what you need it for. Ask to see a used generator under load, and a compressor filling its tank completely and holding the pressure. Sellers should state the power, the fuel and the running hours. Drip systems and hoses are in [irrigation equipment](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/poljoprivredna-oprema), and hand-held tools among [power tools](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/alati).' WHERE slug = 'generators-pumps' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Kosilice, trimeri i baštenski alat: [kosilice za travu](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/kosilice-i-trimeri/kosilice) na benzin, struju i akumulator, samohodne kosilice i traktorčići, [trimeri](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/kosilice-i-trimeri/trimeri), makaze za živu ogradu, duvači lišća i prskalice. Ponuda je najveća u proleće, na početku sezone košenja.

Kosilicu birajte prema površini travnjaka: za malo dvorište dovoljna je električna, a za veće površine benzinska ili samohodna. Polovnu mašinu upalite i poslušajte motor, pogledajte nož, kućište odozdo i korpu, a kod trimera glavu i osovinu. Pitajte kada su menjani ulje, svećica i filter. Prodavci neka navedu snagu, širinu košenja i starost. Za rezanje grana pogledajte [motorne testere](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/motorne-testere), a ako nemate vremena za dvorište, tu su usluge [čišćenja i uređenja dvorišta](/oglasi/usluge/ciscenje).', text_en = 'Mowers, trimmers and garden tools: petrol, electric and cordless [lawn mowers](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/kosilice-i-trimeri/kosilice), self-propelled and ride-on mowers, [grass trimmers](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/kosilice-i-trimeri/trimeri), hedge trimmers, leaf blowers and sprayers. The offer is biggest in spring, at the start of the mowing season.

Choose a mower by the size of the lawn: an electric one is enough for a small yard, while larger areas need a petrol or self-propelled one. Start a used machine and listen to the engine, look at the blade, the underside of the deck and the grass box, and on a trimmer the head and the shaft. Ask when the oil, the spark plug and the filter were changed. Sellers should state the power, the cutting width and the age. For cutting branches see [chainsaws](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/motorne-testere), and if you have no time for the garden, there are [cleaning and garden care](/oglasi/usluge/ciscenje) services.' WHERE slug = 'mowers' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Građevinske i industrijske mašine: bageri, mini bageri, utovarivači, valjci, mešalice za beton, skele i oplate, viljuškari, strugovi, prese i druge mašine za radionice i pogone. Oglase postavljaju firme i vlasnici iz cele zemlje, a deo mašina nudi se i za iznajmljivanje.

Kod radnih mašina najvažniji su broj radnih sati i istorija održavanja, pa tražite servisnu dokumentaciju. Pregledajte hidrauliku na curenje, zazor u zglobovima strele, gusenice ili gume, i obavezno vidite mašinu u radu. Kod viljuškara proverite nosivost, visinu dizanja i stanje baterije ili motora. Dogovorite i prevoz, jer teške mašine putuju na niskoj prikolici. Prodavci neka navedu godište, radne sate i priključke koji idu uz mašinu. Kamione i kipere naći ćete u kategoriji [kamioni i kombiji](/oglasi/vozila/kamioni-i-kombiji), a rukovaoce među oglasima za [posao u građevini](/oglasi/posao/gradjevina-i-zanati).', text_en = 'Construction and industrial machinery: excavators, mini excavators, loaders, rollers, concrete mixers, scaffolding and formwork, forklifts, lathes, presses and other machines for workshops and plants. Ads come from companies and owners all over the country, and some machines are offered for hire too.

With working machines, the running hours and the maintenance history matter most, so ask for the service records. Inspect the hydraulics for leaks, the play in the boom joints, the tracks or tyres, and always see the machine working. With forklifts, check the load capacity, the lift height and the condition of the battery or engine. Arrange transport too, because heavy machines travel on a low loader. Sellers should state the year, the running hours and the attachments that come with the machine. Trucks and tippers are in [trucks and vans](/oglasi/vozila/kamioni-i-kombiji), and operators among the ads for [construction jobs](/oglasi/posao/gradjevina-i-zanati).' WHERE slug = 'machinery' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Ugostiteljska i trgovinska oprema: rashladne vitrine i komore, profesionalni šporeti, friteze, roštilji i peći za picu, aparati za espreso, šankovi, police, gondole i fiskalne kase. Mnogo opreme prodaje se posle zatvaranja ili preuređenja lokala, po delu cene nove.

Rashladne uređaje tražite da vidite uključene: treba da postignu temperaturu, a kompresor ne sme da radi bez prekida. Kod termičke opreme proverite da li je na struju ili plin i da li vaš lokal ima dovoljno jak priključak. Prohrom pregledajte na udubljenja i varove. Za fiskalnu kasu raspitajte se da li može da se prenese na novog vlasnika. Prodavci neka navedu dimenzije, snagu i starost opreme. Prostor potražite među [lokalima i poslovnim prostorom](/oglasi/nekretnine/poslovni-prostor), a osoblje preko oglasa za [posao u ugostiteljstvu](/oglasi/posao/ugostiteljstvo).', text_en = 'Catering and shop equipment: refrigerated display cases and cold rooms, professional cookers, fryers, grills and pizza ovens, espresso machines, bar counters, shelving, gondolas and fiscal cash registers. A lot of equipment is sold after a venue closes or is refitted, for a fraction of the price of new.

Ask to see refrigeration units switched on: they should reach temperature, and the compressor must not run non-stop. With cooking equipment, check whether it runs on electricity or gas and whether your premises have a strong enough connection. Inspect stainless steel for dents and welds. For a fiscal cash register, ask whether it can be transferred to a new owner. Sellers should state the dimensions, the power and the age of the equipment. Look for premises among [shops and commercial space](/oglasi/nekretnine/poslovni-prostor), and for staff through the ads for [hospitality jobs](/oglasi/posao/ugostiteljstvo).' WHERE slug = 'catering-equipment' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Poljoprivredne mašine i priključci: [priključne mašine](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/poljoprivredne-masine/prikljucne-masine) kao što su plugovi, tanjirače, sejalice, prskalice i balirke, [motokultivatori i freze](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/poljoprivredne-masine/motokultivatori-i-freze), kombajni i traktorske prikolice. U oglasu je navedeno godište, a vrstu mašine birate u filteru.

Priključak mora da odgovara snazi i kategoriji vašeg traktora, pa pre kupovine proverite potrebnu snagu i način kačenja. Pregledajte radne delove: raonike, diskove, noževe, ležajeve i kardan, jer njihova zamena brzo podigne cenu. Kod kombajna i balirki tražite da vidite mašinu u radu ili bar da čujete kako se vrti u prazno. Prodavci neka navedu radni zahvat, godište i šta je obnovljeno. Pogonsku mašinu tražite u kategoriji [traktori](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/traktori), a pumpe i creva u [opremi za navodnjavanje](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/poljoprivredna-oprema).', text_en = 'Farm machinery and implements: [implements](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/poljoprivredne-masine/prikljucne-masine) such as ploughs, disc harrows, seed drills, sprayers and balers, [two-wheel tractors and tillers](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/poljoprivredne-masine/motokultivatori-i-freze), combine harvesters and tractor trailers. The ad states the year, and you choose the type of machine in the filter.

An implement has to match the power and category of your tractor, so check the power required and the hitch before buying. Inspect the working parts: shares, discs, blades, bearings and the PTO shaft, because replacing them quickly raises the price. With combines and balers, ask to see the machine working or at least hear it running empty. Sellers should state the working width, the year and what has been overhauled. The tractor itself is in [tractors](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/traktori), and pumps and hoses in [irrigation equipment](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/poljoprivredna-oprema).' WHERE slug = 'farm-machinery' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Sve za pčelarstvo: pčelinja društva, rojevi i matice, košnice LR, DB i drugih tipova, ramovi, satne osnove, vrcaljke, topionici voska, dimilice i pčelarska odela. Oglase postavljaju pčelari koji prodaju višak društava ili opremu.

Društva kupujte u proleće, od pčelara kod koga možete da pogledate pčelinjak. Tražite uverenje o zdravstvenom stanju pčela i otvorite košnicu: leglo treba da bude kompaktno, a matica mlada. Polovne košnice i ramove dezinfikujte pre upotrebe, jer se bolesti legla prenose opremom. Kod vrcaljke proverite da li je od prohroma i koliko ramova prima. Prodavci neka navedu tip košnice, broj ramova sa pčelama i starost matice. Med i druge pčelinje proizvode prodajte u kategoriji [domaći proizvodi](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/domaci-proizvodi), a medonosno bilje potražite među [sadnicama](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/sadnice).', text_en = 'Everything for beekeeping: bee colonies, swarms and queens, LR, DB and other types of hives, frames, wax foundation, honey extractors, wax melters, smokers and beekeeping suits. Ads are posted by beekeepers selling surplus colonies or equipment.

Buy colonies in spring, from a beekeeper whose apiary you can visit. Ask for a certificate of the bees'' health and open the hive: the brood should be compact and the queen young. Disinfect used hives and frames before use, because brood diseases spread through equipment. With an extractor, check that it is stainless steel and how many frames it takes. Sellers should state the type of hive, the number of frames with bees and the age of the queen. Sell honey and other bee products in [home-made products](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/domaci-proizvodi), and look for honey plants among [seedlings and plants](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/sadnice).' WHERE slug = 'beekeeping' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Stočna hrana i ratarski proizvodi: seno i detelina u balama, slama, kukuruz u zrnu i klipu, pšenica, ječam, ovas, soja, silaža i koncentrati. Kupuje se direktno od proizvođača, a u oglasu pišu količina, cena i mesto preuzimanja.

Seno pogledajte i pomirišite: dobro je zelenkasto i mirisno, bez prašine, buđi i korova. Pitajte koliko su bale teške i kako su čuvane, jer bale sa otvorenog brzo propadaju. Kod zrna su važni vlaga i čistoća, pa tražite uzorak pre veće kupovine. Dogovorite da li cena uključuje utovar i prevoz. Prodavci neka navedu vrstu, godinu roda i količinu. Životinje za koje nabavljate hranu oglašavaju se u kategoriji [stoka i živina](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/domace-zivotinje), a balirke i prikolice za prevoz u [poljoprivrednim mašinama](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/poljoprivredne-masine).', text_en = 'Animal feed and arable crops: hay and clover in bales, straw, maize as grain and on the cob, wheat, barley, oats, soya, silage and concentrates. You buy directly from the producer, and the ad states the quantity, the price and the place of collection.

Look at the hay and smell it: good hay is greenish and fragrant, free of dust, mould and weeds. Ask how heavy the bales are and how they were stored, because bales kept in the open spoil quickly. With grain, moisture and cleanliness matter, so ask for a sample before a larger purchase. Agree on whether the price includes loading and transport. Sellers should state the type, the harvest year and the quantity. The animals you are buying feed for are advertised in [livestock and poultry](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/domace-zivotinje), and balers and trailers for transport in [farm machinery](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/poljoprivredne-masine).' WHERE slug = 'feed' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Domaći proizvodi direktno od proizvođača: rakija od šljive, dunje, kajsije i kruške, med i pčelinji proizvodi, ajvar, zimnica, slatko i džemovi, sir, kajmak, suvo meso, jaja, voće i povrće. Kupovinom kod domaćina dobijate svež proizvod, a proizvođač bolju cenu.

Pitajte ko je i gde proizvod napravio, kada i od čega, i da li je gazdinstvo registrovano. Kod meda tražite vrstu i godinu vrcanja, a kod rakije jačinu i koliko je odležala. Lako kvarljive proizvode preuzmite lično i proverite kako su čuvani. Prodavci neka navedu količinu, pakovanje, cenu po kilogramu ili litru i da li šalju kurirskom službom. Za sopstveni zasad tu su [voćne sadnice](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/sadnice/vocne-sadnice), a košnice i oprema za pčelare su u [pčelarstvu](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/pcelarstvo).', text_en = 'Home-made products straight from the producer: plum, quince, apricot and pear rakija, honey and bee products, ajvar, preserves, jams, cheese, kajmak, cured meat, eggs, fruit and vegetables. Buying from the farm gets you a fresh product and the producer a better price.

Ask who made the product and where, when and from what, and whether the farm is registered. With honey, ask for the type and the year it was extracted, and with rakija the strength and how long it was aged. Collect perishable products in person and check how they were stored. Sellers should state the quantity, the packaging, the price per kilogram or litre and whether they ship by courier. For planting your own there are [fruit tree seedlings](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/sadnice/vocne-sadnice), and hives and equipment for beekeepers are in [beekeeping](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/pcelarstvo).' WHERE slug = 'farm-produce' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Poljoprivredna oprema i navodnjavanje: sistemi kap po kap, tifoni, rasprskivači, creva i pumpe, plastenici i folije, muzilice, hranilice i pojilice, silosi, vage i ograde za stoku. Oprema se nudi nova, od distributera, i polovna, od gazdinstava.

Kod navodnjavanja pođite od izvora vode i površine parcele: od toga zavise snaga pumpe, prečnik cevi i razmak kapaljki. Polovne trake kap po kap proverite na začepljenja, a tifon na stanje creva i turbine. Kod plastenika su važni debljina i starost folije i da li je konstrukcija pocinkovana. Muzilicu tražite da vidite u radu i pitajte kada su menjane sisne gume. Prodavci neka navedu kapacitet, dimenzije i starost opreme. Pumpe i agregate naći ćete u kategoriji [agregati i pumpe](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/agregati-i-pumpe), a mašine za obradu zemlje među [poljoprivrednim mašinama](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/poljoprivredne-masine).', text_en = 'Farm equipment and irrigation: drip systems, hose reel irrigators, sprinklers, hoses and pumps, polytunnels and film, milking machines, feeders and drinkers, silos, scales and livestock fencing. Equipment is offered new, from distributors, and used, from farms.

With irrigation, start from the water source and the size of the plot: the pump power, the pipe diameter and the dripper spacing depend on them. Check used drip tape for blockages, and a hose reel irrigator for the state of the hose and the turbine. With polytunnels, the thickness and age of the film matter, and whether the frame is galvanised. Ask to see a milking machine working and ask when the teat liners were changed. Sellers should state the capacity, the dimensions and the age of the equipment. Pumps and generators are in [generators and pumps](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/agregati-i-pumpe), and tillage machines among [farm machinery](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/poljoprivredne-masine).' WHERE slug = 'farm-equipment' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Naočare za sunce i dioptrijski okviri: Ray-Ban i druge poznate marke, ženski, muški i dečji modeli, sportske naočare, kao i futrole i dodaci. Mnoge su nošene jednu sezonu ili kupljene u pogrešnoj veličini, pa se prodaju znatno ispod cene u optici.

Kod naočara za sunce najvažnija je UV zaštita: tražite oznaku UV400 ili CE na okviru, jer tamna stakla bez filtera štete očima više nego da ih nemate. Originalni modeli imaju urezan broj modela i veličinu na dršci, kvalitetne šarke i futrolu. Stakla pogledajte prema svetlu, da vidite ogrebotine. Kod dioptrijskih okvira pitajte optičara da li u njih mogu da se ugrade vaša stakla. Prodavci neka navedu marku, model i širinu okvira. Uz naočare pogledajte i [satove](/oglasi/moda/satovi), [torbe i novčanike](/oglasi/moda/torbe) i [nakit](/oglasi/moda/nakit).', text_en = 'Sunglasses and prescription frames: Ray-Ban and other well-known brands, women''s, men''s and children''s models, sports glasses, plus cases and accessories. Many were worn for one season or bought in the wrong size, so they sell well below the optician''s price.

With sunglasses, UV protection matters most: look for the UV400 or CE mark on the frame, because dark lenses without a filter harm your eyes more than wearing none. Genuine models have the model number and size engraved on the temple, quality hinges and a case. Hold the lenses up to the light to spot scratches. With prescription frames, ask an optician whether your lenses can be fitted into them. Sellers should state the brand, the model and the frame width. Along with glasses, see [watches](/oglasi/moda/satovi), [bags and wallets](/oglasi/moda/torbe) and [jewellery](/oglasi/moda/nakit).' WHERE slug = 'eyewear' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Nakit za svaki dan i posebne prilike: prstenje, ogrlice, narukvice, minđuše i broševi od zlata, srebra i hirurškog čelika, bižuterija, verenički prstenovi i burme, kao i ručno rađen unikatni nakit.

Kod zlata i srebra tražite žig finoće na unutrašnjoj strani i tačnu težinu u gramima, a za skuplje komade i račun ili sertifikat za kamen. Cenu uporedite sa cenom grama u zlatarama, uz dodatak za izradu. Veličinu prstena izmerite pre kupovine, jer neki modeli ne mogu da se prošire. Vredniji nakit preuzmite lično i, ako treba, proverite ga kod zlatara. Prodavci neka navedu materijal, finoću, težinu i dimenzije. Dukate, poluge i lomljeno zlato tražite u kategoriji [zlato i srebro](/oglasi/antikviteti/zlato), satove među [ručnim satovima](/oglasi/moda/satovi), a nakit za venčanje uz [venčanice](/oglasi/moda/vencanice).', text_en = 'Jewellery for every day and for special occasions: rings, necklaces, bracelets, earrings and brooches in gold, silver and surgical steel, costume jewellery, engagement and wedding rings, plus handmade one-off pieces.

With gold and silver, look for the hallmark on the inside and the exact weight in grams, and for more expensive pieces a receipt or a certificate for the stone. Compare the price with the price per gram at jewellers, plus something for the workmanship. Measure your ring size before buying, because some designs cannot be enlarged. Collect valuable jewellery in person and, if need be, have it checked by a jeweller. Sellers should state the material, the fineness, the weight and the dimensions. Gold coins, bars and scrap gold are in [gold and silver](/oglasi/antikviteti/zlato), watches among [wristwatches](/oglasi/moda/satovi), and wedding jewellery alongside [wedding dresses](/oglasi/moda/vencanice).' WHERE slug = 'jewelry' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Sportska odeća i obuća za trening i takmičenje: patike za trčanje, košarku, fudbal i teretanu, kopačke, dresovi, šorcevi, helanke, trenerke i jakne poznatih marki. Veličinu i boju birate u filteru.

Kod patika za trčanje pogledajte đon i petu: istrošen i nakrivljen đon više ne amortizuje, pa takve patike nisu za ozbiljniji trening. Tražite fotografiju etikete sa veličinom u centimetrima, jer se brojevi razlikuju među markama. Originalne patike imaju šifru modela na etiketi i kutiji i uredne šavove, bez tragova lepka. Prodavci neka navedu marku, model, dužinu gazišta i koliko su patike nošene. Modele za svaki dan naći ćete na stranici [patike](/oglasi/moda/patike), komplete među [trenerkama](/oglasi/moda/trenerke), a sprave za vežbanje u [fitnes opremi](/oglasi/sport/fitnes).', text_en = 'Sportswear and sports shoes for training and competition: running, basketball, football and gym shoes, football boots, jerseys, shorts, leggings, tracksuits and jackets from well-known brands. You choose the size and colour in the filter.

With running shoes, look at the sole and the heel: a worn, lopsided sole no longer cushions, so such shoes are not for serious training. Ask for a photo of the label with the size in centimetres, because sizes differ between brands. Genuine shoes have the model code on the label and the box and neat stitching with no traces of glue. Sellers should state the brand, the model, the insole length and how much the shoes were worn. Everyday models are on the [trainers](/oglasi/moda/patike) page, sets among [tracksuits](/oglasi/moda/trenerke), and exercise machines in [fitness equipment](/oglasi/sport/fitnes).' WHERE slug = 'sports-shoes' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Radna odeća, obuća i uniforme: radna odela, kombinezoni i pantalone, zaštitne cipele i čizme sa čeličnom kapom, prsluci, rukavice, šlemovi i naočare, kao i kuvarske, konobarske i medicinske uniforme. Veličinu birate u filteru.

Zaštitna obuća nosi oznaku klase: S1 je za suve prostore, a S3 ima i zaštitu od probijanja đona i vlage, pa je traže gradilišta. Proverite da kapa nije udarana i da đon nije odlepljen. Kod odeće gledajte šavove, rajsferšluse i reflektujuće trake, koje posle mnogo pranja gube sjaj. Firme često prodaju veće količine nove opreme sa lagera, pa pitajte za cenu za više komada. Prodavci neka navedu veličinu, klasu zaštite i da li je oprema nova. Alat potražite među [električnim alatima](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/alati), a posao u struci među oglasima za [građevinu i zanate](/oglasi/posao/gradjevina-i-zanati).', text_en = 'Workwear, safety footwear and uniforms: work suits, overalls and trousers, safety shoes and boots with a steel toe cap, vests, gloves, helmets and goggles, plus chef, waiter and medical uniforms. You choose the size in the filter.

Safety footwear carries a class mark: S1 is for dry areas, while S3 also has a puncture-resistant sole and protection from moisture, so building sites require it. Check that the toe cap has not taken a blow and that the sole is not coming off. With clothing, look at the seams, zips and reflective strips, which lose their shine after many washes. Companies often sell larger quantities of new stock, so ask about the price for several pieces. Sellers should state the size, the protection class and whether the gear is new. Look for tools among [power tools](/oglasi/masine-i-alati/alati), and for work in the trade among the ads for [construction and trades](/oglasi/posao/gradjevina-i-zanati).' WHERE slug = 'workwear' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Kostimi i maske za maskenbal, Noć veštica, novogodišnje priredbe i tematske žurke: dečji kostimi superheroja, princeza i životinja, kostimi za odrasle, perike, maske i boje za lice. Kostim se obično nosi jednom, pa su polovni gotovo kao novi.

Veličinu proverite prema visini deteta ili merama odrasle osobe, a ne samo prema broju na etiketi, jer kostimi imaju drugačiji kroj od obične odeće. Pitajte šta sve ulazi u komplet: šešir, plašt, pojas i rekviziti, i da li je kostim pran. Maske i boje za lice kupujte samo neotvorene. Mnogi kostime i iznajmljuju za jedan dan, što piše u oglasu. Prodavci neka navedu visinu ili uzrast i šta ide u kompletu. Odeću za svečane prilike naći ćete u kategoriji [venčanice i svečana odeća](/oglasi/moda/vencanice), a ukrase za žurku među [dekoracijama](/oglasi/namestaj/dekoracija).', text_en = 'Costumes and masks for fancy dress parties, Halloween, New Year shows and themed parties: children''s superhero, princess and animal costumes, costumes for adults, wigs, masks and face paint. A costume is usually worn once, so used ones are almost like new.

Check the size against the child''s height or the adult''s measurements, not just the number on the label, because costumes are cut differently from ordinary clothes. Ask what the set includes: hat, cape, belt and props, and whether the costume has been washed. Buy masks and face paint only unopened. Many people also rent costumes for a day, which the ad says. Sellers should state the height or age and what is in the set. Clothes for formal occasions are in [wedding and formal wear](/oglasi/moda/vencanice), and party decorations among [decorations](/oglasi/namestaj/dekoracija).' WHERE slug = 'costumes' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Kolica za bebe i decu: [kolica 3u1 i 2u1](/oglasi/deca/kolica/kolica-3-u-1) sa košem i auto-sedištem, lagana [kišobran kolica](/oglasi/deca/kolica/kisobran-kolica), sportska kolica i kolica za blizance. Vrstu kolica i uzrast deteta birate u filteru.

Kolica isprobajte uživo: sklopite ih i rasklopite, proverite kočnicu, pojaseve, točkove i amortizere i da li je ram čvrst. Izmerite gepek, jer sklopljena kolica 3u1 zauzimaju dosta mesta. Pitajte šta ide u kompletu: kišna navlaka, torba, komarnik, adapteri za sedište. Navlake koje se skidaju i peru veliki su plus. Prodavci neka navedu marku, model, godinu kupovine i koliko je dece koristilo kolica. Bezbednost u vožnji obezbeđuju [auto-sedišta](/oglasi/deca/auto-sedista), a ostalo, od hranilica do njihalica, naći ćete u [opremi za bebe](/oglasi/deca/oprema-za-bebe).', text_en = 'Prams and pushchairs: [3-in-1 and 2-in-1 travel systems](/oglasi/deca/kolica/kolica-3-u-1) with a carrycot and car seat, light [umbrella strollers](/oglasi/deca/kolica/kisobran-kolica), jogging strollers and twin pushchairs. You choose the type of stroller and the child''s age in the filter.

Try the stroller in person: fold and unfold it, check the brake, the harness, the wheels and suspension, and that the frame is solid. Measure your car boot, because a folded 3-in-1 takes up a lot of room. Ask what is included: rain cover, bag, insect net, seat adapters. Covers that come off and can be washed are a big plus. Sellers should state the brand, the model, the year of purchase and how many children used the stroller. Safety on the road comes from [car seats](/oglasi/deca/auto-sedista), and the rest, from high chairs to bouncers, is in [baby gear](/oglasi/deca/oprema-za-bebe).' WHERE slug = 'strollers' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Obuća za decu svih uzrasta: patike, sandale, čizme, gumene čizme, papuče, baletanke i prve cipelice za prohodavanje. Deca obuću prerastu za jednu sezonu, pa je polovna često jedva nošena. Veličinu i boju birate u filteru.

Kupujte prema dužini unutrašnjeg gazišta u centimetrima, a ne prema broju: izmerite detetovo stopalo i dodajte oko jedan centimetar. Pogledajte đon i petu, jer obuća nakrivljenog đona nije dobra za stopalo koje se razvija. Uložak treba da bude čist i ceo, a čičak i rajsferšlusi ispravni. Prodavci neka navedu marku, broj, dužinu gazišta i sezonu. Garderobu u istoj veličini potražite u kategoriji [odeća za decu](/oglasi/deca/odeca-za-decu), a modele za odrasle među [ženskom](/oglasi/moda/zenska-obuca) i [muškom obućom](/oglasi/moda/muska-obuca).', text_en = 'Children''s shoes for every age: trainers, sandals, boots, wellies, slippers, ballet flats and first walking shoes. Children outgrow shoes in a season, so used pairs are often barely worn. You choose the size and colour in the filter.

Buy by the insole length in centimetres, not by the size number: measure the child''s foot and add about one centimetre. Look at the sole and the heel, because shoes with a lopsided sole are not good for a developing foot. The insole should be clean and intact, and the Velcro and zips working. Sellers should state the brand, the size, the insole length and the season. Clothes in the same size are in [children''s clothing](/oglasi/deca/odeca-za-decu), and adult models among [women''s](/oglasi/moda/zenska-obuca) and [men''s shoes](/oglasi/moda/muska-obuca).' WHERE slug = 'kids-shoes' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Odeća za bebe, decu i tinejdžere: bodići, zeke i kompleti za bebe, majice, trenerke, farmerke, haljine, jakne i skafanderi, svečana odeća i školske uniforme. Česti su i paketi odeće po uzrastu, najpovoljniji način da se obnovi garderoba.

Tražite visinu deteta za koju je odeća namenjena, jer se veličine razlikuju među markama. Kod paketa zamolite za fotografiju svakog komada i pitajte ima li fleka i oštećenja. Zimske jakne i skafanderi vrede najviše ako su im rajsferšlusi ispravni i punjenje nije sleglo. Prodavci neka navedu veličinu, sezonu, sastav i da li u domu ima ljubimaca i duvanskog dima. Uz garderobu pogledajte i [obuću za decu](/oglasi/deca/obuca-za-decu), a rančeve i pribor za polazak u školu u kategoriji [školski pribor](/oglasi/deca/skolski-pribor).', text_en = 'Clothes for babies, children and teenagers: bodysuits, sleepsuits and baby sets, T-shirts, tracksuits, jeans, dresses, jackets and snowsuits, formal clothes and school uniforms. Bundles of clothes by age are common too, the cheapest way to renew a wardrobe.

Ask for the child''s height the clothes are meant for, because sizes differ between brands. With bundles, ask for a photo of every piece and whether there are stains or damage. Winter jackets and snowsuits are worth most if the zips work and the filling has not gone flat. Sellers should state the size, the season, the fabric and whether there are pets or tobacco smoke in the home. Along with clothes, see [children''s shoes](/oglasi/deca/obuca-za-decu), and backpacks and supplies for starting school in [school supplies](/oglasi/deca/skolski-pribor).' WHERE slug = 'kids-clothing' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Bicikli i trotineti za decu: balans bicikli bez pedala, bicikli sa pomoćnim točkovima, modeli od 12 do 24 inča, tricikli i trotineti na dva i tri točka. Veličinu točka birate u filteru.

Veličinu birajte prema visini deteta, a ne prema godinama: dete treba da stopalima dohvati tlo dok sedi. Ne kupujte veći bicikl „da traje“, jer ga dete teže kontroliše. Proverite kočnice, lanac, gume i da li se volan i sedište podešavaju po visini. Kod trotineta pogledajte ležajeve i mehanizam za sklapanje. Uz bicikl obavezno nabavite i kacigu. Prodavci neka navedu veličinu točka, uzrast i stanje guma. Kad dete preraste dečji model, pogledajte [bicikle](/oglasi/sport/bicikli), a rolere i skejtove naći ćete u kategoriji [roleri i skejt](/oglasi/sport/roleri-i-skejt).', text_en = 'Bikes and scooters for children: balance bikes without pedals, bikes with stabilisers, models from 12 to 24 inches, tricycles and two- and three-wheel scooters. You choose the wheel size in the filter.

Choose the size by the child''s height, not age: the child should reach the ground with their feet while seated. Do not buy a bigger bike "to last", because the child will find it harder to control. Check the brakes, the chain, the tyres and whether the handlebars and saddle adjust in height. On a scooter, look at the bearings and the folding mechanism. Always get a helmet with the bike. Sellers should state the wheel size, the age range and the condition of the tyres. When the child outgrows a children''s model, see [bikes](/oglasi/sport/bicikli); roller skates and skateboards are in [skates and skateboards](/oglasi/sport/roleri-i-skejt).' WHERE slug = 'kids-bikes' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Oprema za bebe: [hranilice](/oglasi/deca/oprema-za-bebe/hranilice), njihalice i ležaljke, kadice i stalci, ogradice, hodalice, bebi alarmi, sterilizatori, grejači flašica i pumpice. Većina se koristi kratko, pa je polovna oprema odlično očuvana i mnogo jeftinija.

Proverite pojaseve, kopče i kočnice i da li se oprema stabilno sklapa. Kod njihalica i ležaljki gledajte nosivost i uzrast do kog se koriste. Stvari koje dolaze u dodir sa hranom i ustima, kao što su cucle, flašice i delovi pumpice, kupujte nove ili ih zamenite. Tražite uputstvo i pitajte da li se navlake peru. Prodavci neka navedu marku, uzrast i šta ide u kompletu. Za san su tu [krevetići i dečji nameštaj](/oglasi/deca/decji-namestaj), za šetnju [kolica](/oglasi/deca/kolica), a za igru [igračke](/oglasi/deca/igracke).', text_en = 'Baby gear: [high chairs](/oglasi/deca/oprema-za-bebe/hranilice), bouncers and rockers, baby baths and stands, playpens, walkers, baby monitors, sterilisers, bottle warmers and breast pumps. Most of it is used briefly, so second-hand gear is in excellent condition and much cheaper.

Check the harness, the buckles and the brakes, and that the item locks firmly when unfolded. With bouncers and rockers, look at the weight limit and the age up to which they are used. Buy new, or replace, anything that touches food and the mouth, such as teats, bottles and pump parts. Ask for the manual and whether the covers are washable. Sellers should state the brand, the age range and what is included. For sleep there are [cots and children''s furniture](/oglasi/deca/decji-namestaj), for walks [strollers](/oglasi/deca/kolica), and for play [toys](/oglasi/deca/igracke).' WHERE slug = 'baby-gear' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Auto-sedišta, busteri i nosiljke za decu: jaja za novorođenčad, sedišta za decu do 36 kilograma, modeli sa isofix sistemom i okretnim postoljem, kao i kengur nosiljke i marame. Uzrast deteta birate u filteru.

Sedište birajte prema visini i težini deteta i proverite da li odgovara vašem automobilu, posebno ako se kači na isofix. Polovno sedište kupujte samo ako sigurno znate da nije bilo u udesu: oštećenja se ne vide, a sedište više ne štiti. Na nalepnici pogledajte oznaku homologacije i datum proizvodnje, jer plastika vremenom stari. Proverite pojaseve i kopču. Prodavci neka navedu marku, grupu, godinu proizvodnje i da li ide baza. Za šetnju pogledajte [kolica](/oglasi/deca/kolica), a ostalu [auto opremu](/oglasi/vozila/auto-oprema) naći ćete među oglasima za vozila.', text_en = 'Car seats, boosters and baby carriers: infant carriers for newborns, seats for children up to 36 kilograms, models with isofix and a swivel base, plus baby carriers and slings. You choose the child''s age in the filter.

Choose the seat by the child''s height and weight and check that it fits your car, especially if it attaches with isofix. Buy a used seat only if you know for certain it has not been in a crash: the damage cannot be seen, yet the seat no longer protects. On the label, look for the approval mark and the production date, because plastic ages over time. Check the harness and the buckle. Sellers should state the brand, the group, the year of manufacture and whether the base is included. For walks see [strollers](/oglasi/deca/kolica), and other [car accessories](/oglasi/vozila/auto-oprema) are among the vehicle ads.' WHERE slug = 'car-seats' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Školski pribor i rančevi: anatomski rančevi i torbe, pernice, sveske, pribor za likovno i tehničko, kalkulatori, globusi i table za pisanje. Ponuda je najveća krajem leta, pred polazak u školu.

Ranac birajte prema leđima deteta: treba da ima čvrstu anatomsku poleđinu i široke podesive naramenice, a prazan ne sme da bude težak. Proverite rajsferšluse, dno i šavove na naramenicama. Kompleti sa pernicom i torbom za fizičko obično su povoljniji od pojedinačnih delova. Likovni pribor i sveske kupujte nekorišćene. Prodavci neka navedu marku, dimenzije i za koji je razred ranac. Knjige za školu potražite među [udžbenicima i lektirom](/oglasi/knjige/udzbenici), radni sto i stolicu u [dečjem nameštaju](/oglasi/deca/decji-namestaj), a pomoć u učenju nude [privatni časovi](/oglasi/usluge/casovi-i-kursevi).', text_en = 'School supplies and backpacks: ergonomic backpacks and bags, pencil cases, notebooks, art and technical drawing supplies, calculators, globes and writing boards. The offer is biggest at the end of summer, before school starts.

Choose a backpack by the child''s back: it should have a firm ergonomic back panel and wide adjustable straps, and must not be heavy when empty. Check the zips, the base and the stitching on the straps. Sets with a pencil case and a PE bag are usually better value than separate pieces. Buy art supplies and notebooks unused. Sellers should state the brand, the dimensions and which school year the backpack suits. Look for school books among [textbooks and set reading](/oglasi/knjige/udzbenici), a desk and chair in [children''s furniture](/oglasi/deca/decji-namestaj), and help with learning from [private lessons](/oglasi/usluge/casovi-i-kursevi).' WHERE slug = 'school-supplies' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Ostalo za decu okuplja sve što nema svoju kategoriju: oprema za dečje rođendane, ukrasi za dečju sobu, koferi i torbe za decu, bazeni i oprema za plažu, kao i paketi raznih stvari koje je dete preraslo.

U oglasu napišite za koji je uzrast predmet, u kakvom je stanju i šta sve ide uz njega, i dodajte više fotografija. Kod paketa nabrojte sadržaj, da kupac ne mora da pita. Kupcima savetujemo da stvari za bebe pregledaju uživo i da provere sitne delove koji mogu da otpadnu. Ako predmet ima svoju kategoriju, izaberite nju, jer ga tamo roditelji prvo traže: [igračke](/oglasi/deca/igracke), [odeća za decu](/oglasi/deca/odeca-za-decu), [oprema za bebe](/oglasi/deca/oprema-za-bebe) ili [dečji bicikli i trotineti](/oglasi/deca/decji-bicikli).', text_en = 'Other items for children gathers everything without a category of its own: supplies for children''s birthday parties, decorations for a child''s room, children''s suitcases and bags, paddling pools and beach gear, plus bundles of assorted things a child has outgrown.

In your ad, say which age the item is for, what condition it is in and what comes with it, and add several photos. With bundles, list the contents so the buyer does not have to ask. We advise buyers to inspect baby items in person and to check small parts that could come off. If the item has a category of its own, choose that one, because that is where parents look first: [toys](/oglasi/deca/igracke), [children''s clothing](/oglasi/deca/odeca-za-decu), [baby gear](/oglasi/deca/oprema-za-bebe) or [children''s bikes and scooters](/oglasi/deca/decji-bicikli).' WHERE slug = 'kids-other' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Fitnes oprema za kućnu teretanu: [trake za trčanje](/oglasi/sport/fitnes/trake-za-trcanje), [sobni bicikli i orbitreci](/oglasi/sport/fitnes/sobni-bicikli), [tegovi i bučice](/oglasi/sport/fitnes/tegovi-i-bucice), klupe, šipke, kućne teretane, steperi, veslačke sprave, elastične trake i prostirke. Sprave se često prodaju malo korišćene, pa se može dobro uštedeti.

Traku za trčanje i orbitrek obavezno isprobajte: poslušajte motor i ležajeve, proverite da traka ne proklizava i da računar pokazuje sve vrednosti. Pogledajte najveću dozvoljenu težinu korisnika i dimenzije sprave, i u radu i sklopljene. Kod tegova proverite da li ploče odgovaraju prečniku vaše šipke. Dogovorite prevoz, jer su sprave teške i kabaste. Prodavci neka navedu marku, nosivost i starost. Obuću i odeću za trening naći ćete u kategoriji [sportska odeća i obuća](/oglasi/moda/sportska-obuca).', text_en = 'Fitness equipment for a home gym: [treadmills](/oglasi/sport/fitnes/trake-za-trcanje), [exercise bikes and cross-trainers](/oglasi/sport/fitnes/sobni-bicikli), [weights and dumbbells](/oglasi/sport/fitnes/tegovi-i-bucice), benches, bars, multi-gyms, steppers, rowing machines, resistance bands and mats. Machines are often sold lightly used, so you can save a good deal.

Always try a treadmill or a cross-trainer: listen to the motor and the bearings, check that the belt does not slip and that the console shows all the readings. Look at the maximum user weight and the dimensions of the machine, both in use and folded. With weights, check that the plates fit the diameter of your bar. Arrange transport, because the machines are heavy and bulky. Sellers should state the brand, the weight limit and the age. Shoes and clothes for training are in [sportswear and sports shoes](/oglasi/moda/sportska-obuca).' WHERE slug = 'fitness' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Oprema za zimske sportove: [skije i pancerice](/oglasi/sport/zimski-sportovi/skije-i-pancerice), snoubord daske i čizme, [ski odeća](/oglasi/sport/zimski-sportovi/ski-odeca), kacige, naočare i štapovi, kao i [sanke i klizaljke](/oglasi/sport/zimski-sportovi/sanke-i-klizaljke). Dužinu skija i veličinu birate u filteru, a ponuda je najveća pred početak sezone.

Dužinu skija birajte prema visini, težini i znanju: početnicima odgovaraju kraće i mekše. Pogledajte ivice i klizne površine, a vezove obavezno dajte na podešavanje u servis. Pancerice se biraju po dužini stopala u centimetrima i moraju da stežu ravnomerno, bez žuljanja. Kacigu koja je pretrpela udarac ne treba kupovati. Prodavci neka navedu dužinu, radijus, model vezova i broj sezona. Smeštaj uz staze potražite na stranicama [Kopaonik](/oglasi/odmor/planine/kopaonik) i [Zlatibor](/oglasi/odmor/planine/zlatibor).', text_en = 'Winter sports equipment: [skis and ski boots](/oglasi/sport/zimski-sportovi/skije-i-pancerice), snowboards and boots, [ski clothing](/oglasi/sport/zimski-sportovi/ski-odeca), helmets, goggles and poles, plus [sledges and ice skates](/oglasi/sport/zimski-sportovi/sanke-i-klizaljke). You choose the ski length and the size in the filter, and the offer is biggest just before the season starts.

Choose the ski length by your height, weight and skill: shorter and softer skis suit beginners. Look at the edges and the bases, and always have the bindings adjusted at a service shop. Ski boots are chosen by foot length in centimetres and must grip evenly, without pressure points. A helmet that has taken a blow should not be bought. Sellers should state the length, the radius, the binding model and the number of seasons. Look for accommodation by the slopes on the [Kopaonik](/oglasi/odmor/planine/kopaonik) and [Zlatibor](/oglasi/odmor/planine/zlatibor) pages.' WHERE slug = 'winter-sports' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Oprema za ribolov: štapovi i mašinice za šaranski ribolov, varaličarenje, plovak i fider, najloni, udice i varalice, signalizatori, čuvarke i meredovi, stolice, šatori i čamci za ribolov. Ribolovci često prodaju opremu u kompletu, što je dobar početak za novajlije.

Štap sastavite i proverite spojeve, vodiče i vrh, a mašinicu okrenite: hod treba da bude gladak i tih, a kočnica da popušta ravnomerno. Pitajte gde je oprema korišćena, jer slana voda brže troši ležajeve. Elektroniku tražite da vidite u radu. Ne zaboravite da za ribolov treba dozvola za tekuću godinu. Prodavci neka navedu dužinu i akciju štapa, veličinu mašinice i šta ide u kompletu. Plovila i motore naći ćete u kategoriji [čamci](/oglasi/vozila/camci), šatore i vreće u [kamp opremi](/oglasi/sport/kampovanje), a smeštaj uz vodu među [jezerima i rekama](/oglasi/odmor/jezera-i-reke).', text_en = 'Fishing tackle: rods and reels for carp fishing, spinning, float and feeder fishing, lines, hooks and lures, bite alarms, keepnets and landing nets, chairs, bivvies and fishing boats. Anglers often sell their gear as a set, which is a good start for newcomers.

Assemble the rod and check the joints, the guides and the tip, and turn the reel: it should run smoothly and quietly, and the drag should give evenly. Ask where the gear was used, because salt water wears the bearings faster. Ask to see electronics working. Remember that fishing requires a permit for the current year. Sellers should state the length and action of the rod, the reel size and what is in the set. Boats and motors are in [boats](/oglasi/vozila/camci), tents and sleeping bags in [camping gear](/oglasi/sport/kampovanje), and places to stay by the water among [lakes and rivers](/oglasi/odmor/jezera-i-reke).' WHERE slug = 'fishing' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Električni trotineti za grad: Xiaomi, Ninebot i drugi modeli za odrasle, lakši modeli za decu, jači trotineti sa sedištem, kao i gume, baterije, punjači i delovi. Brz su i jeftin prevoz na kraćim relacijama, a sklopljeni staju u gepek ili lift.

Najvažnija je baterija: pitajte koliko kilometara trotinet prelazi sa jednim punjenjem danas, a ne koliko je prelazio nov, i koliko je ukupno prešao. Probajte ga u vožnji: proverite kočnice, mehanizam za sklapanje, zazor na stubu volana i svetla. Pogledajte najveću nosivost i da li su gume pune ili na naduvavanje. Raspitajte se o propisima, jer postoje ograničenja uzrasta i brzine i obavezna oprema. Prodavci neka navedu model, pređene kilometre i starost baterije. Za duže relacije pogledajte [električne bicikle](/oglasi/sport/bicikli/elektricni-bicikli), a modele bez motora u [dečjim biciklima i trotinetima](/oglasi/deca/decji-bicikli).', text_en = 'Electric scooters for the city: Xiaomi, Ninebot and other models for adults, lighter models for children, stronger scooters with a seat, plus tyres, batteries, chargers and parts. They are a fast and cheap way to cover short distances, and folded they fit into a car boot or a lift.

The battery matters most: ask how many kilometres the scooter covers on one charge today, not when it was new, and how far it has travelled in total. Take it for a ride: check the brakes, the folding mechanism, play in the steering column and the lights. Look at the maximum load and whether the tyres are solid or pneumatic. Ask about the rules, because there are limits on age and speed and compulsory equipment. Sellers should state the model, the mileage and the age of the battery. For longer distances see [electric bikes](/oglasi/sport/bicikli/elektricni-bicikli), and models without a motor in [children''s bikes and scooters](/oglasi/deca/decji-bicikli).' WHERE slug = 'e-scooters' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Roleri, skejtbordovi i oprema za ostale sportove: roleri za decu i odrasle, podesivi po veličini, skejt i longbord daske, štitnici i kacige, ali i lopte, reketi za tenis i stoni tenis, stolovi za stoni tenis, pikado i oprema za timske sportove.

Rolere birajte po dužini stopala i proverite ležajeve, točkiće i kopče: istrošeni točkići mogu da se zamene, ali napukla čizma ne može. Kod skejta pogledajte ima li daska pukotina i da li je izgubila elastičnost, kao i osovine i ležajeve. Štitnici za kolena, laktove i zglobove i kaciga obavezni su za početnike. Kod reketa su važni težina i veličina drške. Prodavci neka navedu veličinu, marku i koliko je oprema korišćena. Dečje modele na točkovima naći ćete među [dečjim biciklima i trotinetima](/oglasi/deca/decji-bicikli), a obuću za teren u kategoriji [sportska odeća i obuća](/oglasi/moda/sportska-obuca).', text_en = 'Roller skates, skateboards and gear for other sports: skates for children and adults, adjustable in size, skateboards and longboards, pads and helmets, but also balls, tennis and table tennis rackets, table tennis tables, darts and team sports equipment.

Choose skates by foot length and check the bearings, the wheels and the buckles: worn wheels can be replaced, but a cracked boot cannot. On a skateboard, look for cracks in the deck and whether it has lost its spring, and check the trucks and bearings. Knee, elbow and wrist pads and a helmet are a must for beginners. With rackets, the weight and the grip size matter. Sellers should state the size, the brand and how much the gear was used. Children''s models on wheels are among [children''s bikes and scooters](/oglasi/deca/decji-bicikli), and shoes for the court in [sportswear and sports shoes](/oglasi/moda/sportska-obuca).' WHERE slug = 'skating' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Oprema za sportove na vodi: SUP daske na naduvavanje i tvrde, kajaci i kanui, daske za surfovanje i kajt, vesla, prsluci za spasavanje, neoprenska odela, maske, peraja i ronilačka oprema.

SUP dasku naduvajte do preporučenog pritiska i ostavite je neko vreme: ne sme da gubi vazduh, a šavovi i ventil treba da budu čisti i celi. Kod kajaka pregledajte dno na duboke ogrebotine i pukotine i proverite sedište i pregrade. Nosivost daske ili kajaka birajte prema svojoj težini i prtljagu. Neoprensko odelo mora da prianja uz telo, pa ga probajte. Prsluk za spasavanje nosite uvek, ma koliko dobro plivali. Prodavci neka navedu dimenzije, nosivost i šta ide u kompletu: pumpa, veslo, torba. Veća plovila i motore naći ćete u kategoriji [čamci i plovila](/oglasi/vozila/camci), a odmor uz vodu u ponudi [jezera i reke](/oglasi/odmor/jezera-i-reke).', text_en = 'Water sports equipment: inflatable and hard SUP boards, kayaks and canoes, surfboards and kites, paddles, life jackets, wetsuits, masks, fins and diving gear.

Inflate a SUP board to the recommended pressure and leave it for a while: it must not lose air, and the seams and valve should be clean and intact. With a kayak, inspect the hull for deep scratches and cracks and check the seat and bulkheads. Choose the load capacity of a board or kayak by your weight and luggage. A wetsuit has to fit close to the body, so try it on. Always wear a life jacket, however well you swim. Sellers should state the dimensions, the load capacity and what is in the set: pump, paddle, bag. Bigger craft and motors are in [boats](/oglasi/vozila/camci), and holidays by the water in [lakes and rivers](/oglasi/odmor/jezera-i-reke).' WHERE slug = 'water-sports' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Oprema za kampovanje i planinarenje: šatori za dve osobe i porodični šatori, vreće za spavanje, podmetači i dušeci na naduvavanje, rančevi, planinarske cipele i štapovi, gorionici, posuđe, lampe i prenosivi frižideri.

Šator razapnite pre kupovine: proverite šipke, rajsferšluse, podnicu i šavove, i pitajte za vodootpornost u milimetrima vodenog stuba. Vreću za spavanje birajte prema temperaturi komfora, a ne prema ekstremnoj. Ranac probajte natovaren, jer se udobnost vidi tek pod teretom. Planinarske cipele kupujte po dužini stopala, sa mestom za deblju čarapu, i pogledajte đon. Prodavci neka navedu broj osoba, težinu i sezonu za koju je oprema. Vozilo za putovanje potražite među [kamp prikolicama i kamperima](/oglasi/vozila/prikolice), a brvnare i seoska domaćinstva u [seoskom turizmu](/oglasi/odmor/seoski-turizam).', text_en = 'Camping and hiking gear: two-person and family tents, sleeping bags, mats and air beds, backpacks, hiking boots and poles, stoves, cookware, lamps and portable coolers.

Pitch a tent before buying: check the poles, zips, groundsheet and seams, and ask about the waterproof rating in millimetres of water column. Choose a sleeping bag by its comfort temperature, not the extreme one. Try a backpack loaded, because comfort only shows under weight. Buy hiking boots by foot length, with room for a thicker sock, and look at the sole. Sellers should state the number of people, the weight and the season the gear is for. Look for a vehicle to travel in among [caravans and campervans](/oglasi/vozila/prikolice), and for log cabins and farm stays in [rural tourism](/oglasi/odmor/seoski-turizam).' WHERE slug = 'camping' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Oprema za lov: lovačka odeća i obuća, dvogledi, durbini i optički nišani, lovački noževi, futrole i kaiševi, rančevi, vabilice, čeke i hranilice, kao i oprema za lovačke pse.

Vatreno oružje i municija prodaju se samo u skladu sa zakonom: kupac mora da ima odobrenje za nabavku, a promena vlasnika prijavljuje se policiji. Optiku proverite u sumrak, kada se najbolje vidi kvalitet stakla, i pogledajte da sočiva nemaju ogrebotine ni maglu iznutra. Odeća treba da bude tiha, nepromočiva i u boji koja odgovara terenu. Prodavci neka kod optike navedu marku, uvećanje i prečnik objektiva, a kod odeće veličinu. Lovačke pse naći ćete u kategoriji [psi](/oglasi/ljubimci/psi), a opremu za boravak u prirodi u [kampovanju i planinarenju](/oglasi/sport/kampovanje).', text_en = 'Hunting equipment: hunting clothing and footwear, binoculars, spotting scopes and rifle scopes, hunting knives, cases and slings, backpacks, game calls, high seats and feeders, plus gear for hunting dogs.

Firearms and ammunition are sold only in line with the law: the buyer must hold an acquisition permit, and the change of owner is reported to the police. Test optics at dusk, when the quality of the glass shows best, and see that the lenses have no scratches or internal fogging. Clothing should be quiet, waterproof and in a colour that suits the terrain. For optics, sellers should state the brand, the magnification and the lens diameter, and for clothing the size. Hunting dogs are in [dogs](/oglasi/ljubimci/psi), and gear for staying outdoors in [camping and hiking](/oglasi/sport/kampovanje).' WHERE slug = 'hunting' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Oprema za borilačke sportove: bokserske rukavice i bandažeri, džakovi i fokuseri, kimona za džudo, karate i džiu-džicu, štitnici za zube, glavu i potkolenice, kao i strunjače i sprave za trening.

Rukavice birajte po težini u uncama: lakše su za rad na džaku, a teže za sparing. Polovne rukavice pogledajte iznutra i opipajte punjenje na zglobovima prstiju, jer istrošene više ne štite. Štitnik za zube uvek kupujte nov. Kimono se bira po visini i skuplja se pri pranju, pa pitajte da li je već pran. Na džaku proverite šavove i kačenje i raspitajte se koliko je težak. Prodavci neka navedu veličinu, težinu i marku. Tegove i klupe za snagu naći ćete u [fitnes opremi](/oglasi/sport/fitnes), a patike i odeću za trening u kategoriji [sportska odeća i obuća](/oglasi/moda/sportska-obuca).', text_en = 'Martial arts equipment: boxing gloves and hand wraps, punch bags and focus mitts, kimonos for judo, karate and jiu-jitsu, mouthguards, head guards and shin guards, plus mats and training equipment.

Choose gloves by weight in ounces: lighter ones are for bag work, heavier ones for sparring. Look inside used gloves and feel the padding over the knuckles, because worn-out ones no longer protect. Always buy a mouthguard new. A kimono is chosen by height and shrinks in the wash, so ask whether it has been washed already. On a punch bag, check the seams and the hanging straps and ask how heavy it is. Sellers should state the size, the weight and the brand. Weights and benches for strength are in [fitness equipment](/oglasi/sport/fitnes), and shoes and clothes for training in [sportswear and sports shoes](/oglasi/moda/sportska-obuca).' WHERE slug = 'martial-arts' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Medicinska i ortopedska pomagala: invalidska kolica, hodalice, štake, bolnički kreveti i antidekubit dušeci, toaletne stolice, ortoze i steznici, merači pritiska i šećera, inhalatori, koncentratori kiseonika i medicinske uniforme. Pomagala se često koriste kratko, pa se nude očuvana i po mnogo nižoj ceni.

O izboru se posavetujte sa lekarom ili fizioterapeutom, posebno kod kolica i kreveta, gde su važni širina, nosivost i podešavanja. Proverite kočnice, točkove i mehanizme, a kod električnih kreveta motor i daljinski upravljač. Aparate tražite da vidite u radu i pitajte kada su poslednji put servisirani. Delove koji dolaze u dodir sa telom, kao što su maske za inhalator, zamenite novim. Prodavci neka navedu dimenzije, nosivost i starost. Pomoć u kući nude oglasi za [negu starijih](/oglasi/usluge/lepota-i-nega), a negovatelje možete tražiti i preko oglasa za [zdravstvo i negu](/oglasi/posao/zdravstvo-i-nega).', text_en = 'Medical and orthopaedic aids: wheelchairs, walking frames, crutches, hospital beds and anti-decubitus mattresses, commode chairs, braces and supports, blood pressure and glucose meters, nebulisers, oxygen concentrators and medical uniforms. Aids are often used for a short time, so they are offered in good condition and at a much lower price.

Take advice from a doctor or physiotherapist on the choice, especially with wheelchairs and beds, where the width, the load capacity and the adjustments matter. Check the brakes, the wheels and the mechanisms, and on electric beds the motor and the remote control. Ask to see devices working and ask when they were last serviced. Replace parts that touch the body, such as nebuliser masks, with new ones. Sellers should state the dimensions, the load capacity and the age. Help at home is offered in the ads for [elderly care](/oglasi/usluge/lepota-i-nega), and you can also look for carers through the ads for [healthcare and care jobs](/oglasi/posao/zdravstvo-i-nega).' WHERE slug = 'medical' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Kozmetika i aparati za ličnu negu: fenovi, figaro i prese za kosu, uvijači, epilatori, aparati za brijanje i šišanje, šminka, preparati za negu lica, tela i kose i setovi za manikir.

Kozmetiku kupujte samo neotvorenu, u originalnom pakovanju, i proverite rok trajanja i oznaku koliko meseci proizvod traje posle otvaranja. Šminku i kreme koje je neko već koristio ne treba kupovati, iz higijenskih razloga. Aparate uključite i proverite grejanje, kabl i nastavke, a kod trimera i brijača stanje noževa i baterije. Pitajte da li postoje račun i garancija. Prodavci neka navedu marku, model i da li je proizvod nov. Mirise ćete naći u kategoriji [parfemi](/oglasi/lepota-i-zdravlje/parfemi), profesionalne aparate u [opremi za salone](/oglasi/lepota-i-zdravlje/oprema-za-salone), a tretmane kod stručnjaka među uslugama [lepote i nege](/oglasi/usluge/lepota-i-nega).', text_en = 'Cosmetics and personal care appliances: hair dryers, hot-air stylers and straighteners, curlers, epilators, shavers and hair clippers, make-up, face, body and hair care products and manicure sets.

Buy cosmetics only unopened, in the original packaging, and check the expiry date and the mark showing how many months the product lasts after opening. Make-up and creams that someone has already used should not be bought, for reasons of hygiene. Switch appliances on and check the heating, the cable and the attachments, and on trimmers and shavers the state of the blades and the battery. Ask whether there is a receipt and a warranty. Sellers should state the brand, the model and whether the product is new. Fragrances are in [perfumes](/oglasi/lepota-i-zdravlje/parfemi), professional machines in [salon equipment](/oglasi/lepota-i-zdravlje/oprema-za-salone), and treatments by professionals among [beauty and care](/oglasi/usluge/lepota-i-nega) services.' WHERE slug = 'cosmetics' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Oprema za frizerske i kozmetičke salone i salone za masažu: frizerske stolice, šamponjere i radna mesta, kozmetički kreveti i stolovi za masažu, stolovi za manikir, UV i LED lampe, sterilizatori, aparati za tretmane lica i tela i laseri za epilaciju.

Nameštaj pregledajte uživo: hidrauliku stolice, presvlake, priključke šamponjere i stabilnost kreveta. Za aparate tražite deklaraciju, uputstvo i dokaz o servisu, a kod lasera i broj ispaljenih impulsa, jer glava ima ograničen vek. Raspitajte se koja je obuka potrebna za rad na aparatu. Kad se zatvara ceo salon, oprema se često prodaje u kompletu, po povoljnijoj ceni. Prodavci neka navedu marku, starost i razlog prodaje. Prostor za salon tražite među [lokalima](/oglasi/nekretnine/poslovni-prostor), radnike preko oglasa za [frizere i kozmetičare](/oglasi/posao/frizeri-i-kozmeticari), a potrošni materijal u [kozmetici](/oglasi/lepota-i-zdravlje/kozmetika).', text_en = 'Equipment for hair, beauty and massage salons: styling chairs, backwash units and workstations, beauty couches and massage tables, manicure tables, UV and LED lamps, sterilisers, machines for face and body treatments and hair removal lasers.

Inspect furniture in person: the hydraulics of the chair, the upholstery, the connections of the backwash unit and the stability of the couch. For machines, ask for the declaration, the manual and proof of servicing, and for lasers the number of pulses fired, because the handpiece has a limited life. Ask what training is needed to work with the machine. When a whole salon closes, the equipment is often sold as a set, at a better price. Sellers should state the brand, the age and the reason for selling. Look for premises among [shops and commercial space](/oglasi/nekretnine/poslovni-prostor), for staff through the ads for [hairdressers and beauticians](/oglasi/posao/frizeri-i-kozmeticari), and for consumables in [cosmetics](/oglasi/lepota-i-zdravlje/kozmetika).' WHERE slug = 'salon-equipment' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Psi i štenci svih rasa i mešanci: od malih pasa za stan do radnih pasa i čuvara, uz oglase za udomljavanje. Rasu i starost birate u filteru. Pas je obaveza za deset i više godina, pa rasu birajte prema svom prostoru, vremenu i iskustvu.

Štene preuzmite lično, kod odgajivača, i tražite da vidite majku i leglo. Ne uzimajte štene mlađe od osam nedelja. Zdravo štene je živahno, čistih očiju i ušiju, a uz njega idu pasoš sa upisanim vakcinama, potvrda o čišćenju od parazita i mikročip. Za rasne pse tražite rodovnik. Ne plaćajte unapred za psa kog niste videli, naročito ako prodavac nudi samo slanje. Vlasnici neka navedu rasu, starost, vakcine i narav roditelja. Sve za novog člana porodice, od [hrane](/oglasi/ljubimci/oprema-za-ljubimce/hrana) do [ogrlica i povodaca](/oglasi/ljubimci/oprema-za-ljubimce/lezaljke-i-povoci), naći ćete u opremi za ljubimce, a dresuru i šišanje u [uslugama za ljubimce](/oglasi/ljubimci/usluge-za-ljubimce).', text_en = 'Dogs and puppies of every breed, and mixed breeds: from small dogs for a flat to working and guard dogs, along with adoption ads. You choose the breed and the age in the filter. A dog is a commitment for ten years or more, so choose the breed by your space, time and experience.

Collect the puppy in person, at the breeder''s, and ask to see the mother and the litter. Do not take a puppy younger than eight weeks. A healthy puppy is lively, with clean eyes and ears, and comes with a passport showing its vaccinations, proof of deworming and a microchip. For pedigree dogs, ask for the pedigree certificate. Do not pay in advance for a dog you have not seen, especially if the seller offers shipping only. Owners should state the breed, the age, the vaccinations and the temperament of the parents. Everything for the new family member, from [food](/oglasi/ljubimci/oprema-za-ljubimce/hrana) to [collars and leads](/oglasi/ljubimci/oprema-za-ljubimce/lezaljke-i-povoci), is in pet supplies, and training and grooming in [pet services](/oglasi/ljubimci/usluge-za-ljubimce).' WHERE slug = 'dogs' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Ptice za kuću i odgajivače: tigrice, nimfe, rozenkolisi i veliki papagaji, kanarinci i zebe, golubovi letači i ukrasni golubovi. Vrstu ptice birate u filteru, a oglase postavljaju odgajivači i ljubitelji iz cele zemlje.

Zdrava ptica je živahna, glatkog i potpunog perja, čistih očiju i nozdrva, i ne sedi nakostrešena na dnu kaveza. Pitajte za starost i pol i da li je ptica ručno hranjena, jer se takve lakše pripitome. Kod papagaja tražite prsten ili dokument o poreklu, a za zaštićene vrste i dozvolu. Golubove kupujte od odgajivača čije jato možete da vidite. Prodavci neka navedu vrstu, starost i da li ptica ide sa kavezom. Opremu naći ćete na stranici [kavezi i transporteri](/oglasi/ljubimci/oprema-za-ljubimce/kavezi-i-transporteri), a koke, patke i guske u kategoriji [živina](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/domace-zivotinje/zivina).', text_en = 'Birds for the home and for breeders: budgerigars, cockatiels, lovebirds and large parrots, canaries and finches, racing pigeons and fancy pigeons. You choose the type of bird in the filter, and ads come from breeders and enthusiasts all over the country.

A healthy bird is lively, with smooth and complete plumage and clean eyes and nostrils, and does not sit fluffed up on the cage floor. Ask about the age and sex and whether the bird was hand-reared, because such birds are easier to tame. With parrots, ask for a leg ring or a document of origin, and for protected species a permit. Buy pigeons from a breeder whose flock you can see. Sellers should state the species, the age and whether the bird comes with a cage. Equipment is on the [cages and carriers](/oglasi/ljubimci/oprema-za-ljubimce/kavezi-i-transporteri) page, and hens, ducks and geese in [poultry](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/domace-zivotinje/zivina).' WHERE slug = 'birds' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Mačke i mačići: persijske, britanske kratkodlake, mejn kun, sijamske i druge rase, domaće mačke i mačići za udomljavanje. Rasu i starost birate u filteru, a mnogi mačići se poklanjaju u dobre ruke.

Mače ne odvajajte od majke pre navršenih deset do dvanaest nedelja. Tražite da vidite gde je raslo: zdravo mače je radoznalo, čistih očiju, ušiju i krzna i naviknuto na posip. Uz njega treba da idu zdravstvena knjižica sa vakcinama i potvrda o čišćenju od parazita, a za rasne mačke i rodovnik. Ne plaćajte unapred za životinju koju niste videli. Vlasnici neka navedu rasu, starost, pol i da li je mačka sterilisana. Posip, grebalice i transportere naći ćete u kategoriji [oprema za ljubimce](/oglasi/ljubimci/oprema-za-ljubimce), a hranu na stranici [hrana za pse i mačke](/oglasi/ljubimci/oprema-za-ljubimce/hrana).', text_en = 'Cats and kittens: Persian, British Shorthair, Maine Coon, Siamese and other breeds, domestic cats and kittens for adoption. You choose the breed and the age in the filter, and many kittens are given away to good homes.

Do not separate a kitten from its mother before ten to twelve weeks. Ask to see where it grew up: a healthy kitten is curious, with clean eyes, ears and coat, and litter-trained. It should come with a health booklet showing its vaccinations and proof of deworming, and for pedigree cats a pedigree certificate. Do not pay in advance for an animal you have not seen. Owners should state the breed, the age, the sex and whether the cat is neutered. Litter, scratching posts and carriers are in [pet supplies](/oglasi/ljubimci/oprema-za-ljubimce), and food on the [dog and cat food](/oglasi/ljubimci/oprema-za-ljubimce/hrana) page.' WHERE slug = 'cats' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Usluge za ljubimce: pansioni i čuvanje pasa i mačaka, šišanje i kupanje, dresura i škola za pse, šetanje, prevoz ljubimaca i veterinarske usluge. Vrstu usluge birate u filteru, a u oglasu pišu područje rada i iskustvo.

Pansion obiđite pre nego što ostavite ljubimca: pogledajte bokseve i dvorište i kako se životinje ponašaju prema osoblju. Pitajte koliko pasa čuvaju odjednom, da li traže potvrdu o vakcinaciji i šta se dešava ako se ljubimac razboli. Kod dresure se raspitajte o metodama: dobar trener radi nagradom i uči i vlasnika. Kod šišanja tražite fotografije radova na istoj rasi. Ko nudi usluge, neka navede iskustvo, cenu i da li dolazi na adresu. Potrepštine su u kategoriji [oprema za ljubimce](/oglasi/ljubimci/oprema-za-ljubimce), a ako tek birate ljubimca, pogledajte oglase za [pse](/oglasi/ljubimci/psi) i [mačke](/oglasi/ljubimci/macke).', text_en = 'Pet services: boarding and sitting for dogs and cats, grooming and bathing, training and dog school, walking, pet transport and veterinary services. You choose the type of service in the filter, and the ad states the area covered and the experience.

Visit a boarding kennel before you leave your pet: look at the pens and the yard and at how the animals behave towards the staff. Ask how many dogs they look after at once, whether they require proof of vaccination and what happens if a pet falls ill. With training, ask about the methods: a good trainer works with rewards and teaches the owner too. With grooming, ask for photos of work on the same breed. Providers should state their experience, the price and whether they come to your address. Supplies are in [pet supplies](/oglasi/ljubimci/oprema-za-ljubimce), and if you are still choosing a pet, see the ads for [dogs](/oglasi/ljubimci/psi) and [cats](/oglasi/ljubimci/macke).' WHERE slug = 'pet-services' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Akvarijumske ribice, glodari i ostali ljubimci: gupike, skalari i zlatne ribice, hrčci, zamorci, kunići i činčile, kornjače, gušteri i drugi egzotični ljubimci. Vrstu i starost vlasnici navode u oglasu.

Pre nego što nabavite životinju, raspitajte se šta joj treba: veličina akvarijuma ili kaveza, temperatura, ishrana i koliko dugo živi, jer kornjače, na primer, žive decenijama. Zdrave ribice plivaju živahno i imaju cela peraja, a glodari čisto krzno, oči i nos. Za egzotične vrste tražite dokument o poreklu, jer je za neke potrebna dozvola. Zamorce ne držite same, jer su društvene životinje. Prodavci neka navedu vrstu, starost i da li ide oprema. Pogledajte i stranice [akvarijumi](/oglasi/ljubimci/oprema-za-ljubimce/akvarijumi) i [kavezi i kućice](/oglasi/ljubimci/oprema-za-ljubimce/kavezi-i-transporteri), a pernati ljubimci su u kategoriji [ptice](/oglasi/ljubimci/ptice).', text_en = 'Aquarium fish, rodents and other pets: guppies, angelfish and goldfish, hamsters, guinea pigs, rabbits and chinchillas, turtles, lizards and other exotic pets. Owners state the species and the age in the ad.

Before you get an animal, find out what it needs: the size of the tank or cage, the temperature, the diet and how long it lives, because turtles, for example, live for decades. Healthy fish swim actively and have intact fins, and rodents have a clean coat, eyes and nose. For exotic species, ask for a document of origin, because some require a permit. Do not keep guinea pigs alone, because they are social animals. Sellers should state the species, the age and whether equipment is included. See the [aquariums](/oglasi/ljubimci/oprema-za-ljubimce/akvarijumi) and [cages and kennels](/oglasi/ljubimci/oprema-za-ljubimce/kavezi-i-transporteri) pages too; feathered pets are in [birds](/oglasi/ljubimci/ptice).' WHERE slug = 'other-pets' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Smeštaj u banjama Srbije: apartmani, sobe, vile i kuće za odmor u Vrnjačkoj Banji, Sokobanji, Banji Koviljači, Prolom Banji, Ribarskoj Banji i drugim lečilištima. Gosti najčešće traže [Vrnjačku Banju](/oglasi/odmor/banje/vrnjacka-banja) i [Sokobanju](/oglasi/odmor/banje/sokobanja), a broj gostiju koje smeštaj prima vidite u oglasu.

Pre rezervacije pitajte koliko je smeštaj udaljen od izvora, kupališta, parka i šetališta, ima li parking i grejanje i da li je boravišna taksa uračunata. Tražite fotografije baš one sobe ili apartmana koji rezervišete i dogovorite uslove otkazivanja. Kaparu uplatite tek kad proverite domaćina. Vlasnici neka navedu broj kreveta, cenu po noćenju i šta je u blizini. Ako više volite visinu i sneg, pogledajte [planine](/oglasi/odmor/planine), a mir i domaću hranu nudi [seoski turizam](/oglasi/odmor/seoski-turizam).', text_en = 'Accommodation in the spa towns of Serbia: apartments, rooms, villas and holiday houses in Vrnjačka Banja, Sokobanja, Banja Koviljača, Prolom Banja, Ribarska Banja and other health resorts. Guests most often look for [Vrnjačka Banja](/oglasi/odmor/banje/vrnjacka-banja) and [Sokobanja](/oglasi/odmor/banje/sokobanja), and the ad shows how many guests a place takes.

Before booking, ask how far the place is from the springs, the baths, the park and the promenade, whether it has parking and heating, and whether the tourist tax is included. Ask for photos of the very room or apartment you are booking and agree on the cancellation terms. Pay a deposit only once you have checked the host. Owners should state the number of beds, the price per night and what is nearby. If you prefer altitude and snow, see [mountains](/oglasi/odmor/planine), while peace and home cooking are offered by [rural tourism](/oglasi/odmor/seoski-turizam).' WHERE slug = 'spas' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Smeštaj na moru direktno od vlasnika i agencija: apartmani, studiji, vile i sobe u Grčkoj, Crnoj Gori, Hrvatskoj, Bugarskoj, Turskoj i Albaniji. Zemlju birate u filteru, a u oglasu piše koliko gostiju smeštaj prima.

Pitajte koliko je smeštaj tačno udaljen od plaže, i to peške, ima li klimu, parking i kuhinju i šta se doplaćuje. Tražite adresu ili lokaciju na mapi i uporedite fotografije sa onima na drugim sajtovima. Budite oprezni sa ponudama mnogo jeftinijim od ostalih i ne šaljite ceo iznos unapred nepoznatom vlasniku: uobičajena je kapara, a ostatak po dolasku. Proverite i da li vam treba putno osiguranje. Vlasnici neka navedu mesto, broj kreveta, cenu po danu i slobodne termine. Za odmor bez prelaska granice pogledajte [jezera i reke](/oglasi/odmor/jezera-i-reke), a prevoz do mora nude oglasi za [prevoz putnika](/oglasi/usluge/selidbe-i-prevoz).', text_en = 'Seaside accommodation straight from owners and agencies: apartments, studios, villas and rooms in Greece, Montenegro, Croatia, Bulgaria, Turkey and Albania. You choose the country in the filter, and the ad says how many guests a place takes.

Ask exactly how far the place is from the beach, on foot, whether it has air conditioning, parking and a kitchen, and what costs extra. Ask for the address or the location on a map and compare the photos with those on other sites. Be careful with offers much cheaper than the rest, and do not send the full amount in advance to an owner you do not know: a deposit is usual, with the rest paid on arrival. Check whether you need travel insurance too. Owners should state the resort, the number of beds, the price per day and the free dates. For a holiday without crossing a border see [lakes and rivers](/oglasi/odmor/jezera-i-reke), and transport to the coast is offered in the ads for [passenger transport](/oglasi/usluge/selidbe-i-prevoz).' WHERE slug = 'seaside' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Smeštaj na jezerima i rekama Srbije: apartmani, vikendice, splavovi i kuće na vodi na Srebrnom jezeru, Paliću, Perućcu, Drini, Savi i Dunavu. Gosti najčešće traže [Srebrno jezero](/oglasi/odmor/jezera-i-reke/srebrno-jezero) i [Palić](/oglasi/odmor/jezera-i-reke/palic).

Pitajte da li smeštaj ima izlaz na vodu, plažu ili ponton i da li je kupanje na tom mestu uređeno i bezbedno, naročito ako putujete sa decom. Raspitajte se za komarce i klimu, parking, roštilj i da li je dozvoljen ribolov sa placa. Kod splavova i kuća na vodi proverite prilaz i struju. Tražite fotografije iz tekuće sezone, jer se vodostaj i plaže menjaju. Vlasnici neka navedu broj gostiju, cenu po noćenju i udaljenost od vode. Daske i kajake naći ćete u kategoriji [sportovi na vodi](/oglasi/sport/vodeni-sportovi), a pribor za pecanje u [ribolovu](/oglasi/sport/ribolov).', text_en = 'Accommodation on the lakes and rivers of Serbia: apartments, cottages, rafts and houses on the water at Srebrno Jezero, Palić, Perućac, on the Drina, the Sava and the Danube. Guests most often look for [Srebrno Jezero](/oglasi/odmor/jezera-i-reke/srebrno-jezero) and [Palić](/oglasi/odmor/jezera-i-reke/palic).

Ask whether the place has access to the water, a beach or a pontoon, and whether swimming there is organised and safe, especially if you travel with children. Ask about mosquitoes and air conditioning, parking, a barbecue, and whether fishing from the plot is allowed. With rafts and houses on the water, check the access and the electricity. Ask for photos from the current season, because the water level and the beaches change. Owners should state the number of guests, the price per night and the distance from the water. Boards and kayaks are in [water sports](/oglasi/sport/vodeni-sportovi), and fishing tackle in [fishing](/oglasi/sport/ribolov).' WHERE slug = 'lakes-rivers' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Seoski turizam i brvnare: etno domaćinstva, salaši, brvnare sa kaminom i đakuzijem, planinske kolibe i kuće za odmor na selu. Ovakav smeštaj biraju porodice sa decom i društva koja traže mir, prirodu i domaću kuhinju.

Pitajte da li se izdaje cela kuća ili samo sobe, da li domaćini nude obroke i šta se od sadržaja doplaćuje: đakuzi, sauna, drva za kamin. Raspitajte se kakav je put do kuće, posebno zimi, i ima li signala i interneta, ako vam trebaju. Proverite da li su ljubimci dobrodošli i koliko gostiju kuća najviše prima. Vlasnici neka navedu broj ležajeva, cenu po noćenju za celu kuću i šta se u okolini može videti. Domaću rakiju, sir i med domaćini prodaju u kategoriji [domaći proizvodi](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/domaci-proizvodi). Za centre sa ski stazama pogledajte [planine](/oglasi/odmor/planine), a ako biste kuću za odmor da kupite, tu su [vikendice](/oglasi/nekretnine/vikendice).', text_en = 'Rural tourism and log cabins: ethno households, farmsteads, log cabins with a fireplace and a hot tub, mountain huts and holiday houses in the countryside. Such places are chosen by families with children and groups looking for peace, nature and home cooking.

Ask whether the whole house is let or just rooms, whether the hosts offer meals and which facilities cost extra: hot tub, sauna, firewood. Ask what the road to the house is like, especially in winter, and whether there is mobile signal and internet, if you need them. Check whether pets are welcome and the maximum number of guests. Owners should state the number of beds, the price per night for the whole house and what there is to see nearby. Hosts sell home-made rakija, cheese and honey in [home-made products](/oglasi/poljoprivreda/domaci-proizvodi). For resorts with ski slopes see [mountains](/oglasi/odmor/planine), and if you would rather buy a holiday house, there are [cottages](/oglasi/nekretnine/vikendice).' WHERE slug = 'rural' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Muzička oprema i ozvučenje: aktivne i pasivne zvučne kutije, pojačala, miksete, mikrofoni, zvučne kartice, studijski monitori, di-džej kontroleri, rasveta i stalci. Opremu nude muzičari, bendovi i studiji koji je obnavljaju.

Zvučnike poslušajte na većoj glasnoći: ne sme biti krčanja ni izobličenja, a membrane treba da budu cele. Na mikseti proverite sve kanale, potenciometre i klizače, a kod mikrofona kapsulu i kabl. Pitajte da li je oprema radila na svirkama ili samo u studiju, jer teren ostavlja traga. Za bežične mikrofone raspitajte se na kojoj frekvenciji rade. Prodavci neka navedu snagu, model i šta ide uz opremu: kablovi, koferi, stalci. Kućne zvučnike i hi-fi uređaje naći ćete u kategoriji [audio oprema](/oglasi/elektronika/audio), instrumente među [gitarama](/oglasi/muzika/gitare) i [klavijaturama](/oglasi/muzika/klaviri), a bendove u [uslugama za proslave](/oglasi/usluge/proslave).', text_en = 'Music equipment and PA systems: active and passive speakers, amplifiers, mixing desks, microphones, audio interfaces, studio monitors, DJ controllers, lighting and stands. The gear is offered by musicians, bands and studios that are upgrading.

Listen to speakers at higher volume: there must be no crackling or distortion, and the cones should be intact. On a mixing desk, check every channel, knob and fader, and on a microphone the capsule and the cable. Ask whether the gear was used at gigs or only in a studio, because the road leaves its mark. For wireless microphones, ask which frequency they use. Sellers should state the power, the model and what comes with the gear: cables, cases, stands. Home speakers and hi-fi are in [audio](/oglasi/elektronika/audio), instruments among [guitars](/oglasi/muzika/gitare) and [keyboards](/oglasi/muzika/klaviri), and bands in [services for celebrations](/oglasi/usluge/proslave).' WHERE slug = 'pro-audio' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Klaviri, pijanina i klavijature: akustični klaviri i pijanina, digitalni klaviri sa teškom klavijaturom, sintisajzeri, aranžeri i midi klavijature. Instrument za početnika, ozbiljno vežbanje ili nastup naći ćete po ceni znatno nižoj od nove.

Akustični klavir pre kupovine treba da pogleda štimer: on će proceniti rezonantnu ploču, čekiće i da li instrument drži štim. Uračunajte i prevoz, koji rade specijalizovane ekipe, i štimovanje posle selidbe. Kod digitalnog klavira pritisnite svaku dirku i proverite pedale, izlaze i zvučnike. Za učenje je važna klavijatura sa 88 dirki pune težine. Prodavci neka navedu marku, model, starost i kada je klavir poslednji put štimovan. Nastavnike naći ćete među [privatnim časovima](/oglasi/usluge/casovi-i-kursevi), a pojačala i razglas za nastupe u kategoriji [ozvučenje](/oglasi/muzika/ozvucenje).', text_en = 'Grand pianos, upright pianos and keyboards: acoustic grands and uprights, digital pianos with weighted keys, synthesizers, arranger keyboards and MIDI keyboards. An instrument for a beginner, for serious practice or for the stage can be found for much less than a new one.

An acoustic piano should be seen by a tuner before you buy: they will assess the soundboard, the hammers and whether the instrument holds its tuning. Add the cost of transport, done by specialised crews, and of tuning after the move. On a digital piano, press every key and check the pedals, the outputs and the speakers. For learning, a keyboard with 88 fully weighted keys matters. Sellers should state the brand, the model, the age and when the piano was last tuned. Teachers are among [private lessons](/oglasi/usluge/casovi-i-kursevi), and amplifiers and PA for performances in [pro audio](/oglasi/muzika/ozvucenje).' WHERE slug = 'pianos' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Bubnjevi i udaraljke: akustični kompleti, električni bubnjevi za vežbanje u stanu, činele, doboši, pedale, stalci i stolice, kao i kahoni, tarabuke, bongosi i druge udaraljke.

Kod akustičnog kompleta pogledajte korpuse iznutra i spolja: ne sme biti pukotina ni odlepljenog furnira, a ivice na koje naleže plastika treba da budu ravne. Na stalcima i pedalama proverite navoje i mehanizme, a činele pregledajte na pukotine, naročito uz ivicu i oko rupe. Plastike su potrošni deo, pa ih uračunajte u cenu. Kod električnih bubnjeva udarite svaki ped i proverite modul i kablove. Prodavci neka navedu marku, dimenzije bubnjeva i šta sve ide u kompletu. Za probe i nastupe potražite [ozvučenje i mikrofone](/oglasi/muzika/ozvucenje), a ostatak benda opremite u kategoriji [gitare](/oglasi/muzika/gitare).', text_en = 'Drums and percussion: acoustic kits, electronic drums for practising in a flat, cymbals, snare drums, pedals, stands and stools, plus cajons, darbukas, bongos and other percussion.

With an acoustic kit, look at the shells inside and out: there must be no cracks or lifting veneer, and the bearing edges the heads sit on should be even. Check the threads and mechanisms of stands and pedals, and inspect cymbals for cracks, especially along the edge and around the hole. Heads are consumables, so allow for them in the price. On electronic drums, hit every pad and check the module and the cables. Sellers should state the brand, the drum sizes and everything that is in the kit. For rehearsals and gigs look for [PA and microphones](/oglasi/muzika/ozvucenje), and equip the rest of the band in [guitars](/oglasi/muzika/gitare).' WHERE slug = 'drums' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Harmonike za učenike i profesionalce: klavirne i dugmetare, od malih modela sa 48 ili 72 basa do koncertnih sa 120 basova, kao i midi harmonike, koferi i kaiševi. U Srbiji se harmonika mnogo svira, pa je izbor polovnih instrumenata veliki.

Harmoniku isprobajte ton po ton, u oba smera meha: svaki glas treba da se javi čisto i odmah. Razvucite meh i poslušajte da li gubi vazduh, proverite registre i da li dirke i dugmad zapinju. Pomirišite instrument, jer miris vlage ukazuje na loše čuvanje. Štimovanje i popravka glasova su skupi, pa ozbiljniji instrument odnesite majstoru pre kupovine. Prodavci neka navedu marku, broj basova i horova i kada je harmonika štimovana. Učitelje naći ćete među [privatnim časovima](/oglasi/usluge/casovi-i-kursevi), a ostale instrumente u kategorijama [klaviri i klavijature](/oglasi/muzika/klaviri) i [duvački i gudački instrumenti](/oglasi/muzika/duvacki-i-gudacki).', text_en = 'Accordions for pupils and professionals: piano and button accordions, from small models with 48 or 72 basses to concert instruments with 120, plus MIDI accordions, cases and straps. The accordion is widely played in Serbia, so the choice of used instruments is large.

Try an accordion note by note, in both directions of the bellows: every reed should sound cleanly and at once. Open the bellows and listen for air leaks, check the registers and whether the keys and buttons stick. Smell the instrument, because a musty smell points to poor storage. Tuning and reed repairs are expensive, so take a more serious instrument to a repairer before you buy. Sellers should state the brand, the number of basses and reed sets and when the accordion was tuned. Teachers are among [private lessons](/oglasi/usluge/casovi-i-kursevi), and other instruments in [pianos and keyboards](/oglasi/muzika/klaviri) and [wind and string instruments](/oglasi/muzika/duvacki-i-gudacki).' WHERE slug = 'accordions' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Gitare i pojačala: akustične i klasične gitare, električne gitare, bas-gitare, ozvučene akustične gitare, pojačala, pedale i efekti. Vrstu instrumenta birate u filteru, a ponuda pokriva sve, od prve gitare za dete do instrumenata za scenu.

Pogledajte da li je vrat prav i koliko su žice visoko iznad praga, proverite da pragovi nisu istrošeni i da čivije drže štim. Kod akustičnih gitara potražite pukotine na gornjoj ploči i oko kobilice. Električnu gitaru uključite u pojačalo: okrenite sve potenciometre i prekidače i poslušajte da li krče. Cevna pojačala tražite da čujete zagrejana. Prodavci neka navedu marku, model, zemlju proizvodnje i šta je menjano. Časove sviranja nude [privatni profesori](/oglasi/usluge/casovi-i-kursevi), miksete i mikrofoni su u kategoriji [ozvučenje](/oglasi/muzika/ozvucenje), a ritam sekciju upotpunjuju [bubnjevi](/oglasi/muzika/bubnjevi).', text_en = 'Guitars and amplifiers: acoustic and classical guitars, electric guitars, bass guitars, electro-acoustic guitars, amps, pedals and effects. You choose the type of instrument in the filter, and the offer covers everything from a child''s first guitar to instruments for the stage.

See that the neck is straight and how high the strings sit above the frets, check that the frets are not worn and that the tuners hold pitch. On acoustic guitars, look for cracks in the top and around the bridge. Plug an electric guitar into an amp: turn every knob and switch and listen for crackle. Ask to hear valve amps warmed up. Sellers should state the brand, the model, the country of manufacture and what has been changed. Lessons are offered by [private tutors](/oglasi/usluge/casovi-i-kursevi), mixing desks and microphones are in [pro audio](/oglasi/muzika/ozvucenje), and [drums](/oglasi/muzika/bubnjevi) complete the rhythm section.' WHERE slug = 'guitars' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Duvački i gudački instrumenti: violine, viole, violončela i kontrabasi, trube, saksofoni, klarineti, flaute i frule, kao i tambure, gudala, futrole i pribor. Ima instrumenata za muzičku školu, ali i majstorskih, za iskusne svirače.

Violinu birajte u veličini koja odgovara uzrastu: deca kreću sa manjim instrumentima i menjaju ih kako rastu. Pogledajte da li su ploče i vrat bez pukotina, da li su kobilica i duša na mestu i kakvo je gudalo. Kod duvačkih instrumenata proverite da li klapne dobro zatvaraju, da li se ventili kreću lako i ima li udubljenja na cevi. Ozbiljniji instrument neka pre kupovine pogleda profesor ili graditelj. Prodavci neka navedu veličinu, marku ili graditelja i šta ide u kompletu. Druge instrumente naći ćete u kategorijama [harmonike](/oglasi/muzika/harmonike) i [klaviri](/oglasi/muzika/klaviri).', text_en = 'Wind and string instruments: violins, violas, cellos and double basses, trumpets, saxophones, clarinets, flutes and traditional pipes, plus tamburas, bows, cases and accessories. There are instruments for music school, and master-built ones for experienced players.

Choose a violin in the size that suits the player''s age: children start on smaller instruments and change them as they grow. See that the plates and the neck have no cracks, that the bridge and the sound post are in place, and what the bow is like. On wind instruments, check that the pads seal well, that the valves move freely and whether the tubing has dents. Have a more serious instrument looked at by a teacher or a maker before you buy. Sellers should state the size, the brand or maker and what is included. Other instruments are in [accordions](/oglasi/muzika/harmonike) and [pianos](/oglasi/muzika/klaviri).' WHERE slug = 'wind-strings' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Gramofonske ploče, CD i DVD izdanja: LP i singl ploče domaće i strane muzike, od narodne i zabavne do roka i džeza, kolekcionarska izdanja, CD albumi, filmovi i kasete. Kolekcionari ovde prodaju i cele zbirke.

Kod ploča se posebno ocenjuju ploča i omot: tražite fotografije oba i opis stanja po uobičajenoj skali. Ploču pogledajte pod svetlom, jer se tako vide ogrebotine i da li je iskrivljena. Vrednost zavisi od izdanja, pa uporedite kataloški broj, naročito kod prvih tiraža. CD proverite sa donje strane, a kod kompleta da li su svi diskovi i knjižica na broju. Prodavci neka navedu izvođača, izdavača, godinu i stanje. Uređaje za slušanje naći ćete na stranici [gramofoni i hi-fi oprema](/oglasi/elektronika/audio/gramofoni-i-hi-fi), a stare časopise u kategoriji [stripovi i časopisi](/oglasi/knjige/stripovi).', text_en = 'Vinyl records, CDs and DVDs: LPs and singles of local and foreign music, from folk and pop to rock and jazz, collectors'' editions, CD albums, films and cassettes. Collectors sell whole collections here too.

With records, the vinyl and the sleeve are graded separately: ask for photos of both and a description of the condition on the usual scale. Look at the record under a light, because that shows scratches and whether it is warped. The value depends on the pressing, so compare the catalogue number, especially for first pressings. Check a CD from the underside, and with box sets whether all the discs and the booklet are there. Sellers should state the artist, the label, the year and the condition. Players are on the [turntables and hi-fi](/oglasi/elektronika/audio/gramofoni-i-hi-fi) page, and old magazines in [comics and magazines](/oglasi/knjige/stripovi).' WHERE slug = 'records' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Romani, beletristika i ostale knjige: domaći i strani pisci, klasici, krimići, ljubavni i istorijski romani, publicistika, popularna psihologija, kuvari, enciklopedije i knjige za decu. Kućne biblioteke često se rasprodaju u kompletu, po ceni nekoliko knjiga iz knjižare.

Pitajte za izdanje, povez i stanje: da li su korice i rikna celi, ima li podvlačenja, posveta i tragova vlage. Kod kompleta i sabranih dela proverite da li su svi tomovi na broju. Ako kupujete više naslova od istog prodavca, dogovorite jednu poštarinu. Prodavci neka navedu autora, izdavača, godinu i pismo kojim je knjiga štampana. Za đake i studente tu su [udžbenici i lektira](/oglasi/knjige/udzbenici), ljubitelji crtanih priča naći će [stripove](/oglasi/knjige/stripovi), a retka i stara izdanja su među [antikvarnim knjigama](/oglasi/knjige/antikvarne-knjige).', text_en = 'Novels, fiction and other books: local and foreign authors, classics, crime, romance and historical novels, non-fiction, popular psychology, cookbooks, encyclopedias and children''s books. Home libraries are often sold off as a whole, for the price of a few books from a bookshop.

Ask about the edition, the binding and the condition: whether the covers and spine are intact, whether there is underlining, a dedication or traces of damp. With sets and collected works, check that all the volumes are there. If you buy several titles from the same seller, agree on a single postage charge. Sellers should state the author, the publisher, the year and the script the book is printed in. For pupils and students there are [textbooks and set reading](/oglasi/knjige/udzbenici), lovers of illustrated stories will find [comics](/oglasi/knjige/stripovi), and rare and old editions are among [antiquarian books](/oglasi/knjige/antikvarne-knjige).' WHERE slug = 'fiction' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Polovni udžbenici i lektira za osnovnu i srednju školu i fakultet: kompleti po razredima, radne sveske, zbirke zadataka, priručnici za prijemne ispite i stručna literatura. Sa polovnim knjigama školska godina košta znatno manje.

Pre kupovine uporedite izdavača i godinu izdanja sa spiskom koji je dala škola, jer se udžbenici menjaju i ne odgovara svako izdanje. Radne sveske vredi kupiti samo ako nisu popunjene. Kod kompleta pitajte da li su sve knjige na broju i ima li pisanja po njima. Fakultetske udžbenike tražite po tačnom naslovu i autoru koje navodi profesor. Prodavci neka napišu razred, izdavača, godinu i stanje knjiga. Rančeve i pernice naći ćete u kategoriji [školski pribor](/oglasi/deca/skolski-pribor), pomoć oko gradiva nude [privatni časovi](/oglasi/usluge/casovi-i-kursevi), a knjige za čitanje iz zadovoljstva su među [romanima](/oglasi/knjige/beletristika).', text_en = 'Used textbooks and set reading for primary and secondary school and university: sets by school year, workbooks, problem collections, entrance exam guides and specialist literature. With used books the school year costs considerably less.

Before buying, compare the publisher and the year of the edition with the list the school gave, because textbooks change and not every edition will do. Workbooks are worth buying only if they are not filled in. With sets, ask whether all the books are there and whether they have been written in. Look for university textbooks by the exact title and author named by the lecturer. Sellers should state the school year, the publisher, the year and the condition of the books. Backpacks and pencil cases are in [school supplies](/oglasi/deca/skolski-pribor), help with the material comes from [private lessons](/oglasi/usluge/casovi-i-kursevi), and books to read for pleasure are among [novels](/oglasi/knjige/beletristika).' WHERE slug = 'textbooks' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Stripovi i časopisi: Zagor, Tex Viler, Alan Ford, Dilan Dog, Marvel i DC izdanja, mange, stare edicije Zlatne serije i Lunovog magnus stripa, kao i časopisi za decu, muziku, automobile i modu. Kolekcionari traže određene brojeve, pa se dobro prodaju i pojedinačni primerci i kompleti.

Stanje presudno utiče na cenu: tražite fotografije korica, rikne i unutrašnjosti i pitajte ima li iscepanih strana, popunjenih ukrštenica i da li nedostaju posteri ili sličice. Kod starijih edicija proverite broj i godinu, jer reprint vredi mnogo manje od prvog izdanja. Za skuplje primerke dogovorite preuzimanje uživo. Prodavci neka navedu ediciju, brojeve i stanje. Romane i ostale knjige naći ćete u kategoriji [romani i beletristika](/oglasi/knjige/beletristika), ploče i filmove među [pločama, CD i DVD izdanjima](/oglasi/muzika/ploce-i-cd), a značke i sličice u [starom novcu i markama](/oglasi/antikviteti/novac-i-marke).', text_en = 'Comics and magazines: Zagor, Tex Willer, Alan Ford, Dylan Dog, Marvel and DC titles, manga, the old Zlatna Serija and Lunov Magnus Strip series, plus magazines for children and about music, cars and fashion. Collectors look for particular issues, so both single copies and complete runs sell well.

Condition decides the price: ask for photos of the covers, the spine and the inside, and ask whether there are torn pages, filled-in crosswords or missing posters and stickers. With older series, check the issue number and the year, because a reprint is worth far less than a first edition. For more expensive copies, arrange to collect in person. Sellers should state the series, the issue numbers and the condition. Novels and other books are in [novels and fiction](/oglasi/knjige/beletristika), records and films among [vinyl, CDs and DVDs](/oglasi/muzika/ploce-i-cd), and badges and stickers in [old coins and stamps](/oglasi/antikviteti/novac-i-marke).' WHERE slug = 'comics' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Antikvarne i retke knjige: prva izdanja, knjige sa potpisom autora, izdanja štampana pre Drugog svetskog rata, bibliofilska izdanja, stare mape, razglednice i rukopisi. Ponuda je namenjena kolekcionarima, bibliotekama i svima koji vole knjige sa istorijom.

Vrednost stare knjige zavisi od retkosti, izdanja i stanja: važno je da su sve strane, mape i ilustracije na broju i da je povez originalan. Tražite fotografije naslovne strane, impresuma i svih oštećenja. Posveta ili potpis poznatog autora podižu cenu, ali im treba dokaz porekla. Knjige čuvajte dalje od vlage i sunca. Prodavci neka navedu autora, godinu i mesto izdanja, izdavača i opis stanja. Novija izdanja naći ćete među [romanima i beletristikom](/oglasi/knjige/beletristika), stare predmete u kategoriji [antikviteti](/oglasi/antikviteti/stari-predmeti), a slike i grafike među [umetninama](/oglasi/antikviteti/umetnost).', text_en = 'Antiquarian and rare books: first editions, books signed by the author, editions printed before the Second World War, bibliophile editions, old maps, postcards and manuscripts. The offer is meant for collectors, libraries and everyone who loves books with a history.

The value of an old book depends on rarity, edition and condition: all the pages, maps and illustrations should be present and the binding original. Ask for photos of the title page, the imprint and any damage. A dedication or the signature of a famous author raises the price, but needs proof of provenance. Keep books away from damp and sunlight. Sellers should state the author, the year and place of publication, the publisher and a description of the condition. Newer editions are among [novels and fiction](/oglasi/knjige/beletristika), old objects in [antiques](/oglasi/antikviteti/stari-predmeti), and paintings and prints among [works of art](/oglasi/antikviteti/umetnost).' WHERE slug = 'antiquarian-books' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Zlato i srebro za prodaju i otkup: dukati i zlatnici, investicione poluge i pločice, lomljeno zlato, zlatan i srebrn nakit, srebrnina i escajg. Oglase postavljaju i privatna lica i otkupne radnje.

Cena zlata računa se po gramu i finoći: 14-karatno zlato nosi oznaku 585, a čisto, 24-karatno, 999. Pre prodaje ili kupovine pogledajte berzansku cenu toga dana i uporedite više ponuda, jer se otkupne cene razlikuju. Tražite da se predmet izmeri pred vama i proverite žig. Uz poluge i dukate idu sertifikat ili originalno pakovanje. Veće iznose razmenjujte na bezbednom mestu, najbolje u zlatari ili banci. Prodavci neka navedu težinu, finoću i cenu po gramu. Nakit za nošenje naći ćete u kategoriji [nakit](/oglasi/moda/nakit), a stare kovanice u [novcu, markama i značkama](/oglasi/antikviteti/novac-i-marke).', text_en = 'Gold and silver for sale and purchase: ducats and gold coins, investment bars, scrap gold, gold and silver jewellery, silverware and cutlery. Ads are posted by private individuals and by gold buyers alike.

The price of gold is set per gram and by fineness: 14-carat gold is marked 585, and pure 24-carat gold 999. Before selling or buying, look at the market price that day and compare several offers, because buying prices differ. Ask for the item to be weighed in front of you and check the hallmark. Bars and ducats come with a certificate or the original packaging. Exchange larger amounts in a safe place, ideally at a jeweller''s or a bank. Sellers should state the weight, the fineness and the price per gram. Jewellery to wear is in [jewellery](/oglasi/moda/nakit), and old coins in [coins, stamps and badges](/oglasi/antikviteti/novac-i-marke).' WHERE slug = 'gold' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Slike, ikone i umetnička dela: ulja na platnu, akvareli, grafike i crteži, ikone rađene na dasci, skulpture, tapiserije i radovi domaćih umetnika. Uz dela poznatih autora, tu su i radovi mladih slikara koji prodaju direktno kupcima.

Kod dela poznatih autora tražite potvrdu autentičnosti ili podatke o poreklu: gde je slika kupljena i izlagana. Pogledajte potpis, poleđinu platna i ram i pitajte da li je slika restaurirana. Fotografije na dnevnom svetlu, bez blica, najvernije prikazuju boje. Za vrednija dela posavetujte se sa galeristom ili procenjivačem. Prodavci neka navedu autora, tehniku, dimenzije i godinu nastanka. Ramove i ukrase naći ćete u kategoriji [dekoracija](/oglasi/namestaj/dekoracija), stare predmete među [antikvitetima](/oglasi/antikviteti/stari-predmeti), a retke knjige i mape u [antikvarnim knjigama](/oglasi/knjige/antikvarne-knjige).', text_en = 'Paintings, icons and works of art: oils on canvas, watercolours, prints and drawings, icons painted on wood, sculptures, tapestries and works by local artists. Alongside works by well-known names there are pieces by young painters who sell directly to buyers.

For works by well-known artists, ask for a certificate of authenticity or details of the provenance: where the painting was bought and exhibited. Look at the signature, the back of the canvas and the frame, and ask whether the painting has been restored. Photos in daylight, without flash, show the colours most faithfully. For more valuable works, consult a gallerist or an appraiser. Sellers should state the artist, the technique, the dimensions and the year. Frames and ornaments are in [decoration](/oglasi/namestaj/dekoracija), old objects among [antiques](/oglasi/antikviteti/stari-predmeti), and rare books and maps in [antiquarian books](/oglasi/knjige/antikvarne-knjige).' WHERE slug = 'art' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Antikviteti, stari i etno predmeti: stilski nameštaj, zidni i džepni satovi, porcelan i kristal, lampe, radio-aparati, stari alati, ćilimi, nošnje i predmeti iz seoskih domaćinstava. Kolekcionari i ljubitelji starine ovde nalaze komade kojih nema u prodavnicama.

Raspitajte se o poreklu i starosti predmeta i pogledajte žigove, signature i oznake proizvođača. Pitajte šta je restaurirano ili zamenjeno, jer originalni delovi čuvaju vrednost. Stari nameštaj pregledajte na crvotočinu i rasklimane spojeve, a satove na ispravnost mehanizma. Za predmete koji mogu biti kulturno dobro važe posebna pravila o izvozu. Prodavci neka navedu period, materijal, dimenzije i stanje. Slike i ikone su u kategoriji [umetničke slike](/oglasi/antikviteti/umetnost), novac i ordenje među [starim novcem i markama](/oglasi/antikviteti/novac-i-marke), a plemeniti metali u [zlatu i srebru](/oglasi/antikviteti/zlato).', text_en = 'Antiques, old and folk items: period furniture, wall clocks and pocket watches, porcelain and crystal, lamps, radios, old tools, kilims, folk costumes and objects from village households. Collectors and lovers of old things find pieces here that no shop has.

Ask about the origin and age of the item and look at the hallmarks, signatures and maker''s marks. Ask what has been restored or replaced, because original parts keep the value. Inspect old furniture for woodworm and loose joints, and clocks for a working movement. Special export rules apply to items that may be cultural property. Sellers should state the period, the material, the dimensions and the condition. Paintings and icons are in [paintings and art](/oglasi/antikviteti/umetnost), coins and medals among [old coins and stamps](/oglasi/antikviteti/novac-i-marke), and precious metals in [gold and silver](/oglasi/antikviteti/zlato).' WHERE slug = 'antique-items' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Stari novac, marke i značke: kovanice i novčanice Kraljevine Srbije i Jugoslavije, strani novac, poštanske marke i koverte, značke, ordenje, medalje, razglednice, sličice i telefonske kartice.

Vrednost novca i maraka zavisi od retkosti i očuvanosti, pa tražite jasne fotografije obe strane. Kovanice ne čistite, jer čišćenje umanjuje vrednost. Kod maraka su važni zupci, lepak i žig, a kod novčanica da nisu presavijane ni cepane. Uporedite cenu sa katalogom i već prodatim primercima, a skuplje komade dajte na proveru numizmatičaru ili filatelisti, jer ima kopija. Ordenje vredi više sa kutijom i poveljom. Prodavci neka navedu državu, godinu, nominalu i stanje. Zlatnici i dukati su u kategoriji [zlato i srebro](/oglasi/antikviteti/zlato), a stare knjige i razglednice među [antikvarnim knjigama](/oglasi/knjige/antikvarne-knjige).', text_en = 'Old coins, stamps and badges: coins and banknotes of the Kingdom of Serbia and of Yugoslavia, foreign money, postage stamps and covers, badges, orders, medals, postcards, stickers and phone cards.

The value of coins and stamps depends on rarity and condition, so ask for clear photos of both sides. Do not clean coins, because cleaning lowers the value. With stamps, the perforations, the gum and the postmark matter, and banknotes should not be folded or torn. Compare the price with a catalogue and with copies already sold, and have more expensive pieces checked by a numismatist or philatelist, because copies exist. Orders are worth more with the box and the certificate. Sellers should state the country, the year, the denomination and the condition. Gold coins and ducats are in [gold and silver](/oglasi/antikviteti/zlato), and old books and postcards among [antiquarian books](/oglasi/knjige/antikvarne-knjige).' WHERE slug = 'coins-stamps' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Ulaznice i karte za koncerte, festivale, utakmice, pozorište i druge događaje, kao i vaučeri i poklon-kartice. Ovde ih prodaju ljudi koji su sprečeni da odu, a kupuju oni koji su ostali bez karte.

Najpre proverite kod organizatora da li se ulaznica može preneti i da li glasi na ime. Tražite fotografiju karte ili potvrdu o kupovini, ali tako da bar-kod ne bude vidljiv pre plaćanja. Elektronske ulaznice najbezbednije je preuzeti kroz zvanični prenos na vaš nalog, a papirne lično. Čuvajte se cena mnogo viših ili sumnjivo nižih od originalne i ne plaćajte unapred nepoznatom prodavcu. Prodavci neka navedu događaj, datum, sektor i broj karata. Smeštaj za put na koncert ili utakmicu potražite među oglasima za [stan na dan](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/na-dan), a prevoz u kategoriji [selidbe i prevoz](/oglasi/usluge/selidbe-i-prevoz).', text_en = 'Tickets for concerts, festivals, matches, theatre and other events, plus vouchers and gift cards. They are sold here by people who cannot go, and bought by those left without a ticket.

First check with the organiser whether the ticket can be transferred and whether it is issued in a name. Ask for a photo of the ticket or proof of purchase, but with the barcode hidden until you have paid. Electronic tickets are safest to receive through an official transfer to your account, and paper ones in person. Beware of prices far above or suspiciously below the original, and do not pay an unknown seller in advance. Sellers should state the event, the date, the section and the number of tickets. Look for a place to stay for a concert or match trip among the ads for [daily apartment rental](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi/na-dan), and for transport in [removals and transport](/oglasi/usluge/selidbe-i-prevoz).' WHERE slug = 'tickets' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Razno je kategorija za sve što ne pripada nijednoj drugoj: neobični predmeti, kolekcije, pokloni, stvari za poklanjanje i paketi sitnica posle sređivanja kuće ili selidbe.

Pre nego što oglas postavite ovde, pogledajte spisak kategorija: u pravoj kategoriji oglas vidi mnogo više zainteresovanih, jer ga nalaze i kroz filtere. U naslovu napišite šta tačno prodajete, a u opisu stanje, dimenzije i razlog prodaje, uz nekoliko jasnih fotografija. Kupci neka pitaju sve što ih zanima pre dogovora i neka pregledaju stvar pri preuzimanju. Nameštaj i uređaji imaju svoja mesta u kategorijama [nameštaj](/oglasi/namestaj) i [bela tehnika](/oglasi/kucni-aparati), a stari predmeti među [antikvitetima](/oglasi/antikviteti/stari-predmeti).', text_en = 'Miscellaneous is the category for everything that fits no other: unusual objects, collections, gifts, things to give away and bundles of odds and ends after clearing a house or moving.

Before you post an ad here, look through the list of categories: in the right category an ad is seen by far more interested people, because they also find it through the filters. In the title, say exactly what you are selling, and in the description the condition, the dimensions and the reason for selling, with a few clear photos. Buyers should ask everything they want to know before agreeing and inspect the item on collection. Furniture and appliances have their own places in [furniture](/oglasi/namestaj) and [appliances](/oglasi/kucni-aparati), and old objects among [antiques](/oglasi/antikviteti/stari-predmeti).' WHERE slug = 'misc' AND text_sr IS NULL AND text_en IS NULL;

-- Links inside the texts of 017: only where the text is still the one of 017
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Vozila na Place4Market su na jednom mestu: [polovni automobili](/oglasi/vozila/automobili), [motocikli i skuteri](/oglasi/vozila/motocikli), kombiji i kamioni, [prikolice](/oglasi/vozila/prikolice) i čamci, ali i [auto delovi](/oglasi/vozila/auto-delovi), [gume i felne](/oglasi/vozila/gume-i-felne) i oprema. Oglase postavljaju i privatna lica i firme, a filter „Oglašava“ pokazuje koje su ponude direktno od vlasnika.

Pre kupovine uporedite cene sličnih vozila u svom gradu, proverite servisnu knjižicu i registraciju i dogovorite pregled kod mehaničara. Ako prodajete, dodajte jasne fotografije spolja i iznutra, kilometražu i godište: takav oglas se brže prodaje.' WHERE slug = 'vehicles' AND BINARY text_sr = 'Vozila na Place4Market su na jednom mestu: polovni automobili, motocikli i skuteri, kombiji i kamioni, prikolice i čamci, ali i auto delovi, gume i felne i oprema. Oglase postavljaju i privatna lica i firme, a filter „Oglašava“ pokazuje koje su ponude direktno od vlasnika.

Pre kupovine uporedite cene sličnih vozila u svom gradu, proverite servisnu knjižicu i registraciju i dogovorite pregled kod mehaničara. Ako prodajete, dodajte jasne fotografije spolja i iznutra, kilometražu i godište: takav oglas se brže prodaje.';
UPDATE categories SET text_en = 'Vehicles on Place4Market are all in one place: [used cars](/oglasi/vozila/automobili), [motorcycles and scooters](/oglasi/vozila/motocikli), vans and trucks, [trailers](/oglasi/vozila/prikolice) and boats, plus [car parts](/oglasi/vozila/auto-delovi), [tyres, wheels](/oglasi/vozila/gume-i-felne) and accessories. Ads come from private sellers and dealers alike, and the "Advertiser" filter shows which offers come straight from the owner.

Before you buy, compare prices of similar vehicles in your city, check the service book and registration, and arrange an inspection by a mechanic. If you are selling, add clear photos of the outside and inside, the mileage and the year: such ads sell faster.' WHERE slug = 'vehicles' AND BINARY text_en = 'Vehicles on Place4Market are all in one place: used cars, motorcycles and scooters, vans and trucks, trailers and boats, plus car parts, tyres, wheels and accessories. Ads come from private sellers and dealers alike, and the "Advertiser" filter shows which offers come straight from the owner.

Before you buy, compare prices of similar vehicles in your city, check the service book and registration, and arrange an inspection by a mechanic. If you are selling, add clear photos of the outside and inside, the mileage and the year: such ads sell faster.';
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'U kategoriji Nekretnine nalaze se [stanovi](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi), [kuće](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce), [vikendice](/oglasi/nekretnine/vikendice), [placevi](/oglasi/nekretnine/placevi), poslovni prostori, [garaže](/oglasi/nekretnine/garaze) i sobe širom Srbije. Za svaku nekretninu birate vrstu ponude: prodaja, izdavanje ili smeštaj na dan, a za Beograd i Novi Sad i deo grada.

Pre dogovora obiđite nekretninu uživo, proverite list nepokretnosti i da li je objekat uknjižen, a kod izdavanja dogovorite depozit i ugovor. Vlasnici i agencije mogu besplatno da postave oglas sa fotografijama, kvadraturom i cenom.' WHERE slug = 'real-estate' AND BINARY text_sr = 'U kategoriji Nekretnine nalaze se stanovi, kuće, vikendice, placevi, poslovni prostori, garaže i sobe širom Srbije. Za svaku nekretninu birate vrstu ponude: prodaja, izdavanje ili smeštaj na dan, a za Beograd i Novi Sad i deo grada.

Pre dogovora obiđite nekretninu uživo, proverite list nepokretnosti i da li je objekat uknjižen, a kod izdavanja dogovorite depozit i ugovor. Vlasnici i agencije mogu besplatno da postave oglas sa fotografijama, kvadraturom i cenom.';
UPDATE categories SET text_en = 'The Real estate category brings together [apartments](/oglasi/nekretnine/stanovi), [houses](/oglasi/nekretnine/kuce), [weekend cottages](/oglasi/nekretnine/vikendice), [land](/oglasi/nekretnine/placevi), commercial space, [garages](/oglasi/nekretnine/garaze) and rooms across Serbia. For every property you choose the type of offer: sale, long-term rent or daily rent, and in Belgrade and Novi Sad also the district.

Before you agree, view the property in person, check the title deed and whether the building is registered, and for rentals agree on the deposit and a contract. Owners and agencies can post ads with photos, floor area and price for free.' WHERE slug = 'real-estate' AND BINARY text_en = 'The Real estate category brings together apartments, houses, weekend cottages, land, commercial space, garages and rooms across Serbia. For every property you choose the type of offer: sale, long-term rent or daily rent, and in Belgrade and Novi Sad also the district.

Before you agree, view the property in person, check the title deed and whether the building is registered, and for rentals agree on the deposit and a contract. Owners and agencies can post ads with photos, floor area and price for free.';
UPDATE categories SET text_sr = 'Oglasi za posao na Place4Market pokrivaju sve od [posla vozača i dostavljača](/oglasi/posao/vozaci-i-dostava) do [ugostiteljstva](/oglasi/posao/ugostiteljstvo), građevine, prodaje, zdravstva i IT-a. Tu su i [poslovi od kuće](/oglasi/posao/rad-od-kuce), [studentski i honorarni poslovi](/oglasi/posao/studentski-poslovi), kao i sezonski [posao u inostranstvu](/oglasi/posao/posao-u-inostranstvu).

Poslodavci objavljuju oglas besplatno: navedite mesto rada, radno vreme, uslove i način prijave. Kandidatima savetujemo da proveravaju poslodavca i da nikada ne plaćaju unapred za zaposlenje, posebno kod poslova u inostranstvu.' WHERE slug = 'jobs' AND BINARY text_sr = 'Oglasi za posao na Place4Market pokrivaju sve od posla vozača i dostavljača do ugostiteljstva, građevine, prodaje, zdravstva i IT-a. Tu su i poslovi od kuće, studentski i honorarni poslovi, kao i sezonski posao u inostranstvu.

Poslodavci objavljuju oglas besplatno: navedite mesto rada, radno vreme, uslove i način prijave. Kandidatima savetujemo da proveravaju poslodavca i da nikada ne plaćaju unapred za zaposlenje, posebno kod poslova u inostranstvu.';
UPDATE categories SET text_en = 'Job ads on Place4Market cover everything from [driving and delivery](/oglasi/posao/vozaci-i-dostava) to [hospitality](/oglasi/posao/ugostiteljstvo), construction, retail, healthcare and IT. You will also find [remote jobs](/oglasi/posao/rad-od-kuce), [student and part-time work](/oglasi/posao/studentski-poslovi) and seasonal [jobs abroad](/oglasi/posao/posao-u-inostranstvu).

Employers post vacancies for free: state the workplace, working hours, conditions and how to apply. Job seekers should check the employer and never pay upfront for a job, especially for work abroad.' WHERE slug = 'jobs' AND BINARY text_en = 'Job ads on Place4Market cover everything from driving and delivery to hospitality, construction, retail, healthcare and IT. You will also find remote jobs, student and part-time work and seasonal jobs abroad.

Employers post vacancies for free: state the workplace, working hours, conditions and how to apply. Job seekers should check the employer and never pay upfront for a job, especially for work abroad.';
